window.GEAR_BOOK_CONTENTS["book-12"] = [{"id":1,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第十七章：追查偷排管線\n\n一個星期後，環保局的複驗結果，出來了。\n\n「確認超標。」稽查人員站在校長室裡，語氣嚴肅，「排水溝的水樣，重金屬濃度超標六點三倍，pH值四點五。我們已經掌握明確證據，正式立案稽查。」\n\n「立案稽查！」阿釁興奮得差點跳起來，「那工廠……」\n\n「先別急。」稽查人員搖搖頭，「我們已經派人前往『宏遠食品加工廠』稽查。但是……」\n\n「但是什麼？」晴晴緊張地問。\n\n「但是，」稽查人員嘆了一口氣，「對方否認了。」\n\n「否認？！」三個孩子，同時瞪大眼睛。\n\n「工廠的負責人說，」稽查人員的表情凝重，「那條管線，是『很久以前留下的舊管線』，早就沒在使用。他們說，管線裡的廢水，是『以前的殘留』，不是他們排的。」\n\n「騙人！」阿釁氣得跺腳，「那條管線，明明每天都在排！我們有照片！」\n\n「照片，」稽查人員無奈地說，「只能證明管線『存在』。對方說，他們不知道管線連著哪裡，也不知道為什麼會有廢水。因為……」他頓了頓，「管線的源頭，已經被挖掉了。」\n\n「被挖掉了……」晴晴喃喃地重複著。\n\n「這就是為什麼，我們需要更多證據。」稽查人員說，「我們需要證明，『現在』的廢水，是從工廠裡排出來的。而不是……」他搖搖頭，「『以前的殘留』。」\n\n「那我們要怎麼證明？」阿釁問。\n\n「……」稽查人員沒有回答，只是嘆了一口氣。\n\n走出校長室，三個孩子的臉色，都很難看。\n\n「怎麼辦……」阿釁蹲在走廊上，抱住頭，「證據被埋了，工廠又否認……我們是不是，白忙一場了？」\n\n「不會白忙的。」一個輕輕的聲音，從他身後響起。\n\n是未晞。\n\n「未晞……」阿釁抬起頭，「你有辦法？」\n\n「我有一個想法。」未晞走到他們面前，伸出左手腕上的手環，「這個手環，不只是用來倒數的。它……還有別的用途。」\n\n「什麼用途？」晴晴問。\n\n「它能『追蹤』污染源。」未晞說，「只要它接觸過那種廢水，它就能記住那種『味道』，然後……」她閉上眼睛，「帶我們找到，排出它的地方。」\n\n「真的？！」阿釁跳起來，「那我們快去！」\n\n「可是，」阿釁忽然想到什麼，「你怎麼知道，它有這個功能？」\n\n未晞沉默了一下。\n\n「因為……昨天夜裡，我做了一個夢。」她低聲說，「夢裡，有個聲音對我說——『你的手環，不只是來倒數的。它還記得，你來自哪裡。』」\n\n「然後呢？」晴晴問。\n\n「然後我醒來，」未晞說，「發現手環上，多了一個小小的記號。我試著把排水溝的水，靠近它……它就亮了。」\n\n「亮了？」阿釁湊近去看。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，輕輕撫摸著手環上那個淡藍色的記號，「它好像……認得那股『味道』。」\n\n「就像是……」晴晴想了想，「像是狗的鼻子？」\n\n「對。」未晞微微笑了，「就像狗的鼻子。」\n\n「那太好了！」阿釁興奮地搓著手，「我們有『狗的鼻子』了！」\n\n「但是，」未晞的笑容，慢慢收斂，「它每一次『聞』，都會消耗能量。我剩下的時間……可能會更少。」\n\n「……」阿釁和晴晴，沉默了。\n\n「沒關係。」未晞看著他們，語氣溫柔，「只要，能把那條排水溝查清楚……這些時間，就花得值得。」\n\n「可是，」未晞搖搖頭，「它的追蹤範圍，有限。而且……」她低頭，看著手環，「每一次使用，都會消耗能量。」\n\n「消耗能量……」晴晴的心，猛地一沉，「那你的倒數……」\n\n「我知道。」未晞輕輕說，「可是，如果不用它……工廠就會逃掉了。」\n\n「未晞，」晴晴握住她的手，「你真的要……」\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，眼神堅定，「這是我回來的目的。用我的力量，讓這片海……恢復乾淨。就算……」她低頭，聲音輕輕的，「就算要用掉我所有的時間。」\n\n「未晞……」阿釁和晴晴，都沉默了。\n\n「而且，」未晞抬起頭，微微一笑，「我們不是一個人。我們有『守護地球作戰部隊』，有溜溜，還有……」她看向操場的方向，「老巫。」\n\n「老巫？」阿釁愣住。\n\n「嗯。」未晞說，「我們需要一個『力氣很大』的人，來幫我們搬開擋路的東西。」\n\n隔天中午，校長室裡，來了兩位「不速之客」。\n\n「邱校長，久仰久仰！」一個西裝筆挺的中年男人，笑瞇瞇地走進校長室，遞上名片，「我是宏遠食品加工廠的負責人，王富貴。」\n\n「王老闆……」邱校長看著那張名片，表情複雜，「請坐。」\n\n「校長，」王老闆坐下，笑容滿面，「我今天來，主要是想說明一下，關於『排水溝』的事情。」\n\n「哦？」\n\n「都是誤會！」王老闆擺擺手，「那條管線，真的是舊管線！我們工廠，絕對沒有偷排！這些年，我們可是『模範工廠』！」\n\n「模範工廠？」周嚴主任站在一旁，冷冷地開口，「那為什麼，學校後面的排水溝，會被污染？」\n\n「這……」王老闆的笑容，僵了一下，「主任，話不能這樣說啊！我們怎麼知道，是不是別家工廠排的？」\n\n「別家工廠？」周嚴主任盯著他，「那條管線，是從你們工廠的後牆，接出來的。這個，你怎麼解釋？」\n\n「那個啊！」王老闆乾笑兩聲，「那條管線，是二十年前留下的！我們也不知道它連著哪裡！說不定……」他眼珠一轉，「是以前的工廠留下的！」\n\n「你……」阿釁躲在校長室外面的走廊上，透過門縫，聽得氣得握緊拳頭，「睜眼說瞎話！」\n\n「阿釁，小聲一點！」晴晴拉住他。\n\n「總之，」校長室裡，王老闆站起來，語氣裡帶著一股隱隱的威脅，「我們工廠，問心無愧！如果學校方面，堅持要告我們……那我們也只能，請律師來『談一談』了。」\n\n「王老闆，」邱校長沉默了一下，說，「我們不是要告誰。我們只是希望……」\n\n「希望什麼？」王老闆打斷他，笑了笑，「校長，我勸你，還是專心辦學吧。小孩子鬧一鬧，就算了。大人嘛……」他意味深長地看了周嚴主任一眼，「還是別把事情，鬧得太大。」\n\n王老闆走後，校長室裡，沉默了許久。\n\n「校長，」周嚴主任開口，「他……」\n\n「我知道。」邱校長嘆了一口氣，「他想『大事化小』。」\n\n「那我們……」\n\n「證據。」邱校長說，「只要我們有證據，他就『化』不了。」\n\n門外的走廊上，三個孩子，聽完了全程。\n\n「他真的好可惡！」阿釁氣得跺腳，「明明就是他們排的！」\n\n「沒關係。」未晞輕輕說，「他越是否認，我們越要證明。」\n\n第二天，放學後。\n\n「什麼？！要我一起來『追查管線』？！」老巫瞪大眼睛，嘴裡的肉包都忘了嚼，「好啊好啊！我早就想看看那條臭溝的廬山真面目了！」\n\n「老巫，」晴晴壓低聲音，「這件事，可能要跟大人對上。你……」\n\n「怕什麼！」老巫拍著胸脯，「我可是『午餐零浪費突擊隊』的隊長！連全校的剩食都怕我，一條臭溝算什麼！」\n\n「……」阿釁看著老巫那張憨憨的、信心滿滿的臉，忽然覺得，有他在，好像真的安心了不少。\n\n「好！」阿釁大聲說，「『追查管線・最終作戰』，正式開始！全員到齊！」\n\n「到齊！」孩子們齊聲應和。\n\n「那我們的任務分配是——」晴晴攤開地圖，「溜溜，負責空拍！老巫，負責把風和開路！阿釁，負責畫路線圖！我，負責記錄數據！未晞……」\n\n「我，」未晞輕輕說，「負責『追蹤』。」\n\n「好！行動！」\n\n「等等！」出發前，未晞叫住大家。\n\n「怎麼了？」阿釁回頭。\n\n「我們……要做好心理準備。」未晞輕輕說，「如果被發現了，我們可能會被記過、被罰站、被叫家長……甚至，可能會被工廠的人威脅。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「可是，」未晞看著他們，「就算會被處罰，我們也要做。對嗎？」\n\n「對！」阿釁第一個大聲回答，「我們是『守護地球作戰部隊』！」\n\n「對！」晴晴也跟著說。\n\n「我……」老巫猶豫了一下，然後，用力點頭，「我也對！不過……」他摸了摸肚子，「我們能不能，先去買個肉包？我肚子餓了，沒力氣翻牆！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑成一團，緊張的氣氛，一下子消散了不少。\n\n「走吧！」阿釁大手一揮，「路上買！一人一顆！」\n\n「耶！」\n\n於是，四個孩子，加上溜溜，揣著肉包，浩浩蕩蕩地，往工業區的方向出發。\n\n路上，老巫一邊吃著肉包，一邊問：「未晞，你那個手環，真的能找到『排廢水的地方』嗎？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「它記得那股味道。」\n\n「哇！那不就是『未來科技』嗎？」老巫驚嘆，「比我家那條狗還厲害！」\n\n「……」未晞愣了一下，然後，輕輕笑了，「對。比……狗還厲害。」\n\n「未晞，」老巫忽然認真起來，「你到底是從哪裡來的？怎麼什麼都知道？」\n\n未晞的笑容，僵了一下。\n\n「我……」她低下頭，沉默了一會，「我是……從一個很遠的地方來的。」\n\n「很遠？」老巫歪著頭，「比台中還遠嗎？」\n\n「比台中，」未晞輕輕說，「遠很多很多。」\n\n「那不就是……」老巫想了想，「坐飛機要坐很久的那種？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「要坐……很久很久。」\n\n「那一定很累吧！」老巫同情地說，「以後你就住我們家隔壁！我每天分你半顆肉包！」\n\n「……」未晞看著老巫那張憨憨的臉，眼眶，忽然有點熱熱的。\n\n「好。」她低下頭，輕輕地，「那我，就住你們隔壁。」\n\n那天傍晚，夕陽把四個孩子的影子，拉得很長很長。\n\n他們沿著排水溝，一步一步地，往工業區的方向前進。\n\n「溜溜，空中偵察！」阿釁一聲令下。\n\n「嗶嗶！」溜溜騰空而起，電子眼裡射出掃描光線，「偵察開始！前方三百公尺，就是工業區外圍！」\n\n「老巫，前面有一堆雜草擋路！」阿釁指著前方，「交給你！」\n\n「交給我！」老巫捲起袖子，三兩下就把雜草推倒，「過！」\n\n「未晞，」晴晴緊張地看著她，「你的手環……」\n\n「嗯。」未晞伸出左手腕，把手環靠近排水溝的水面，「開始追蹤……」\n\n手環的表面，泛起一層淡淡的藍光。\n\n「……找到了。」過了幾秒，未晞輕輕說，「那股『味道』，還在。它來自……那個方向。」\n\n她指向工業區的深處。\n\n「那邊？」溜溜飛高一看，「那邊是……『宏遠食品加工廠』的後牆！」\n\n「果然是他們！」阿釁握緊拳頭。\n\n「可是，」晴晴皺起眉頭，「他們不是說，管線是『舊的』嗎？我們要怎麼證明，現在還在排？」\n\n「證據，」未晞說，「就在那道牆後面。」\n\n「你是說……」阿釁的眼睛亮起來，「我們要翻進去？」\n\n「我們不能翻。」未晞搖搖頭，「可是……我們可以『看』。」\n\n「看？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞伸手，輕輕按了一下手環，「讓手環，帶我們看看，牆的後面是什麼。」\n\n手環的藍光，忽然明亮起來，在半空中，投影出一片半透明的影像——\n\n影像裡，是宏遠食品加工廠的內部。\n\n工廠後院，有一片用鐵皮圍起來的區域。鐵皮牆的後面，隱隱約約，能看到一台老舊的機器，還在運轉。\n\n機器的一條管子，正源源不絕地，往地下排出黑綠色的液體。\n\n「這是……」孩子們倒抽一口涼氣。\n\n「他們還在排！」阿釁大聲說，「現在！就在排！」\n\n「而且，」未晞的臉色，微微發白，「那台機器，在工廠的『登記設備』裡，並不存在。它是一台……」她低聲說，「藏在鐵皮牆後面，沒有登記的機器。」\n\n「證據！」晴晴的聲音在發抖，「這就是證據！他們『現在』還在排的證據！」\n\n「可是，」阿釁苦著臉，「我們要怎麼讓大人們，也看到這個畫面？」\n\n未晞沉默了。\n\n「溜溜，」過了很久，她開口，「你能……把這個畫面，拍下來嗎？」\n\n「嗶嗶……」溜溜看著那片半透明的投影，「我可以試試看。可是……我的手環……不是，我的鏡頭，可能拍不到『投影』。」\n\n「那就……」未晞低下頭，想了很久很久，然後，她做了一個連晴晴都嚇一跳的決定——\n\n「我們，親眼去看。」\n\n「親眼去看？！」阿釁瞪大眼睛，「你是說……」\n\n「翻過那道鐵皮牆。」未晞說，「親眼看到那台機器、那條管子、那些廢水——然後，拍下來。」\n\n「可是……」晴晴緊張地看著她，「如果被發現……」\n\n「那就被發現吧。」未晞輕輕說，「有些事情，比害怕，更重要。」\n\n「……」阿釁看著未晞那雙堅定的眼睛，深吸一口氣，「好！我們去！」\n\n「可是，鐵皮牆那麼高……」老巫皺著眉頭，「怎麼翻？」\n\n「你忘了嗎？」阿釁拍了拍老巫的肩膀，「我們這裡，有一個『力氣很大』的人！」\n\n「我？！」老巫愣住，然後，眼睛一亮，「你是說……讓我『扛』你們過去？！」\n\n「對！」阿釁點頭，「你當『人梯』！把我們一個一個，扛上去！」\n\n「這……」老巫摩拳擦掌，「這可是我的強項！我扛過全校最重的剩食桶！扛你們三個，綽綽有餘！」\n\n「可是……」晴晴擔心地看著老巫，「老巫，你不知道……」她猶豫了一下，「我們為什麼要這麼拼命。」\n\n「我知道啊！」老巫理直氣壯，「因為我們要保護地球嘛！這個我懂！」\n\n「不是……」晴晴搖搖頭，「我是說，未晞她……」\n\n「晴晴。」未晞打斷她，搖了搖頭。\n\n「……」晴晴沉默了一下，最後，嘆了一口氣，「算了。總之，我們小心一點。」\n\n「好！」老巫蹲下來，拍拍肩膀，「來！上！」\n\n於是，那天傍晚，在宏遠食品加工廠的鐵皮牆外，出現了這樣一幕——\n\n老巫蹲在牆邊，充當「人梯」；阿釁踩著老巫的肩膀，翻過鐵皮牆；然後，晴晴、未晞，一個接著一個，翻進了工廠後院。\n\n「慢一點！」阿釁壓低聲音，「小心那台機器！」\n\n「看到了……」晴晴舉起手機，顫抖著，對著那台機器，「那台機器……真的在排！」\n\n「黑綠色的液體……」未晞看著那條管子，「跟排水溝裡的水，一模一樣。」\n\n「拍到了！」晴晴的手機，響起清脆的快門聲，「我拍到了！那台機器、那條管子、那些廢水……全都拍到了！」\n\n「太好了！」阿釁鬆了一口氣，「我們終於……」\n\n「嗶嗶嗶嗶——！！！」\n\n忽然，一陣刺耳的警報聲，劃破了工廠後院的寂靜！\n\n「警報！」溜溜驚慌地大叫，「有保全！他們啟動了保全系統！」\n\n「快跑！」阿釁大喊，「原路返回！」\n\n孩子們慌慌張張地，往鐵皮牆的方向衝。\n\n可是，鐵皮牆的另一頭，一道強烈的手電筒光，已經照了過來！\n\n「誰在那裡？！」一個粗啞的聲音，大喊著，「給我站住！」\n\n「糟了！」晴晴的臉色，瞬間慘白。\n\n「別怕！」老巫一把抓住鐵皮牆，「快！爬上去！我來擋住他們！」\n\n「老巫！」阿釁大喊。\n\n「快！」老巫吼著，「別浪費時間！我扛你們上去！快！」\n\n孩子們踩著老巫的肩膀，一個一個，翻過鐵皮牆。\n\n「老巫！」阿釁在牆的另一頭大喊，「你快上來！」\n\n「我……」老巫回頭，看了一眼那道越來越近的手電筒光，「我……我來不及了！」\n\n「老巫！！！」\n\n「別管我！」老巫大聲喊，「你們先跑！證據要護好！」\n\n「可是……」\n\n「快跑！！！」\n\n孩子們的眼眶，一下子紅了。\n\n「老巫……」阿釁咬著牙，「你等著！我們一定會回來救你！」\n\n「嗶嗶！」溜溜一個翻身，衝了回去，「我留下來！我跑得快！我來帶老巫跑！」\n\n「溜溜！」\n\n「走！！！」\n\n阿釁、晴晴、未晞，三個人，帶著手機裡的證據，沒命地，往學校的方向狂奔。\n\n身後，工廠的警報聲，還在響著。\n\n那一夜，三個孩子，在器材室裡，等到天黑。\n\n「老巫……溜溜……」阿釁紅著眼眶，「他們……他們不會有事吧？」\n\n「不會的。」未晞的聲音，微微顫抖，「溜溜跑得那麼快……牠一定……」\n\n「可是，」晴晴的聲音也帶著哭腔，「如果老巫被抓到了……」\n\n「他不會被抓到的。」未晞握緊拳頭，「因為，溜溜會保護他。就像……」她低下頭，「就像我們保護地球一樣。」\n\n夜，越來越深。\n\n器材室裡的燈，一直亮著。\n\n直到深夜十一點——\n\n「嗶嗶嗶嗶！！！」\n\n一道銀白色的身影，從通風管裡，衝了進來！\n\n「溜溜！」三個孩子，同時跳起來，「老巫呢？！」\n\n「嗶嗶……嗶嗶……」溜溜喘著氣，電子眼裡，卻閃爍著興奮的光芒，「他……他沒事！我們……我們把他們甩掉了！」\n\n「老巫沒被抓到？！」阿釁的眼淚，一下子湧了上來，「太好了……太好了！」\n\n「可是，」溜溜喘著氣，「老巫現在，躲在工業區外面的草叢裡，不敢動。他說……」溜溜的電子眼，閃了閃，「他說，『你們先走，我殿後！我一個吃貨，他們不會懷疑我的！』」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們又哭又笑，「這個笨蛋！」\n\n「溜溜，你們是怎麼逃出來的？」晴晴緊張地問。\n\n「嗶嗶……」溜溜喘著氣，開始敘述，「我被保全追著跑，跑了半圈，繞到工廠後面的雜草堆……」\n\n「然後？」\n\n「然後，」溜溜的電子眼裡，閃過一抹得意，「我看到老巫，正蹲在雜草堆裡，咬著一個肉包，一動不動。」\n\n「他還有心情吃肉包？！」阿釁瞪大眼睛。\n\n「他說，」溜溜模仿老巫的語氣，「『吃飽了，才有力氣跑！』」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們又笑又氣。\n\n「後來，」溜溜繼續說，「保全的手電筒照過來，老巫忽然站起來，張開雙臂，對著保全大喊——『同志！我是路過的！』」\n\n「路過的？！」\n\n「對！」溜溜點頭，「然後，他就一路狂奔，往學校的方向跑！保全追了兩條街，最後，大概是被他的體重嚇到了，就放棄了。」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑得眼淚都出來了，「老巫！你真是……」\n\n「嗶嗶……」溜溜的聲音，卻忽然低了下去，「不過……我在逃跑的時候，看到了一些東西。」\n\n「什麼？」\n\n「我看到，」溜溜說，「那台機器，在我們跑掉之後……被他們，用最快的速度，拆掉了。」\n\n「拆掉了？！」孩子們的心，猛地一沉。\n\n「嗯。」溜溜點頭，「連鐵皮牆，都整個拆掉了。現在……那台機器，已經不存在了。」\n\n「那我們拍到的證據……」晴晴顫抖著說，「豈不是……」\n\n「沒有用。」未晞輕輕說，「機器沒了，證據就沒了。」\n\n器材室裡，一片寂靜。\n\n「……沒關係。」過了很久，未晞開口了，聲音輕輕的，卻異常堅定，「我們還有別的辦法。」\n\n「什麼辦法？」阿釁問。\n\n「我記得，」未晞說，「那台機器的『味道』。手環，也記得。只要……」她低頭，看著自己的手環，「我還有能量，我們就還有機會。」\n\n「未晞……」晴晴看著她，「你的手環……」\n\n「十五天。」未晞輕輕說，「夠了。」\n\n「夠了……」阿釁喃喃地重複著，然後，他用力點頭，「對！夠了！十五天，夠我們抓到那條管線的『真兇』！」\n\n月光，靜靜地，照在器材室的窗戶上。\n\n四個孩子，加上溜溜，在夜色裡，默默地，許下了同一個心願——\n\n「一定要，讓那條排水溝，恢復清澈。」\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 17: Tracing the Illegal Discharge Pipe\n\nA week later, the environmental protection bureau's re-test results came out.\n\n\"Confirmed over the limit.\" The inspector stood in the principal's office, his tone serious, \"The drainage ditch water sample shows heavy metal concentration at 6.3 times the limit, pH 4.5. We have solid evidence and have officially opened a case.\"\n\n\"Opened a case!\" A-Xin was so excited he nearly jumped, \"So the factory...\"\n\n\"Not so fast.\" The inspector shook his head, \"We've sent people to inspect 'Hongyuan Food Processing Factory.' But...\"\n\n\"But what?\" Qingqing asked nervously.\n\n\"But,\" the inspector sighed, \"they denied it.\"\n\n\"Denied it?!\" The three children's eyes went wide at the same time.\n\n\"The factory's owner said,\" the inspector's expression was grave, \"that pipe is an 'old pipe left from long ago,' and hasn't been in use for ages. They said the wastewater in the pipe was 'residue from before,' not something they discharged.\"\n\n\"Liar!\" A-Xin stamped his foot in anger, \"That pipe was discharging every single day! We have photos!\"\n\n\"Photos,\" the inspector said helplessly, \"can only prove the pipe 'existed.' They say they don't know where the pipe connects, or why there was wastewater in it. Because...\" he paused, \"the source of the pipe has already been dug out.\"\n\n\"Dug out...\" Qingqing murmured in repetition.\n\n\"That's why we need more evidence.\" The inspector said, \"We need to prove that the wastewater 'now' is being discharged from inside the factory. Not...\" he shook his head, \"'residue from before.'\"\n\n\"Then how do we prove it?\" A-Xin asked.\n\n\"...\" The inspector didn't answer, only sighed.\n\nWalking out of the principal's office, the three children's faces were grim.\n\n\"What do we do...\" A-Xin crouched in the hallway, clutching his head, \"The evidence is buried, the factory denies everything... did we work for nothing?\"\n\n\"It won't be for nothing.\" A soft voice sounded from behind him.\n\nIt was Weixi.\n\n\"Weixi...\" A-Xin looked up, \"Do you have a way?\"\n\n\"I have an idea.\" Weixi walked in front of them, extending the bracelet on her left wrist, \"This bracelet isn't just for counting down. It... has other uses.\"\n\n\"What uses?\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"It can 'track' the source of pollution.\" Weixi said, \"As long as it has touched that kind of wastewater, it can remember that 'smell,' and then...\" she closed her eyes, \"lead us to the place that discharges it.\"\n\n\"Really?!\" A-Xin jumped up, \"Then let's go!\"\n\n\"But,\" A-Xin suddenly thought of something, \"how do you know it has this function?\"\n\nWeixi was silent for a moment.\n\n\"Because... last night, I had a dream.\" she said in a low voice, \"In the dream, a voice said to me—'Your bracelet isn't just for counting down. It also remembers where you came from.'\"\n\n\"And then?\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"Then I woke up,\" Weixi said, \"and found a small mark on the bracelet. I tried bringing the drainage ditch water near it... and it lit up.\"\n\n\"It lit up?\" A-Xin leaned in to look.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, gently stroking the pale blue mark on the bracelet, \"It seems to... recognize that 'smell.'\"\n\n\"It's like...\" Qingqing thought for a moment, \"a dog's nose?\"\n\n\"Yes.\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"Just like a dog's nose.\"\n\n\"Then that's wonderful!\" A-Xin rubbed his hands excitedly, \"We have a 'dog's nose'!\"\n\n\"But,\" Weixi's smile slowly faded, \"every time it 'sniffs,' it consumes energy. The time I have left... may become even less.\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin and Qingqing fell silent.\n\n\"It's okay.\" Weixi looked at them, her tone gentle, \"As long as we can get to the bottom of that drainage ditch... this time is well spent.\"\n\n\"But,\" Weixi shook her head, \"its tracking range is limited. And...\" she lowered her head, looking at the bracelet, \"every use consumes energy.\"\n\n\"Consumes energy...\" Qingqing's heart sank, \"then your countdown...\"\n\n\"I know.\" Weixi said softly, \"But if we don't use it... the factory will get away.\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing took her hand, \"are you really going to...\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, her eyes resolute, \"This is the purpose of my return. Using my power to make this sea... clean again. Even if...\" she lowered her head, her voice soft, \"even if it takes all the time I have.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" A-Xin and Qingqing both fell silent.\n\n\"And,\" Weixi looked up and smiled, \"we're not alone. We have the 'Protect Earth Operations Unit,' we have Liu-Liu, and...\" she looked toward the playground, \"Old Wu.\"\n\n\"Old Wu?\" A-Xin froze.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi said, \"We need someone 'very strong' to help us move the obstacles out of the way.\"\n\nThe next day at noon, two \"unexpected visitors\" arrived at the principal's office.\n\n\"Principal Qiu, it's a pleasure!\" A middle-aged man in a tailored suit walked into the office with a smile, handing over a business card, \"I'm Wang Fugui, the head of Hongyuan Food Processing Factory.\"\n\n\"Mr. Wang...\" Principal Qiu looked at the business card, his expression complex, \"please, have a seat.\"\n\n\"Principal,\" Wang sat down, all smiles, \"I'm here today mainly to explain the matter of the 'drainage ditch.'\"\n\n\"Oh?\"\n\n\"All a misunderstanding!\" Wang waved his hand, \"That pipe really is an old pipe! Our factory absolutely does not secretly discharge! These years, we've been a 'model factory'!\"\n\n\"A model factory?\" Dean Zhou stood to the side, speaking coldly, \"Then why has the drainage ditch behind the school been polluted?\"\n\n\"This...\" Wang's smile stiffened, \"Dean, you can't say that! How do we know it wasn't another factory?\"\n\n\"Another factory?\" Dean Zhou stared at him, \"That pipe connects out from behind your factory's back wall. How do you explain that?\"\n\n\"That!\" Wang forced a dry laugh, \"That pipe was left over from twenty years ago! We don't know where it connects either! Maybe...\" his eyes darted, \"it was left by a factory that used to be there!\"\n\n\"You...\" A-Xin hid in the hallway outside the principal's office, listening through the crack in the door, clenching his fists in anger, \"blatant lies!\"\n\n\"A-Xin, keep it down!\" Qingqing pulled him back.\n\n\"In any case,\" in the principal's office, Wang stood up, a veiled threat in his tone, \"our factory has a clear conscience! If the school insists on suing us... then we'll have no choice but to have our lawyers 'talk' about it.\"\n\n\"Mr. Wang,\" Principal Qiu was silent for a moment, then said, \"we're not trying to sue anyone. We just hope...\"\n\n\"Hope what?\" Wang interrupted him, smiling, \"Principal, I advise you to focus on running the school. Let the children's games be games. As for the adults...\" he gave Dean Zhou a meaningful look, \"it's better not to make things too big.\"\n\nAfter Wang left, the principal's office was silent for a long time.\n\n\"Principal,\" Dean Zhou spoke, \"he...\"\n\n\"I know.\" Principal Qiu sighed, \"He wants to 'sweep it under the rug.'\"\n\n\"Then we...\"\n\n\"Evidence.\" Principal Qiu said, \"As long as we have evidence, he can't sweep it away.\"\n\nIn the hallway outside, the three children had heard everything.\n\n\"He's really awful!\" A-Xin stamped his foot, \"It's obviously them discharging!\"\n\n\"It's okay.\" Weixi said softly, \"The more he denies it, the more we need to prove it.\"\n\nThe next day, after school.\n\n\"What?! You want me to come along to 'track the pipe'?!\" Old Wu's eyes went wide, forgetting to chew the pork bun in his mouth, \"Sure, sure! I've long wanted to see what that stinky ditch really looks like!\"\n\n\"Old Wu,\" Qingqing lowered her voice, \"this matter might involve confronting adults. Are you...\"\n\n\"What's there to be afraid of!\" Old Wu patted his chest, \"I'm the captain of the 'Zero-Leftover Lunch Raid Squad'! Even the whole school's leftover food is afraid of me—a stinky ditch is nothing!\"\n\n\"...\" Looking at Old Wu's honest, confident face, A-Xin suddenly felt much more at ease with him around.\n\n\"Great!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"'Track the Pipe · Final Operation' officially begins! Everyone present!\"\n\n\"Present!\" The children responded in unison.\n\n\"Then our mission assignments are—\" Qingqing spread out the map, \"Liu-Liu, aerial reconnaissance! Old Wu, standing watch and clearing the way! A-Xin, drawing the route map! Me, recording the data! Weixi...\"\n\n\"I,\" Weixi said softly, \"will 'track.'\"\n\n\"Great! Move out!\"\n\n\"Wait!\" Before setting off, Weixi called everyone back.\n\n\"What's wrong?\" A-Xin turned around.\n\n\"We... need to be mentally prepared.\" Weixi said softly, \"If we get caught, we might get demerits, detention, parents called in... even threatened by the factory people.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"But,\" Weixi looked at them, \"even if we get punished, we still have to do it. Right?\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin was the first to answer loudly, \"We're the 'Protect Earth Operations Unit'!\"\n\n\"Right!\" Qingqing followed.\n\n\"I...\" Old Wu hesitated, then nodded hard, \"I'm with you too! But...\" he patted his belly, \"can we buy a pork bun first? I'm hungry, and I won't have the strength to climb walls!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children burst into laughter, and the tense atmosphere instantly dispersed.\n\n\"Let's go!\" A-Xin waved his hand grandly, \"We'll buy some on the way! One for each!\"\n\n\"Yay!\"\n\nAnd so, the four children, plus Liu-Liu, carrying pork buns, set out in a grand procession toward the industrial zone.\n\nOn the way, Old Wu munched on his pork bun and asked: \"Weixi, can that bracelet of yours really find 'where the wastewater is discharged'?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"It remembers that smell.\"\n\n\"Wow! Isn't that 'future technology'?\" Old Wu marveled, \"Even better than our dog!\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi froze for a moment, then smiled softly, \"Yes. Even better than... a dog.\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" Old Wu suddenly turned serious, \"where are you actually from? How do you know everything?\"\n\nWeixi's smile stiffened.\n\n\"I...\" she lowered her head, silent for a moment, \"I'm from... a very faraway place.\"\n\n\"Far away?\" Old Wu tilted his head, \"Farther than Taichung?\"\n\n\"Much, much farther than Taichung,\" Weixi said softly.\n\n\"Then that means...\" Old Wu thought for a moment, \"the kind of place you have to fly a very long time to reach?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"A very, very long time.\"\n\n\"That must be so tiring!\" Old Wu said sympathetically, \"Then you should live next door to us! I'll share half a pork bun with you every day!\"\n\n\"...\" Looking at Old Wu's honest face, Weixi's eyes suddenly felt a little hot.\n\n\"Alright.\" She lowered her head, softly, \"Then I'll live next door to you.\"\n\nThat evening, the setting sun stretched the four children's shadows very, very long.\n\nThey walked along the drainage ditch, step by step, toward the industrial zone.\n\n\"Liu-Liu, aerial reconnaissance!\" A-Xin commanded.\n\n\"Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu soared into the air, scanning beams shooting from its electronic eyes, \"Reconnaissance begins! Three hundred meters ahead is the edge of the industrial zone!\"\n\n\"Old Wu, there's a clump of weeds blocking the way ahead!\" A-Xin pointed forward, \"You handle it!\"\n\n\"Leave it to me!\" Old Wu rolled up his sleeves and pushed the weeds down with a few sweeps, \"Clear!\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing looked at her nervously, \"your bracelet...\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi extended her left wrist, bringing the bracelet close to the surface of the drainage ditch water, \"Beginning to track...\"\n\nA faint blue light rippled across the bracelet's surface.\n\n\"...Found it.\" After a few seconds, Weixi said softly, \"That 'smell' is still there. It comes from... that direction.\"\n\nShe pointed into the depths of the industrial zone.\n\n\"Over there?\" Liu-Liu flew higher to look, \"Over there is... the back wall of 'Hongyuan Food Processing Factory'!\"\n\n\"It really is them!\" A-Xin clenched his fist.\n\n\"But,\" Qingqing frowned, \"didn't they say the pipe is 'old'? How do we prove it's still discharging now?\"\n\n\"The evidence,\" Weixi said, \"is behind that wall.\"\n\n\"You mean...\" A-Xin's eyes lit up, \"we climb over?\"\n\n\"We can't climb over.\" Weixi shook her head, \"But... we can 'see.'\"\n\n\"See?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi reached out and gently pressed the bracelet, \"Let the bracelet show us what's behind the wall.\"\n\nThe bracelet's blue light suddenly grew bright, projecting a translucent image in midair—\n\nInside it was the interior of Hongyuan Food Processing Factory.\n\nIn the factory's backyard was an area enclosed by iron sheeting. Behind the iron wall, an old machine could be faintly seen, still running.\n\nA pipe from the machine was steadily discharging blackish-green liquid into the ground.\n\n\"This is...\" The children gasped.\n\n\"They're still discharging!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"Right now! This very moment!\"\n\n\"And,\" Weixi's face turned slightly pale, \"that machine doesn't exist in the factory's 'registered equipment.' It's a...\" she said in a low voice, \"machine hidden behind the iron wall, never registered.\"\n\n\"Evidence!\" Qingqing's voice was trembling, \"This is the evidence! Proof that they're 'still' discharging!\"\n\n\"But,\" A-Xin grimaced, \"how do we get the adults to see this image?\"\n\nWeixi fell silent.\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" after a long moment, she spoke, \"can you... photograph this image?\"\n\n\"Beep beep...\" Liu-Liu looked at that translucent projection, \"I can try. But... my camera might not be able to capture a 'projection.'\"\n\n\"Then...\" Weixi lowered her head, thinking for a very, very long time, and then she made a decision that even startled Qingqing—\n\n\"We'll go see it with our own eyes.\"\n\n\"See it with our own eyes?!\" A-Xin's eyes went wide, \"You mean...\"\n\n\"Climb over that iron wall.\" Weixi said, \"See that machine, that pipe, that wastewater with our own eyes—and photograph it.\"\n\n\"But...\" Qingqing looked at her nervously, \"what if we get caught...\"\n\n\"Then so be it.\" Weixi said softly, \"Some things matter more than fear.\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin looked at Weixi's resolute eyes and took a deep breath, \"Alright! Let's go!\"\n\n\"But, that iron wall is so high...\" Old Wu frowned, \"how do we get over?\"\n\n\"Have you forgotten?\" A-Xin patted Old Wu's shoulder, \"We have someone here who's 'very strong'!\"\n\n\"Me?!\" Old Wu froze, then his eyes lit up, \"You mean... I carry you all over?!\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin nodded, \"You're the 'human ladder'! Hoist us up one by one!\"\n\n\"This...\" Old Wu rubbed his hands, \"This is my specialty! I've carried the heaviest leftover food barrel in the school! Carrying the three of you is nothing!\"\n\n\"But...\" Qingqing looked at Old Wu worriedly, \"Old Wu, you don't know...\" she hesitated, \"why we're trying so hard.\"\n\n\"I know!\" Old Wu declared with full confidence, \"Because we have to protect the Earth! I get that!\"\n\n\"No...\" Qingqing shook her head, \"I mean, Weixi, she...\"\n\n\"Qingqing.\" Weixi interrupted her, shaking her head.\n\n\"...\" Qingqing was silent for a moment, then sighed, \"Forget it. Anyway, let's be careful.\"\n\n\"Alright!\" Old Wu crouched down and patted his shoulders, \"Come on! Up you go!\"\n\nAnd so, that evening, outside the iron wall of Hongyuan Food Processing Factory, this scene appeared—\n\nOld Wu crouched by the wall, serving as the \"human ladder\"; A-Xin stepped on Old Wu's shoulder and climbed over the iron wall; then Qingqing and Weixi, one after another, climbed into the factory's backyard.\n\n\"Slow down!\" A-Xin lowered his voice, \"Watch out for that machine!\"\n\n\"Got it...\" Qingqing raised her phone, trembling, aiming it at the machine, \"that machine... is really discharging!\"\n\n\"The blackish-green liquid...\" Weixi looked at that pipe, \"exactly the same as the water in the drainage ditch.\"\n\n\"Photographed!\" Qingqing's phone sounded with a crisp shutter click, \"I got it! That machine, that pipe, that wastewater... all photographed!\"\n\n\"Great!\" A-Xin breathed a sigh of relief, \"We finally...\"\n\n\"BEEP BEEP BEEP—!!!\"\n\nSuddenly, a piercing alarm split the silence of the factory backyard!\n\n\"Alarm!\" Liu-Liu shouted in panic, \"There are guards! They've activated the security system!\"\n\n\"Run!\" A-Xin shouted, \"Back the way we came!\"\n\nThe children scrambled toward the iron wall in a panic.\n\nBut on the other side of the iron wall, a strong flashlight beam was already shining over!\n\n\"Who's there?!\" A hoarse voice shouted, \"Stop right there!\"\n\n\"Oh no!\" Qingqing's face instantly turned deathly pale.\n\n\"Don't be afraid!\" Old Wu grabbed the iron wall, \"Quick! Climb up! I'll hold them off!\"\n\n\"Old Wu!\" A-Xin shouted.\n\n\"Go!\" Old Wu roared, \"Don't waste time! I'll hoist you up! Go!\"\n\nThe children stepped on Old Wu's shoulders, one by one, climbing over the iron wall.\n\n\"Old Wu!\" A-Xin shouted from the other side of the wall, \"Hurry up and come up!\"\n\n\"I...\" Old Wu looked back at the flashlight beam growing closer and closer, \"I... I can't make it!\"\n\n\"Old Wu!!!\"\n\n\"Never mind me!\" Old Wu shouted loudly, \"You run first! Protect the evidence!\"\n\n\"But—\"\n\n\"RUN!!!\"\n\nThe children's eyes turned red instantly.\n\n\"Old Wu...\" A-Xin gritted his teeth, \"You wait! We'll definitely come back for you!\"\n\n\"Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu flipped around and dashed back, \"I'm staying! I'm fast! I'll lead Old Wu out!\"\n\n\"Liu-Liu!\"\n\n\"GO!!!\"\n\nA-Xin, Qingqing, and Weixi, three people, clutching the evidence in the phone, ran desperately toward the school.\n\nBehind them, the factory's alarm still blared.\n\nThat night, the three children waited in the equipment room until dark.\n\n\"Old Wu... Liu-Liu...\" A-Xin's eyes were red, \"they... they'll be okay, right?\"\n\n\"They will.\" Weixi's voice trembled slightly, \"Liu-Liu runs so fast... it will definitely...\"\n\n\"But,\" Qingqing's voice was choked too, \"what if Old Wu gets caught...\"\n\n\"He won't get caught.\" Weixi clenched her fist, \"Because Liu-Liu will protect him. Just like...\" she lowered her head, \"just like we're protecting the Earth.\"\n\nThe night grew deeper and deeper.\n\nThe light in the equipment room stayed on the whole time.\n\nUntil eleven o'clock at night—\n\n\"BEEP BEEP BEEP BEEP!!!\"\n\nA silver-white figure burst in through the ventilation duct!\n\n\"Liu-Liu!\" The three children jumped up at the same time, \"Where's Old Wu?!\"\n\n\"Beep beep... beep beep...\" Liu-Liu panted, but excitement flickered in its electronic eyes, \"he... he's fine! We... we shook them off!\"\n\n\"Old Wu didn't get caught?!\" A-Xin's tears welled up instantly, \"Great... that's great...\"\n\n\"But,\" Liu-Liu panted, \"Old Wu is now hiding in the grass outside the industrial zone, not daring to move. He said...\" Liu-Liu's electronic eyes flickered, \"he said, 'You guys go first, I'll cover the rear! I'm just a foodie—they won't suspect me!'\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed and cried at once, \"This idiot!\"\n\n\"Liu-Liu, how did you two escape?\" Qingqing asked nervously.\n\n\"Beep beep...\" Liu-Liu panted and began its account, \"I was chased by the guard, ran half a circle, and circled around to the weed pile behind the factory...\"\n\n\"Then?\"\n\n\"Then,\" a hint of smugness flickered in Liu-Liu's electronic eyes, \"I saw Old Wu, crouching in the weed pile, chewing a pork bun, completely still.\"\n\n\"He's still in the mood for a pork bun?!\" A-Xin's eyes went wide.\n\n\"He said,\" Liu-Liu imitated Old Wu's tone, \"'Eat your fill, then you'll have the strength to run!'\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed and fumed at the same time.\n\n\"Later,\" Liu-Liu continued, \"when the guard's flashlight shone over, Old Wu suddenly stood up, spread his arms wide, and shouted at the guard—'Officer! I'm just passing by!'\"\n\n\"Just passing by?!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" Liu-Liu nodded, \"And then he ran all the way toward the school! The guard chased him for two streets, and finally, probably scared off by his weight, gave up.\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed until tears came out, \"Old Wu! You really are...\"\n\n\"Beep beep...\" Liu-Liu's voice, however, suddenly dropped low, \"But... while I was running away, I saw some things.\"\n\n\"What?\"\n\n\"I saw,\" Liu-Liu said, \"that machine, after we ran off... was dismantled by them at top speed.\"\n\n\"Dismantled?!\" The children's hearts sank.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Liu-Liu nodded, \"Even the iron wall was completely dismantled. Now... that machine no longer exists.\"\n\n\"Then the evidence we photographed...\" Qingqing said trembling, \"wouldn't it...\"\n\n\"Be useless.\" Weixi said softly, \"The machine's gone, so the evidence is gone.\"\n\nThe equipment room fell into silence.\n\n\"...It's okay.\" After a long moment, Weixi spoke, her voice soft yet exceptionally resolute, \"We still have another way.\"\n\n\"What way?\" A-Xin asked.\n\n\"I remember,\" Weixi said, \"the 'smell' of that machine. The bracelet remembers it too. As long as...\" she lowered her head, looking at her bracelet, \"I still have energy, we still have a chance.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" Qingqing looked at her, \"your bracelet...\"\n\n\"Fifteen days.\" Weixi said softly, \"Enough.\"\n\n\"Enough...\" A-Xin murmured in repetition, then nodded hard, \"Yes! Enough! Fifteen days is enough for us to catch the real culprit behind that pipe!\"\n\nThe moonlight shone quietly on the equipment room window.\n\nThe four children, plus Liu-Liu, silently made the same wish in the night—\n\n\"We will definitely make that drainage ditch clear again.\"\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":2,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第十八章：真相大白\n\n接下來的兩天，未晞用手環的「追蹤」能力，帶著大家，一點一點地，拼湊出工廠的秘密排放路線。\n\n「這條管線，繞過工廠的鐵皮牆，穿過雜草，一路通到……」未晞閉著眼睛，手環散發著淡藍色的光芒，「排水溝的入海口。」\n\n「入海口？」阿釁瞪大眼睛，「那不就是……」\n\n「就是我們淨灘的那片海。」晴晴說。\n\n「未晞，你今天已經用了三次了……」第一天傍晚，晴晴擔心地說，「休息一下吧？」\n\n「沒關係，」未晞搖搖頭，「我還能……」\n\n她的話，忽然停住，身體微微一晃。\n\n「未晞！」晴晴扶住她，「你臉色好白！」\n\n「我……我沒事的……」未晞勉強擠出笑容，「只是……手環的能量，消耗得有點快……」\n\n「那我們明天再繼續！」阿釁緊張地說，「今天就到這裡！」\n\n「不行……」未晞搖搖頭，「那條新管線，一直在移動……如果今天不追到它的源頭，明天……」\n\n「明天怎麼了？」\n\n「明天，」未晞低聲說，「它可能又會換地方了。」\n\n「那……那我們……」阿釁急得直跺腳。\n\n「我撐得住。」未晞的語氣，異常堅定，「我們繼續。」\n\n第二天，未晞的手環，藍光已經變得有些暗淡了。\n\n「未晞……」晴晴握著她的手，心裡，湧起一股說不上來的不安。\n\n「我沒事的。」未晞微微一笑，「我們快找到了。再一下下……」\n\n「再一下下」這句話，成了那一天，未晞說得最多的一句話。\n\n「他們換了一條路，」未晞輕輕說，「繞過舊管線的位置，改用新的路線排放。這樣，就算我們找到舊管線，也……」\n\n「也證明不了他們現在還在排。」阿釁咬牙切齒，「這個王老闆，也太狡猾了！」\n\n「沒關係。」未晞安慰大家，「只要手環還記得那股味道，我們就能……」\n\n她的話，忽然停住了。\n\n「未晞？」晴晴發現她的異樣，「你怎麼了？」\n\n「我……」未晞的臉色，瞬間變得蒼白，身體搖搖晃晃，「我……」\n\n「未晞！！」阿釁衝過去扶住她，「你怎麼了？！」\n\n「我的……頭……」未晞虛弱地扶著額頭，「好暈……好像……有什麼東西……在叫我……」\n\n「在叫你？」孩子們面面相覷。\n\n「是……」未晞的瞳孔，忽然失焦，「是『未來』……」\n\n「未晞！」晴晴大喊，「你看我！看著我！」\n\n「我……」未晞搖搖晃晃地，彷彿隨時都會倒下，「我好像……快要……」\n\n「快要什麼？」阿釁緊張地問。\n\n未晞沒有回答。\n\n她的身體，軟軟地，向前倒了下去——\n\n「未晞！！！」\n\n「砰！」\n\n未晞整個人，暈倒在阿釁懷裡。\n\n手環上，那道淡藍色的光芒，忽然劇烈地閃爍起來，然後——\n\n「嗡——！」\n\n一道刺眼的光束，從手環裡噴射而出，在半空中，展開成一片巨大的畫面！\n\n畫面裡，是一座被垃圾淹沒的海岸。\n\n灰黃色的天空下，海水是黑色的。沙灘上，堆滿了比人還高的垃圾，塑膠袋在風中飛舞，像是灰色的雪花。\n\n「這是……」孩子們倒抽一口涼氣。\n\n「這是未來的海……」晴晴喃喃地說。\n\n「未來？！」老巫瞪大眼睛，「什麼未來？！」\n\n「未晞她……」晴晴猶豫了一下，最後，深吸一口氣，說出了那個藏了很久的祕密，「是從未來來的。」\n\n「什麼？！」全班二十六個人，同時瞪大了眼睛。\n\n「她是……」晴晴的聲音，微微顫抖，「來自四十年後的未來。」\n\n教室裡，瞬間陷入一片死寂。\n\n「未來……」尪伝恺的嘴巴，張得大大的，「那個……那個是……」他指著半空中那片垃圾海岸的投影，「那個畫面……是真的嗎？」\n\n「是真的。」晴晴點頭，「那是未晞的時代，真實的樣子。」\n\n「那……」林芸芸顫抖著問，「那個時代……大家……都生活在那種地方嗎？」\n\n「……」晴晴沉默了，過了很久，才輕輕點頭，「對。」\n\n「好可怕……」林芸芸的眼淚，掉了下來。\n\n「那……那我們……」柯志遠小聲問，「我們這個時代，也會變成那樣嗎？」\n\n「……」晴晴沒有回答。\n\n但她緊握的拳頭，說明了一切。\n\n「不會的。」一個虛弱的聲音，從阿釁懷裡傳來。\n\n是未晞。\n\n她醒了。\n\n「只要我們現在開始行動，」未晞虛弱地說，「那個未來……是可以改變的。」\n\n「未晞！」孩子們圍過去，「你醒了？！」\n\n「嗯。」未晞輕輕點頭，目光掃過全班，「對不起……讓你們看到那個畫面了……」\n\n「別說對不起！」老巫大聲說，「你……你才是該被說對不起的人！你一個人扛著這些……我們卻什麼都不知道！」\n\n「老巫……」未晞的眼眶，紅了。\n\n「而且，」阿釁接下去，「我們現在知道了！所以，從今天開始，我們一起扛！」\n\n「一起扛！」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n「未來……？」老巫的嘴巴，張得大大的，「你是說……未晞她……是……是……」\n\n「是從未來來的。」阿釁接著說，「她帶著這個手環，從四十年後，回到現在。為了……」他看著暈倒的未晞，「為了告訴我們，地球快要生病了。」\n\n「地球……生病？」\n\n「你們還記得嗎？」阿釁大聲說，「她預測下雨、她知道菜的產地、她看著新聞說『跟以前一樣』、她在淨灘時看到垃圾山、她寫信給四十年後的自己……她早就告訴我們了！只是我們……都沒發現！」\n\n「她……」林芸芸的眼眶，一下子紅了，「她一直……一個人扛著這些？」\n\n「對。」晴晴點頭，聲音哽咽，「她一個人，從未來回到現在，一個人，面對所有的一切。而我們……什麼都不知道。」\n\n「她一定很孤單吧……」尪伝恺低聲說。\n\n「她……」老巫愣愣地看著暈倒的未晞，忽然，他的眼眶，也紅了，「她上次說，她是從『很遠很遠的地方』來的……我還以為，她只是住在國外……」\n\n「原來……」老巫的聲音，帶著哭腔，「她說的『很遠很遠的地方』，是……」\n\n「是未來。」阿釁說。\n\n教室裡，安靜了很久很久。\n\n然後，林芸芸小聲開口：「那……未晞她……會回去嗎？」\n\n「……」阿釁和晴晴，沉默了。\n\n「會。」一個虛弱的聲音，從阿釁懷裡傳來。\n\n是未晞。\n\n她醒了。\n\n「未晞！」孩子們圍過去，「你醒了？！」\n\n「對不起……」未晞虛弱地撐起身體，勉強擠出一個笑容，「我……我剛才，又不小心……」\n\n「沒關係！」林芸芸哭著說，「你沒事了就好！」\n\n「我……」未晞的目光，掃過全班二十六張臉，最後，她低聲說，「你們……都知道了？」\n\n「知道了！」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n「那……」未晞深吸一口氣，「你們想聽聽……我的時代的故事嗎？」\n\n「想！」孩子們異口同聲。\n\n於是，那一天，未晞坐在教室中間，把她從來沒有告訴任何人的故事，講給了全班聽。\n\n她說，她的時代，天空是灰黃色的，太陽終年像隔著一層霧。\n\n她說，她的時代，海是黑色的，海邊堆滿了垃圾，海水裡沒有魚。\n\n她說，她的時代，乾淨的水是要排隊領的，每個人每天只有四公升。\n\n她說，她的時代，夏天常常超過四十度，冬天卻下冰雹。\n\n她說，她的時代，有一堂課叫「氣候課」，課本裡寫著這個時代的新聞，老師說：「這些，都是歷史。」\n\n她說，她的奶奶，是她見過的最溫柔的人。奶奶會指著一張泛黃的照片，告訴她：「未晞啊，奶奶小時候的海，是藍色的。」\n\n她說，她從來沒有見過藍色的海。\n\n「所以……」未晞低下頭，「我才會回來這裡。我想親眼看看，藍色的海，是什麼樣子。」\n\n「那……」林芸芸哽咽著問，「你看到了嗎？」\n\n「看到了。」未晞抬起頭，露出一個溫柔的笑容，「我在這裡，看到了藍色的海、綠色的樹、會下雨的冬天……還有你們。」\n\n「那……」老巫問，「你……喜歡這裡嗎？」\n\n「喜歡。」未晞毫不猶豫地說，「非常非常喜歡。」\n\n「那……」老巫低下頭，聲音啞啞的，「你……真的，一定要回去嗎？」\n\n未晞沉默了。\n\n「……嗯。」她最後輕輕點頭，「如果我不回去，時空就會錯亂，大家……都會消失。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「所以，」未晞微微笑了，「我會珍惜剩下的每一天。因為……」她看著全班，「這是我這輩子，最快樂的時光。」\n\n「那……」未晞的聲音，微微顫抖，「你們……害怕嗎？」\n\n「害怕？」老巫愣了一下，然後，他用力搖頭，「害怕什麼？你是從未來來的！多酷啊！」\n\n「可是……」未晞低下頭，「我是『不是這個時代的人』……」\n\n「那又怎樣！」阿釁大聲說，「你還是我們的同學！還是我們『守護地球作戰部隊』的一員！」\n\n「對！」晴晴點頭，「不管你從哪裡來，你都是我們的朋友！」\n\n「可是……」未晞的眼眶，紅了，「我……我很快就會回去了……」\n\n「回去？」孩子們愣住了。\n\n「我必須，在倒數結束之前，回到未來。」未晞低頭，看著自己手腕上的手環，「否則……時空就會錯亂，大家……都會消失。」\n\n「消失？！」孩子們倒抽一口涼氣。\n\n「所以……」未晞抬起頭，淚眼朦朧，「我只能……陪你們到那一天為止了。」\n\n教室裡，再一次，陷入沉默。\n\n「那……」過了很久，老巫才開口，聲音啞啞的，「你……你還能陪我們多久？」\n\n未晞低頭，看了一眼手環。\n\n「……十五天。」她輕輕說。\n\n「十五天……」孩子們喃喃地重複著。\n\n「所以，」未晞強忍著淚水，擠出一個笑容，「剩下的十五天，我會……」\n\n「夠了！」阿釁忽然大聲打斷她，「未晞，你聽好！」\n\n「阿釁……」未晞愣住。\n\n「十五天，」阿釁直視著她，「夠我們做很多事情！」\n\n「對！」晴晴接下去，「我們會用這十五天，把排水溝查清楚！把王老闆揪出來！讓這片海，恢復乾淨！」\n\n「然後，」老巫大聲說，「你就能安心地，回去！」\n\n「可是……」未晞的眼淚，掉了下來，「我回去以後……」\n\n「回去以後，」林芸芸哭著說，「我們也會記得你！」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲說，「我們會記得你的！」\n\n「我們會記得，你教我們分類垃圾、省電、種樹、淨灘……」\n\n「我們會記得，你讓我們知道，地球是會生病的……」\n\n「我們會記得……」老巫哽咽著，「你會分我半顆肉包的日子……」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們又哭又笑。\n\n「而且，」阿釁大聲宣布，「從今天開始，我們『守護地球作戰部隊』，全員出動！」\n\n「全員出動？」孩子們疑惑。\n\n「對！」阿釁說，「以前，只有我們幾個人，偷偷調查排水溝。現在……」他掃視全班二十六個人，「我們全班二十六個人，一起來！」\n\n「一起做什麼？」孩子們問。\n\n「一起！」阿釁大聲說，「把排水溝查清楚！把王老闆揪出來！把我們的地球，救回來！」\n\n「好——！」孩子們齊聲大喊。\n\n「還有，」晴晴補充，「我們要一起……」她看向未晞，「讓未晞，安心地，回到她的時代。」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n「我們……會讓未晞，安心地回去的！」\n\n未晞愣愣地，看著全班二十六張臉。\n\n眼淚，一滴一滴地，從她的臉頰滑落。\n\n「謝謝你們……」她哽咽著，「謝謝……」\n\n那天，六年一班的教室裡，二十六個孩子，加上一隻小寵物，圍在一個來自未來的女孩身邊，哭成了一團。\n\n也笑成了一團。\n\n「對了，」哭完之後，老巫忽然想到什麼，「未晞，你那個手環，現在到底剩多少？」\n\n「……」未晞低頭，看了一眼，「十三。」\n\n「十三天……」老巫喃喃地重複著，然後，他用力點頭，「好！那我們就，用十三天，改變世界！」\n\n「用十三天，改變世界！」孩子們齊聲大喊。\n\n第二天一早，六年一班的教室裡，出現了一種「前所未有的默契」。\n\n「未晞，早安！」林芸芸遞上一個小紙袋，「這是……我家做的飯糰！你吃！」\n\n「謝……謝謝！」未晞愣愣地接過。\n\n「未晞，這個送你！」柯志遠遞來一張手繪的卡片，「這是我畫的『未來的地球』！等我長大，我要讓它變成真的！」\n\n「未晞，你渴不渴？」老巫捧著自己的水壺，「我的水分你喝！我還沒喝過！」\n\n「老巫，你自己喝啦！」阿釁吐槽，「我們要『照顧』未晞，不是『餵食』未晞！」\n\n「照顧跟餵食，有差嗎？」老巫歪著頭。\n\n「當然有！」阿釁說，「餵食是對寵物的！」\n\n「那……」老巫想了想，「那未晞是我們的『寶貝』！餵食寶貝，應該可以吧？」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑成一團。\n\n未晞坐在座位上，看著這些孩子，眼眶，又開始熱熱的。\n\n「你們……」她低下頭，輕輕說，「不用對我這麼好……」\n\n「為什麼不用？」尪伝恺理直氣壯，「你對我們，不是也這麼好嗎？」\n\n「你教我們分類、省電、種樹、淨灘……」林芸芸細數著，「你讓我們知道地球會生病……你讓我們的『守護地球大作戰』，真的變成『大作戰』！」\n\n「對啊！」阿釁大聲說，「沒有你，我們現在還在『亂丟垃圾』！」\n\n「你們……」未晞的眼眶，終於忍不住，濕了。\n\n「所以，」晴晴走過來，握住她的手，「從今天開始，換我們照顧你！」\n\n「換我們照顧你！」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n「嗯……」未晞低下頭，眼淚一滴一滴地，掉在桌上，「謝謝你們……」\n\n「別哭！」老巫慌張地，「我、我再去買一顆肉包給你！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們又笑了。\n\n那一天，六年一班的教室裡，充滿了前所未有的溫暖。\n\n那天放學後，孩子們第一次，全員參加了「祕密會議」。\n\n「我們要想辦法，」阿釁站在器材箱上，表情嚴肅，「幫未晞『爭取時間』！」\n\n「爭取時間？」孩子們疑惑。\n\n「對！」阿釁說，「未晞的手環，用一次，就消耗一次能量。如果我們能減少她『使用手環』的次數……」\n\n「那她的倒數，就會慢一點！」晴晴接著說。\n\n「怎麼減少？」孩子們問。\n\n「我們可以……」柯志遠舉手，「用我的電腦，模擬她的追蹤路線！這樣，她就不用每次都用『手環』找路了！」\n\n「對！」阿釁眼睛一亮，「還有，溜溜的偵察數據，我們可以做成『數位地圖』！未晞只要看地圖，不用親自跑！」\n\n「可是，」林芸芸擔心地問，「這樣……真的能幫她『爭取時間』嗎？」\n\n「至少……」未晞輕輕開口，聲音裡帶著感動，「你們的心意，已經幫我爭取到，最多的『時間』了。」\n\n「未晞……」孩子們看著她。\n\n「而且，」未晞微微笑了，「我剩下的時間，本來就是用來『改變世界』的。你們幫我一起改變……這個世界，就會變得更快。」\n\n「那……」阿釁大聲說，「我們就一起，把這個世界，變得更快！」\n\n「好——！」\n\n「好！」阿釁跳上講台，「『守護地球大作戰・全員出動』！第一戰——『追蹤新管線』！未晞負責帶路！溜溜負責偵察！我們全班，負責——」\n\n「當她的後盾！」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n「對！」阿釁大聲說，「當她的後盾！」\n\n「好！那我們來分工！」阿釁跳上講台，攤開溜溜的地圖，「『全員出動』的任務分配！」\n\n「未晞，負責用手環追蹤管線！」\n\n「溜溜，負責空中偵察和拍照！」\n\n「晴晴，負責記錄數據！」\n\n「我，負責畫路線圖和想辦法！」\n\n「老巫……」阿釁看向老巫，「你負責……『衝鋒』！」\n\n「衝鋒？！」老巫興奮地站起來，「我最會衝鋒了！衝哪裡？！」\n\n「哪裡有困難，就衝哪裡！」阿釁說，「你的任務，就是帶著大家，突破困難！」\n\n「好！」老巫拍著胸脯，「我這塊『人體盾牌』，隨時準備出動！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑了。\n\n「林芸芸，你負責……」阿釁想了想，「負責『打氣』！大家累的時候，你就是我們的『充電站』！」\n\n「我……我可以嗎？」林芸芸紅著臉。\n\n「當然！」晴晴說，「你上次在淨灘的時候，可是比誰都勇敢！」\n\n「那我呢？那我呢？」尪伝恺舉手。\n\n「你……」阿釁想了想，「你負責『笑』！」\n\n「笑？！」\n\n「對！」阿釁說，「我們『守護地球作戰部隊』，最重要的就是士氣！你笑點最低，哪裡有笑話，你就負責第一個笑！」\n\n「噗！」尪伝恺忍不住笑了出來，「這個任務……我好像天生就會！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」全班笑成一團。\n\n「還有柯志遠！」阿釁看向柯志遠，「你負責『數位』！你電腦最強，幫我們整理數據、做圖表！」\n\n「交給我！」柯志遠拍著胸脯。\n\n「還有……」阿釁掃視全班，「剩下的所有人，你們的任務是——」\n\n「隨時待命！哪裡需要，哪裡就有我們！」\n\n「好——！」孩子們齊聲大喊。\n\n「『守護地球大作戰・全員出動』，正式開始！」\n\n夕陽，透過教室的窗戶，灑在二十六個孩子的身上。\n\n未晞站在窗邊，看著這群孩子，嘴角，微微上揚。\n\n「……原來，」她低聲說，「被大家知道祕密的感覺，是這樣的。」\n\n「是什麼感覺？」晴晴走到她身邊。\n\n「是……」未晞輕輕笑了，「安心的感覺。」\n\n「對了，晴晴，」未晞忽然想到什麼，「我可以……拜託你一件事嗎？」\n\n「什麼事？」晴晴問。\n\n「我回去以後……」未晞低下頭，輕輕說，「請你繼續帶著大家，保護地球。」\n\n「……」晴晴的眼眶，紅了。\n\n「不是代替我，」未晞看著她，「是代替『所有知道真相的人』。因為……」她微微笑了，「你們現在，已經比任何人，都更懂地球了。」\n\n「未晞……」晴晴深吸一口氣，用力點頭，「我答應你。」\n\n「還有，」未晞輕輕說，「幫我告訴大家——就算我不在了，地球還在。只要地球還在，希望……就還在。」\n\n「嗯。」晴晴點頭，「我會的。」\n\n「還有……」未晞低下頭，聲音輕輕的，「如果有一天，你們收到了來自『未來』的信……那一定是，我寫給你們的。」\n\n「……」晴晴的眼淚，終於忍不住掉了下來。\n\n「未晞，」她哽咽著說，「你一定會收到我們寫的信的。因為……」她看著未晞，「我們寫給未來的每一封信，都是寫給你的。」\n\n未晞愣住了。\n\n然後，她低下頭，輕輕地笑了。\n\n「……嗯。」她說，「我知道。」\n\n夕陽，靜靜地，沉入了海平線。\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 18: The Truth Comes to Light\n\nOver the next two days, using the bracelet's \"tracking\" ability, Weixi led everyone, bit by bit, in piecing together the factory's secret discharge route.\n\n\"This pipe loops around the factory's iron wall, cuts through the weeds, and runs all the way to...\" Weixi closed her eyes, the bracelet emitting a pale blue light, \"the mouth of the drainage ditch.\"\n\n\"The river mouth?\" A-Xin's eyes went wide, \"That's...\"\n\n\"That's the sea we cleaned.\" Qingqing said.\n\n\"Weixi, you've already used it three times today...\" at dusk on the first day, Qingqing said worriedly, \"take a break, okay?\"\n\n\"It's fine,\" Weixi shook her head, \"I can still...\"\n\nHer words suddenly stopped, and her body swayed slightly.\n\n\"Weixi!\" Qingqing caught her, \"You're so pale!\"\n\n\"I... I'm fine...\" Weixi forced a smile, \"It's just... the bracelet's energy is draining a little fast...\"\n\n\"Then we'll continue tomorrow!\" A-Xin said nervously, \"That's enough for today!\"\n\n\"No...\" Weixi shook her head, \"That new pipe keeps moving... if we don't track it to its source today, tomorrow...\"\n\n\"What about tomorrow?\"\n\n\"Tomorrow,\" Weixi said in a low voice, \"it might have moved somewhere else.\"\n\n\"Then... then we...\" A-Xin stomped his feet anxiously.\n\n\"I can hold on.\" Weixi's tone was exceptionally resolute, \"Let's continue.\"\n\nThe next day, the blue light on Weixi's bracelet had already grown somewhat dim.\n\n\"Weixi...\" Qingqing held her hand, a nameless unease rising in her heart.\n\n\"I'm fine.\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"We're almost there. Just a little more...\"\n\n\"Just a little more\" became the phrase Weixi said the most that day.\n\n\"They found a new route,\" Weixi said softly, \"looping around the old pipe's location and discharging through a new route instead. That way, even if we find the old pipe, we can't...\"\n\n\"Can't prove they're still discharging now.\" A-Xin gritted his teeth, \"That Boss Wang is so cunning!\"\n\n\"It's okay.\" Weixi comforted everyone, \"As long as the bracelet still remembers that smell, we can...\"\n\nHer words suddenly stopped.\n\n\"Weixi?\" Qingqing noticed her change, \"What's wrong?\"\n\n\"I...\" Weixi's face instantly turned pale, her body swaying, \"I...\"\n\n\"Weixi!!\" A-Xin rushed over to catch her, \"What's wrong?!\"\n\n\"My... head...\" Weixi weakly held her forehead, \"so dizzy... as if... something... is calling me...\"\n\n\"Calling you?\" The children looked at each other.\n\n\"It's...\" Weixi's pupils suddenly lost focus, \"it's the 'future'...\"\n\n\"Weixi!\" Qingqing shouted, \"Look at me! Look at me!\"\n\n\"I...\" Weixi swayed, as if about to collapse at any moment, \"I feel like... I'm about to...\"\n\n\"About to what?\" A-Xin asked nervously.\n\nWeixi didn't answer.\n\nHer body went limp and fell forward—\n\n\"Weixi!!!\"\n\n\"Thump!\"\n\nWeixi fainted in A-Xin's arms.\n\nThe pale blue light on the bracelet suddenly flickered violently, and then—\n\n\"Woom—!\"\n\nA blinding beam of light shot out from the bracelet, unfolding into a huge image in midair!\n\nIn the image was a coast buried under trash.\n\nUnder a grayish-yellow sky, the sea was black. The beach was piled with trash taller than people, plastic bags dancing in the wind like gray snowflakes.\n\n\"This is...\" The children gasped.\n\n\"This is the sea of the future...\" Qingqing murmured.\n\n\"The future?!\" Old Wu's eyes went wide, \"What future?!\"\n\n\"Weixi, she...\" Qingqing hesitated, then took a deep breath and finally spoke out the secret she had kept for so long, \"came from the future.\"\n\n\"What?!\" All twenty-six people in the class stared with wide eyes at the same time.\n\n\"She is...\" Qingqing's voice trembled slightly, \"from the future, forty years from now.\"\n\nThe classroom instantly fell into deathly silence.\n\n\"The future...\" Wang Zhuankai's mouth hung wide open, \"that... that is...\" he pointed at the projection of the trash coast in midair, \"is that image... real?\"\n\n\"It's real.\" Qingqing nodded, \"That's what Weixi's era truly looks like.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Lin Yunyun asked tremblingly, \"in that era... do people... all live in places like that?\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing was silent, and only after a long moment nodded softly, \"Yes.\"\n\n\"How terrifying...\" Lin Yunyun's tears fell.\n\n\"Then... then us...\" Ke Zhiyuan asked quietly, \"will our era become like that too?\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing didn't answer.\n\nBut her clenched fist said it all.\n\n\"It won't.\" A weak voice came from A-Xin's arms.\n\nIt was Weixi.\n\nShe had woken up.\n\n\"As long as we start acting now,\" Weixi said weakly, \"that future... can be changed.\"\n\n\"Weixi!\" The children gathered around, \"You're awake?!\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded softly, her gaze sweeping across the class, \"I'm sorry... you had to see that image...\"\n\n\"Don't apologize!\" Old Wu said loudly, \"You're the one who deserves the apology! You carried all this alone... and we knew nothing!\"\n\n\"Old Wu...\" Weixi's eyes reddened.\n\n\"And,\" A-Xin continued, \"we know now! So starting today, we carry it together!\"\n\n\"Carry it together!\" The children said in unison.\n\n\"The future...?\" Old Wu's mouth hung wide open, \"You mean... Weixi... is... is...\"\n\n\"Is from the future.\" A-Xin continued, \"She carried this bracelet, and returned from forty years in the future, back to now. To...\" he looked at the unconscious Weixi, \"to tell us that the Earth is getting sick.\"\n\n\"The Earth... getting sick?\"\n\n\"Do you still remember?\" A-Xin said loudly, \"She predicted the rain, she knew where the vegetables came from, she watched the news and said 'just like before,' she saw the trash mountain at the beach cleanup, she wrote a letter to herself forty years from now... she told us long ago! It's just that we... never noticed!\"\n\n\"She...\" Lin Yunyun's eyes suddenly turned red, \"she's been... carrying all of this alone?\"\n\n\"Yes.\" Qingqing nodded, her voice choked, \"She came back alone from the future to the present, facing everything alone. And we... didn't know anything.\"\n\n\"She must have been so lonely...\" Wang Zhuankai said in a low voice.\n\n\"She...\" Old Wu stared blankly at the unconscious Weixi, and then, his eyes suddenly reddened too, \"last time she said she came from a 'very, very faraway place'... I thought she just lived abroad...\"\n\n\"So...\" Old Wu's voice was choked with tears, \"the 'very, very faraway place' she meant... was...\"\n\n\"Was the future.\" A-Xin said.\n\nThe classroom was quiet for a very, very long time.\n\nThen Lin Yunyun spoke quietly: \"Then... will Weixi... go back?\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin and Qingqing fell silent.\n\n\"She will.\" A weak voice came from A-Xin's arms.\n\nIt was Weixi.\n\nShe had woken up.\n\n\"Weixi!\" The children gathered around, \"You're awake?!\"\n\n\"I'm sorry...\" Weixi weakly propped herself up, forcing a smile, \"I... just now, I accidentally...\"\n\n\"It's okay!\" Lin Yunyun said tearfully, \"As long as you're alright!\"\n\n\"I...\" Weixi's gaze swept across all twenty-six faces in the class, and finally, she said in a low voice, \"you... all know now?\"\n\n\"We know!\" The children said in unison.\n\n\"Then...\" Weixi took a deep breath, \"do you want to hear the story of my era?\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children said in unison.\n\nAnd so, that day, sitting in the middle of the classroom, Weixi told the whole class the story she had never told anyone.\n\nShe said that in her era, the sky was grayish-yellow, and the sun was forever like a haze behind a layer of fog.\n\nShe said that in her era, the sea was black, the shore piled with trash, and there were no fish in the seawater.\n\nShe said that in her era, clean water had to be collected in line, four liters per person per day.\n\nShe said that in her era, summers often exceeded forty degrees, and winters brought hail.\n\nShe said that in her era, there was a class called \"Climate Class,\" and in the textbook were written the news of this era, and the teacher said: \"These are all history.\"\n\nShe said that her grandmother was the gentlest person she had ever met. Grandma would point at a yellowed photograph and tell her: \"Weixi ah, the sea of Grandma's childhood was blue.\"\n\nShe said that she had never seen a blue sea.\n\n\"So...\" Weixi lowered her head, \"that's why I came back here. I wanted to see with my own eyes what a blue sea looks like.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Lin Yunyun choked, \"did you see it?\"\n\n\"I did.\" Weixi looked up, showing a gentle smile, \"Here, I saw a blue sea, green trees, winters with rain... and all of you.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Old Wu asked, \"do you... like it here?\"\n\n\"I do.\" Weixi said without hesitation, \"Very, very much.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Old Wu lowered his head, his voice hoarse, \"do you... really have to go back?\"\n\nWeixi fell silent.\n\n\"...Mhm.\" She finally nodded softly, \"If I don't go back, the timeline will collapse, and everyone... will disappear.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"So,\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"I'll cherish every day I have left. Because...\" she looked at the whole class, \"this is the happiest time of my life.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Weixi's voice trembled slightly, \"are you... afraid?\"\n\n\"Afraid?\" Old Wu blinked, then shook his head hard, \"Afraid of what? You're from the future! That's so cool!\"\n\n\"But...\" Weixi lowered her head, \"I'm 'someone who doesn't belong to this era'...\"\n\n\"So what!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"You're still our classmate! You're still a member of our 'Protect Earth Operations Unit'!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" Qingqing nodded, \"No matter where you came from, you're our friend!\"\n\n\"But...\" Weixi's eyes reddened, \"I... will have to go back soon...\"\n\n\"Go back?\" The children froze.\n\n\"I have to return to the future before the countdown ends.\" Weixi lowered her head, looking at the bracelet on her wrist, \"Otherwise... the timeline will collapse, and everyone... will disappear.\"\n\n\"Disappear?!\" The children gasped.\n\n\"So...\" Weixi looked up, her eyes blurred with tears, \"I can only... stay with you until that day.\"\n\nThe classroom once again fell into silence.\n\n\"Then...\" after a long moment, Old Wu spoke, his voice hoarse, \"how much longer... can you stay with us?\"\n\nWeixi lowered her head and glanced at the bracelet.\n\n\"...Fifteen days.\" she said softly.\n\n\"Fifteen days...\" The children murmured in repetition.\n\n\"So,\" Weixi held back her tears and forced a smile, \"for the remaining fifteen days, I will...\"\n\n\"Enough!\" A-Xin suddenly shouted, interrupting her, \"Weixi, listen to me!\"\n\n\"A-Xin...\" Weixi froze.\n\n\"Fifteen days,\" A-Xin looked straight at her, \"is enough for us to do a lot of things!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" Qingqing continued, \"We'll use these fifteen days to investigate the drainage ditch! Catch Boss Wang! Make this sea clean again!\"\n\n\"Then,\" Old Wu said loudly, \"you can go back with peace of mind!\"\n\n\"But...\" Weixi's tears fell, \"after I go back...\"\n\n\"After you go back,\" Lin Yunyun said tearfully, \"we'll still remember you!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children said in unison, \"We'll remember you!\"\n\n\"We'll remember you teaching us to sort trash, save electricity, plant trees, clean the beach...\"\n\n\"We'll remember you making us know that the Earth can get sick...\"\n\n\"We'll remember...\" Old Wu choked, \"the days you'd share half a pork bun with me...\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed and cried at once.\n\n\"And,\" A-Xin announced loudly, \"starting today, our 'Protect Earth Operations Unit' goes into full deployment!\"\n\n\"Full deployment?\" The children were puzzled.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin said, \"Before, only a few of us were secretly investigating the drainage ditch. Now...\" he swept his gaze across all twenty-six people, \"all twenty-six of us, together!\"\n\n\"Together doing what?\" The children asked.\n\n\"Together!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"investigate the drainage ditch! Catch Boss Wang! Save our Earth!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\" The children shouted in unison.\n\n\"And,\" Qingqing added, \"we'll also... make Weixi able to return to her era with peace of mind.\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children said in unison.\n\n\"We'll make Weixi able to go back with peace of mind!\"\n\nWeixi stared blankly at the twenty-six faces of the class.\n\nTears fell drop by drop down her cheeks.\n\n\"Thank you...\" she choked, \"thank you...\"\n\nThat day, in the classroom of Class 6-1, twenty-six children, plus one little pet, gathered around a girl from the future, crying together.\n\nAnd laughing together.\n\n\"By the way,\" after the crying, Old Wu suddenly thought of something, \"Weixi, how much is left on your bracelet now?\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi lowered her head and looked, \"Thirteen.\"\n\n\"Thirteen days...\" Old Wu murmured in repetition, then nodded hard, \"Alright! Then we'll use thirteen days to change the world!\"\n\n\"Use thirteen days to change the world!\" The children shouted in unison.\n\nThe next morning, an \"unprecedented understanding\" appeared in the classroom of Class 6-1.\n\n\"Weixi, good morning!\" Lin Yunyun handed her a small paper bag, \"This is... a rice ball my family made! For you!\"\n\n\"Th-thank you!\" Weixi took it, stunned.\n\n\"Weixi, this is for you!\" Ke Zhiyuan handed her a hand-drawn card, \"This is my drawing of the 'future Earth'! When I grow up, I'm going to make it real!\"\n\n\"Weixi, are you thirsty?\" Old Wu held out his water bottle, \"I'll share my water with you! I haven't drunk from it yet!\"\n\n\"Old Wu, drink it yourself!\" A-Xin teased, \"We're supposed to 'take care of' Weixi, not 'feed' Weixi!\"\n\n\"Is there a difference between taking care and feeding?\" Old Wu tilted his head.\n\n\"Of course there is!\" A-Xin said, \"Feeding is for pets!\"\n\n\"Then...\" Old Wu thought for a moment, \"then Weixi is our 'treasure'! Feeding a treasure should be fine, right?\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed together.\n\nSitting at her seat, watching these children, Weixi's eyes began to grow warm again.\n\n\"You...\" she lowered her head, speaking softly, \"don't need to be so good to me...\"\n\n\"Why not?\" Wang Zhuankai declared with full confidence, \"Aren't you this good to us?\"\n\n\"You taught us to sort trash, save electricity, plant trees, clean the beach...\" Lin Yunyun counted, \"You made us know that the Earth can get sick... you made our 'Protect Earth' a real 'Campaign'!\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"Without you, we'd still be 'throwing trash around'!\"\n\n\"You...\" Weixi's eyes finally couldn't hold back, and they moistened.\n\n\"So,\" Qingqing walked over and took her hand, \"from today on, we take care of you!\"\n\n\"We'll take care of you!\" The children said in unison.\n\n\"Mhm...\" Weixi lowered her head, tears falling drop by drop onto the desk, \"thank you...\"\n\n\"Don't cry!\" Old Wu panicked, \"I-I'll go buy you another pork bun!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed again.\n\nThat day, the classroom of Class 6-1 was filled with unprecedented warmth.\n\nThat afternoon after school, for the first time, all the children attended the \"secret meeting.\"\n\n\"We need to find a way,\" A-Xin stood on the equipment box, his expression serious, \"to 'buy time' for Weixi!\"\n\n\"Buy time?\" The children were puzzled.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin said, \"Every time Weixi uses the bracelet, it consumes energy. If we can reduce the number of times she 'uses the bracelet'...\"\n\n\"Then her countdown will slow down!\" Qingqing continued.\n\n\"How do we reduce it?\" The children asked.\n\n\"We can...\" Ke Zhiyuan raised his hand, \"use my computer to simulate her tracking route! That way, she won't have to use the 'bracelet' to find the way every time!\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin's eyes lit up, \"And Liu-Liu's reconnaissance data can be turned into a 'digital map'! Weixi can just look at the map instead of running around herself!\"\n\n\"But,\" Lin Yunyun asked worriedly, \"will this really 'buy time' for her?\"\n\n\"At least...\" Weixi spoke softly, her voice full of emotion, \"your thoughtfulness has already bought me the most 'time' of all.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" The children looked at her.\n\n\"And,\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"the time I have left was meant for 'changing the world.' With you helping me change it... the world will change faster.\"\n\n\"Then,\" A-Xin said loudly, \"let's change this world faster, together!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\"\n\n\"Great!\" A-Xin jumped onto the podium, \"'Protect Earth Operations Unit · Full Deployment'! First battle—'Track the New Pipe'! Weixi leads the way! Liu-Liu does reconnaissance! Our whole class is responsible for—\"\n\n\"Being her support!\" The children said in unison.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"Being her support!\"\n\n\"Alright! Then let's divide the work!\" A-Xin jumped onto the podium and spread out Liu-Liu's map, \"'Full Deployment' mission assignments!\"\n\n\"Weixi, responsible for tracking the pipe with the bracelet!\"\n\n\"Liu-Liu, responsible for aerial reconnaissance and photos!\"\n\n\"Qingqing, responsible for recording data!\"\n\n\"Me, responsible for drawing the route map and coming up with ideas!\"\n\n\"Old Wu...\" A-Xin looked at Old Wu, \"you're responsible for... 'charging ahead'!\"\n\n\"Charging ahead?!\" Old Wu stood up excitedly, \"I'm the best at charging! Where do I charge to?!\"\n\n\"Wherever there's difficulty, that's where you charge!\" A-Xin said, \"Your mission is to lead everyone through the obstacles!\"\n\n\"Alright!\" Old Wu patted his chest, \"This 'human shield' of mine is ready to deploy at any time!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed.\n\n\"Lin Yunyun, you're responsible for...\" A-Xin thought for a moment, \"responsible for 'cheering'! When everyone is tired, you're our 'charging station'!\"\n\n\"I... can I do it?\" Lin Yunyun blushed.\n\n\"Of course!\" Qingqing said, \"You were braver than anyone at the beach cleanup!\"\n\n\"What about me? What about me?\" Wang Zhuankai raised his hand.\n\n\"You...\" A-Xin thought for a moment, \"you're responsible for 'laughing'!\"\n\n\"Laughing?!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin said, \"The most important thing for our 'Protect Earth Operations Unit' is morale! Your laughing threshold is the lowest, so wherever there's a joke, you're the first to laugh!\"\n\n\"Pfft!\" Wang Zhuankai couldn't help laughing, \"This mission... I was born for it!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The whole class burst into laughter.\n\n\"And Ke Zhiyuan!\" A-Xin looked at Ke Zhiyuan, \"you're responsible for 'digital'! You're the best with computers, so help us organize data and make charts!\"\n\n\"Leave it to me!\" Ke Zhiyuan patted his chest.\n\n\"And...\" A-Xin swept his gaze across the class, \"for everyone else, your mission is—\"\n\n\"On standby at all times! Wherever we're needed, there we are!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\" The children shouted in unison.\n\n\"'Protect Earth Operations Unit · Full Deployment' officially begins!\"\n\nThe setting sun streamed through the classroom window, falling on the twenty-six children.\n\nStanding by the window, looking at these children, the corners of Weixi's mouth lifted slightly.\n\n\"...So this,\" she said in a low voice, \"is what it feels like when everyone knows your secret.\"\n\n\"What does it feel like?\" Qingqing walked to her side.\n\n\"It feels...\" Weixi smiled softly, \"like peace of mind.\"\n\n\"By the way, Qingqing,\" Weixi suddenly thought of something, \"can I... ask you for a favor?\"\n\n\"What favor?\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"After I go back...\" Weixi lowered her head, speaking softly, \"please keep leading everyone to protect the Earth.\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing's eyes reddened.\n\n\"Not to replace me,\" Weixi looked at her, \"but to represent 'all who know the truth.' Because...\" she smiled faintly, \"you now understand the Earth better than anyone.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" Qingqing took a deep breath and nodded hard, \"I promise you.\"\n\n\"And,\" Weixi said softly, \"help me tell everyone—even if I'm gone, the Earth is still here. As long as the Earth is here, hope... is still here.\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Qingqing nodded, \"I will.\"\n\n\"And...\" Weixi lowered her head, her voice soft, \"if one day, you receive a letter from the 'future'... it will definitely be from me, written to you.\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing's tears finally couldn't be held back and fell.\n\n\"Weixi,\" she choked, \"you will definitely receive the letters we wrote. Because...\" she looked at Weixi, \"every letter we write to the future is written to you.\"\n\nWeixi froze.\n\nThen, she lowered her head and smiled softly.\n\n\"...Mhm.\" she said, \"I know.\"\n\nThe setting sun quietly sank below the horizon.\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":3,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第十九章：空汙紅害警報\n\n「全員出動」的第一個星期，孩子們士氣高昂。\n\n「未晞，我們找到了！」柯志遠舉著他的筆電，興奮地跑進器材室，「我按照溜溜的偵察數據，畫出了那條新管線的『模擬路線圖』！」\n\n「太好了！」未晞湊過去看，「這條管線，果然繞過了舊管線的位置！」\n\n「而且，」柯志遠補充，「我用電腦模擬，發現它最後匯入的位置，就在排水溝的入海口附近！」\n\n「那我們只要……」阿釁的眼睛亮起來，「沿著這條模擬路線，找到它的『源頭』！」\n\n「對！」未晞點頭，「我們……」\n\n她的話，忽然停住了。\n\n「未晞？」晴晴緊張地問，「你又……」\n\n「沒……沒事。」未晞搖搖頭，勉強擠出笑容，「只是……剛才，眼前閃過一個畫面……」\n\n「什麼畫面？」孩子們緊張地問。\n\n「灰黃色的天空……」未晞低聲說，「學校的操場上，沒有人在玩……」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「沒關係，」未晞安慰大家，「只是幻視而已。我們繼續……」\n\n其實，那不是未晞第一次「看見」未來的幻視了。\n\n這兩天，她的幻視，越來越頻繁。\n\n吃飯的時候，她會忽然停住筷子，愣愣地，看著桌上的飯菜——因為在幻視裡，飯菜是配給的，每個人只有一小碗。\n\n上課的時候，她會忽然看向窗外——因為在幻視裡，窗外的天空，是灰黃色的。\n\n放學的時候，她會在校門口站很久很久——因為在幻視裡，校門口沒有鳳凰樹，只有一排枯樹。\n\n「未晞，」某天放學，晴晴終於忍不住問，「你最近……幻視的次數，是不是變多了？」\n\n未晞沉默了一會，點頭：「嗯。」\n\n「那……」晴晴的聲音，微微發抖，「你的手環……」\n\n「又掉了兩格。」未晞輕輕說。\n\n「……」晴晴的拳頭，握緊了。\n\n「沒關係。」未晞微笑，「只要……」\n\n「只要什麼？」\n\n「只要……」未晞低下頭，「大家還在身邊，我就……不會迷路。」\n\n「未晞……」晴晴紅著眼眶，「我們一直在。」\n\n「我知道。」未晞笑了，「所以……我才敢繼續『看見』未來。」\n\n可是，只有晴晴注意到了。\n\n未晞說「只是幻視而已」的時候，她低頭，看了一眼手環。\n\n手環上的數字，正從十三，跳成了十二。\n\n「十二天了……」晴晴在心裡，默默地記下了這個數字。\n\n就在孩子們忙著追蹤新管線的時候，學校裡，發生了一件奇怪的事。\n\n那天早上，孩子們走進校門，發現空氣中，瀰漫著一股說不上來的怪味。\n\n「唉，你們有沒有聞到？」老巫抽著鼻子，「一股……燒焦的味道？」\n\n「對耶！」尪伝恺點頭，「好像是從學校後面飄來的！」\n\n「學校後面……」阿釁看向學校後方的方向，「那不是……排水溝的方向嗎？」\n\n「不對，」溜溜忽然從通風管裡鑽出來，聲音凝重，「不是排水溝。是……」\n\n「是什麼？」孩子們問。\n\n「是煙囪。」溜溜說，「學校後面，台中火力發電廠的煙囪，今天的排放量……異常地高。」\n\n「煙囪？」孩子們疑惑，「煙囪不是一直都在冒煙嗎？」\n\n「可是今天的煙，」溜溜的電子眼裡，跳動著數據，「是平常的好幾倍！而且……」牠頓了頓，「我偵測到，工廠的方向，也有大量的排放物……」\n\n「工廠？」阿釁的眼睛一亮，「宏遠食品加工廠？」\n\n「嗯。」溜溜點頭，「而且，不只煙囪……我今天早上，在工廠上空偵測到，他們從『後院』的方向，也在排出大量的煙霧！」\n\n「他們在偷偷排放！」阿釁跳起來，「王老闆又在搞鬼！」\n\n「可是……」晴晴皺起眉頭，「他們為什麼要排放煙霧？」\n\n「不知道。」溜溜搖搖頭，「但是，這些煙霧，正在讓學校的空氣，變得越來越糟。」\n\n就在這時，學校的廣播，忽然響起：\n\n「各位老師、各位同學，請注意——」\n\n「根據環保署空氣品質監測數據，本校周邊地區，空氣品質指標（AQI）已達到『紅害』等級！」\n\n「請各位同學，減少戶外活動！請各班老師，關閉門窗！請同學們，戴上口罩！」\n\n「紅害？！」孩子們倒抽一口涼氣。\n\n「各位同學，請立刻回到教室！」走廊上，傳來老師們的喊聲，「戶外活動，全部取消！」\n\n「快點快點！回教室！」孩子們慌慌張張地跑回教室。\n\n「關窗！全部關窗！」班導師大聲指揮，「把門窗關起來，戴上口罩！」\n\n「好！」孩子們七手八腳地關窗、戴口罩。\n\n「咳咳……」有幾個孩子，忍不住咳嗽起來。\n\n「你們還好吧？」林芸芸擔心地問。\n\n「沒……沒事……」一個女生捂著口罩，「就是……喉嚨有點癢……」\n\n「這空氣……」尪伝恺看著窗外，低聲說，「怎麼會突然變成這樣……」\n\n「一定是煙囪！」阿釁趴在窗邊，看著學校後面那幾根煙囪，「那些煙囪，今天特別用力地在冒煙！」\n\n「不止煙囪，」晴晴低聲說，「還有……工廠。」\n\n「工廠？」孩子們疑惑。\n\n「嗯。」晴晴壓低聲音，「溜溜說，工廠的方向，也在排放煙霧。而且……時間點，太巧了。」\n\n「巧？」\n\n「我們才剛找到新管線的線索，」晴晴說，「天空就『剛好』變灰了。你們不覺得……」她停頓了一下，「太巧了嗎？」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「不管是不是巧合，」阿釁大聲說，「我們都會把真相查清楚！」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n可是，坐在窗邊的未晞，卻一直沒有說話。\n\n她只是靜靜地，看著窗外那片越來越灰的天空。\n\n「未晞，」晴晴走過去，輕輕問，「你在想什麼？」\n\n「我在想……」未晞低聲說，「在我的時代，孩子們的教室，也是這樣關著窗、戴著口罩。」\n\n「……」晴晴沉默了。\n\n「那個時候，」未晞輕輕說，「大人們告訴孩子：『這只是天氣不好。』」\n\n「可是……」未晞抬起頭，看著晴晴，「你們現在已經知道，這不是天氣不好。」\n\n「對。」晴晴點頭，「我們知道。」\n\n「所以，」未晞微微笑了，「你們……跟那個時代的孩子，不一樣了。」\n\n「AQI紅害……」晴晴喃喃地重複著。\n\n「未晞，」阿釁看向未晞，緊張地問，「紅害……是什麼？」\n\n未晞沒有回答。\n\n她只是靜靜地，站在窗邊，看著窗外那片越來越灰的天空。\n\n「這片天空……」她用幾不可聞的聲音說，「跟我的時代……好像。」\n\n「未晞？」晴晴走到她身邊，「你怎麼了？」\n\n「沒什麼。」未晞搖搖頭，轉過身，勉強擠出一個笑容，「我們……繼續調查吧。」\n\n「可是，」林芸芸擔心地說，「現在外面空氣那麼糟，我們還要出去嗎？」\n\n「不用出去。」未晞說，「柯志遠的模擬路線圖，已經幫我們找到了方向。接下來……」她看向溜溜，「交給溜溜。」\n\n「嗶嗶！」溜溜挺起胸膛，「交給我！」\n\n那天下午，溜溜沿著模擬路線，飛進了工業區。\n\n兩個小時後，溜溜帶回來一個晴天霹靂般的消息。\n\n「找到了！」溜溜氣喘吁吁地，「那條新管線的源頭……就在宏遠食品加工廠的『地下儲水槽』！」\n\n「地下儲水槽？」孩子們愣住。\n\n「對！」溜溜說，「他們把廢水，先排進一個地下儲水槽，然後……」牠頓了頓，「再從儲水槽，用一條『暗管』，直接排放進排水溝！」\n\n「暗管？！」阿釁跳起來，「就是那個！新聞裡常報的『暗管』！」\n\n「而且，」溜溜繼續說，「我拍到照片了！暗管的入口、儲水槽的位置、還有……」牠的電子眼裡，閃過一抹光，「排放的時間！」\n\n「排放時間？」晴晴問。\n\n「對！」溜溜點頭，「我偷偷在儲水槽旁邊，藏了一個『監測器』！它記錄了暗管排放的時間——幾乎每天都在排放！」\n\n「每天都在排！」孩子們振奮起來。\n\n「我們有證據了！」阿釁大聲說，「照片、時間、模擬路線圖……這次，證據齊全了！」\n\n「可是，」未晞忽然開口，聲音輕輕的，卻讓整個器材室安靜下來，「王老闆，不會坐以待斃。」\n\n「你什麼意思？」阿釁問。\n\n「他會想辦法，」未晞說，「把證據，再一次『處理掉』。就像上次一樣。」\n\n「那我們……」孩子們緊張起來。\n\n「我們，」未晞的目光，閃爍著堅定的光芒，「要比他更快！」\n\n「對！」阿釁拍案，「我們現在就把證據，交給周嚴主任！交給環保局！」\n\n「可是，」晴晴猶豫了一下，「外面的空氣……」\n\n「沒關係，」未晞說，「我們戴上口罩。」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲說，「戴上口罩！」\n\n就在孩子們準備行動的時候，走廊上，忽然傳來一陣沉穩的腳步聲。\n\n「你們在器材室做什麼？」一個低沉的聲音響起。\n\n是周嚴主任。\n\n「主……主任！」孩子們嚇了一跳。\n\n「我看你們幾個，這幾天，鬼鬼祟祟的。」周嚴主任雙手背在身後，走進器材室，目光掃過牆上的地圖和數據，「說吧，你們查到什麼了？」\n\n「……」孩子們你看我、我看你。\n\n「主任，」最後，晴晴深吸一口氣，站出來，「我們查到了……那條管線的真相。」\n\n她把溜溜拍到的照片、監測數據、柯志遠的模擬路線圖，全部攤在周嚴主任面前。\n\n「……」周嚴主任沉默地，看完了所有證據。\n\n「主任，」阿釁緊張地問，「這些證據……夠嗎？」\n\n「夠了。」周嚴主任的聲音，低沉而有力，「這些證據，我來處理。」\n\n「主任要幫我們？！」孩子們眼睛一亮。\n\n「我不是幫你們。」周嚴主任板著臉，「我只是……看不慣有人，把我們學校的天，弄髒。」\n\n「主任……」孩子們感動得說不出話。\n\n「還有，」周嚴主任看向窗外那片灰濛濛的天空，「空汙警報期間，你們不要亂跑。證據，我來送。」\n\n「可是主任……」阿釁猶豫了一下，「溜溜已經……」\n\n「溜溜已經把證據送出去了。」晴晴接下去。\n\n「……」周嚴主任愣了一下，然後，嘴角微微動了一下，「……那牠跑得倒是挺快的。」\n\n「嗶嗶！」通風管裡，傳來一聲得意的回應。\n\n然而，就在孩子們準備行動的時候，天空，忽然變得更暗了。\n\n「嗶嗶嗶！警告！警告！」溜溜忽然驚慌地大叫，「AQI指數……突破『紫爆』等級！」\n\n「紫爆？！」孩子們瞪大眼睛。\n\n「紅害之上，就是紫爆！」晴晴的臉色，一下子白了，「那是……最嚴重的等級！」\n\n「而且……」溜溜的聲音，微微顫抖，「我偵測到……台中火力發電廠的煙囪，和宏遠食品加工廠的煙囪……排放量，同時暴增！」\n\n「同時暴增？！」阿釁倒抽一口涼氣，「為什麼？！」\n\n「因為……」一個輕輕的聲音，從角落響起。\n\n是未晞。\n\n她的臉色，異常蒼白，像是知道了什麼。\n\n「因為……」未晞低聲說，「他們在『煙霧掩護』。」\n\n「煙霧掩護？」孩子們愣住。\n\n「排放廢水，會被檢驗出來。可是……」未晞說，「排放『煙霧』，只會被當成『空汙』。只要天空一片灰濛濛的……大家就會以為，那是『天氣不好』，而不是……」她停頓了一下，「工廠在偷排。」\n\n「你是說……」晴晴的臉色，也白了，「他們故意把天空弄髒，讓大家『看不見』排水溝的真相？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「而且……空汙警報一發布，孩子們就會被關在教室裡。這樣……」她低下頭，「我們調查的行動，也會被『困住』。」\n\n「太狡猾了！」阿釁氣得握緊拳頭，「王老闆，居然連天氣都利用！」\n\n「那我們……」林芸芸害怕地問，「我們是不是……不能調查了？」\n\n「當然要！」阿釁大聲說，「越是被困住，我們越要查！」\n\n「可是，」晴晴冷靜地分析，「未晞說得對。空汙警報發布後，戶外活動會被禁止。我們去不了工業區……證據，也送不出去。」\n\n「那我們就……」阿釁想了想，忽然，眼睛一亮，「那就讓證據，『自己飛』出去！」\n\n「自己飛？」孩子們疑惑。\n\n「溜溜！」阿釁看向溜溜，「你能飛多高？」\n\n「嗶嗶？」溜溜愣了一下，隨即挺起胸膛，「我可以飛得很高！比煙囪還高！」\n\n「好！」阿釁拍案，「那我們就把證據，綁在溜溜身上！讓溜溜，飛過煙囪、飛過灰濛濛的天空，把證據，直接送到環保局！」\n\n「飛過去……」孩子們的眼睛，亮了。\n\n「對！」阿釁大聲說，「天空雖然灰了，可是……溜溜不怕灰！」\n\n「嗶嗶嗶！」溜溜興奮地轉了一圈，「交給我！我可是全校最快的！」\n\n「可是，」未晞輕輕開口，「溜溜，你要小心。天空灰濛濛的……你要記得，飛得高一點。」\n\n「嗶嗶！」溜溜認真地點頭，「我會飛得高高的，讓煙霧碰不到我！」\n\n「好！」阿釁把證據（照片、監測數據、模擬路線圖）小心翼翼地，綁在溜溜身上，「出發！」\n\n「嗶嗶嗶——！」\n\n溜溜小小的身影，衝出器材室，沖向那片灰濛濛的天空。\n\n孩子們擠在窗口，看著溜溜的身影，越飛越高，越飛越高……直到消失在灰色的雲層裡。\n\n「溜溜，加油啊……」阿釁趴在窗口，喃喃自語。\n\n「牠會成功的。」晴晴說，「溜溜可是……」\n\n「全校最快的。」未晞接下去，聲音輕輕的。\n\n而此時，灰濛濛的天空中，溜溜正努力地，飛著。\n\n「嗶嗶……好嗆……」溜溜用尾巴摀住鼻子，「這煙霧……比我想像的還要濃……」\n\n牠抬頭，看到前方，矗立著幾根巨大的煙囪，正吐著濃濃的白煙。\n\n「就是那些煙囪……」溜溜的電子眼裡，閃過一抹堅定，「我要飛得比它們還高！」\n\n牠鼓起全身的力氣，翅膀用力一振——「嗖！」\n\n溜溜的身影，沖天而起！\n\n穿過第一層煙霧……穿過第二層煙霧……穿過煙囪的頂端……\n\n「嗶嗶！」溜溜低頭，看著腳下的煙囪，「我飛過來了！」\n\n牠繼續往前飛，飛過工業區、飛過大馬路、飛過一條又一條的街道……\n\n「看到了！」溜溜的眼睛一亮，「環保局！」\n\n牠一個俯衝，穩穩地，降落在環保局的大門口。\n\n「嗶嗶！」溜溜從身上取下證據，放在門口，「送到了！」\n\n「什麼東西？」環保局的警衛，走出來，看到地上的證據，愣住了，「這是……」\n\n「嗶嗶！」溜溜對著警衛，用力點頭，然後，一個轉身，沖天而起，往學校的方向飛回去。\n\n「等等！那是什麼？！」警衛撿起證據，大聲喊，「喂！等一下！」\n\n可是，溜溜已經飛遠了。\n\n只留下一句迴盪在風中的話：\n\n「嗶嗶！證據，送到！」\n\n「會成功的……對吧？」林芸芸小聲說。\n\n「會的。」未晞輕輕說，「因為……溜溜是全校最快的。」\n\n「而且，」阿釁補充，「天空再灰，也擋不住我們的心。」\n\n等待的兩個小時，像是兩年那麼長。\n\n「怎麼還沒回來……」阿釁在器材室裡，來回踱步。\n\n「別急。」晴晴壓低聲音，「溜溜會回來的。」\n\n「可是……」阿釁的手心，全是冷汗，「要是牠在天空中迷路了……」\n\n「不會的。」未晞說，「溜溜記得回家的路。」\n\n「可是……」阿釁還是很緊張，「這是我第一次，讓溜溜一個人飛那麼遠……」\n\n「阿釁，」晴晴拍拍他的肩膀，「你忘記了嗎？溜溜可是從工業區的保全手裡，把老巫救出來的情報王！」\n\n「對……對喔！」阿釁想起那件事，稍微鬆了一口氣，「牠可是連保全都追不上的溜溜！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑了。\n\n「對了，未晞，」笑完之後，晴晴忽然問，「你剛剛說……『紫爆』……」\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「紅害的下一級，就是紫爆。紫爆的時候，所有人，都應該待在室內。」\n\n「那……」晴晴猶豫了一下，「紫爆……是不是很可怕？」\n\n未晞沒有馬上回答。\n\n她低頭，沉默了許久。\n\n「在我的時代，」她輕輕說，「『紫爆』是……『日常』。」\n\n「日常？！」孩子們瞪大眼睛。\n\n「嗯。」未晞說，「在我的時代，天空常常是紫灰色的。大人們說：『戴口罩出門，是基本禮貌。』孩子們的作文題目，是《我家的空氣清淨機》。學校的運動會，常常因為空汙，改成室內舉行。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「所以，」未晞抬起頭，聲音輕輕的，卻異常堅定，「我不希望……這個時代，也變成那樣。」\n\n「不會的！」阿釁大聲說，「我們會讓它，不一樣！」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n未晞看著孩子們，眼眶，微微泛紅。\n\n「……謝謝你們。」她低聲說。\n\n就在這時——\n\n「嗶嗶嗶嗶！！！」\n\n一道銀白色的身影，從通風管裡，衝了進來！\n\n「任務完成！」溜溜氣喘吁吁地，身上的證據，已經不見了，「證據……送到了！」\n\n「送到了？！」孩子們爆出歡呼！\n\n「環保局的人說，」溜溜興奮地轉著圈，「他們會立刻複查！而且……」牠停頓了一下，「他們說，這次，會派『突擊檢查』！」\n\n「突擊檢查！」阿釁跳起來，「太好了！」\n\n「可是……」未晞忽然開口，聲音輕輕的，卻讓孩子們安靜下來，「在他們檢查之前，王老闆，還會反擊。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「所以，」未晞看向窗外那片灰濛濛的天空，「我們要保護好自己，也要……保護好彼此。」\n\n「未晞……」晴晴看向她，忽然，她的目光，落在了未晞的手腕上。\n\n「未晞！你的手環！」晴晴驚呼，「數字……」\n\n未晞低頭一看。\n\n手環上的數字，正從十二，跳成了……十。\n\n「十……十了……」晴晴的聲音，微微顫抖。\n\n「沒關係。」未晞把袖子拉下來，蓋住手環，「還夠用。」\n\n「夠用什麼！」阿釁紅著眼眶，「十……十天……」\n\n「十天，」未晞微微笑了，「夠我們，看到那一天。」\n\n「那一天？」\n\n「看到……」未晞看向窗外，「看到這片天空，恢復藍色的那一天。」\n\n窗外，天空依然灰濛濛的。\n\n可是，孩子們的眼睛裡，卻亮著光。\n\n那天晚上，未晞一個人，坐在教室裡，看著窗外的夜空。\n\n手環上的數字，在月光下，靜靜地閃爍。\n\n——十。\n\n「十天……」她低聲說，「剛剛好。」\n\n「剛剛好夠……」她閉上眼睛，「看完這場『大作戰』的結局。」\n\n「還有……」她輕輕地，摸了摸手環，「剛剛好夠……跟大家，說再見。」\n\n月光，靜靜地照著她。\n\n窗外的天空，依然灰濛濛的。\n\n可是，在灰濛濛的天空深處，有一顆星星，正努力地，閃爍著。\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 19: The Red Alert for Air Pollution\n\nIn the first week of \"Full Deployment,\" the children's morale was high.\n\n\"Weixi, we found it!\" Ke Zhiyuan ran into the equipment room excitedly, holding up his laptop, \"Based on Liu-Liu's reconnaissance data, I drew a 'simulated route map' of that new pipe!\"\n\n\"Great!\" Weixi leaned in to look, \"This pipe really does loop around the old pipe's location!\"\n\n\"And,\" Ke Zhiyuan added, \"my computer simulation shows that where it ends up converging is right near the mouth of the drainage ditch!\"\n\n\"Then all we have to do is...\" A-Xin's eyes lit up, \"follow this simulated route to find its 'source'!\"\n\n\"Right!\" Weixi nodded, \"We...\"\n\nHer words suddenly stopped.\n\n\"Weixi?\" Qingqing asked nervously, \"Are you...\"\n\n\"I'm... I'm fine.\" Weixi shook her head, forcing a smile, \"It's just... a scene flashed before my eyes just now...\"\n\n\"What scene?\" The children asked nervously.\n\n\"A grayish-yellow sky...\" Weixi said in a low voice, \"on the school playground, no one was playing...\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"It's okay,\" Weixi comforted everyone, \"It's just a flashback. Let's continue...\"\n\nActually, that wasn't the first time Weixi had \"seen\" a flash of the future.\n\nThese past two days, her flashbacks had grown more and more frequent.\n\nAt mealtimes, she would suddenly stop her chopsticks and stare blankly at the food on the table—because in the flashback, food was rationed, one small bowl per person.\n\nDuring class, she would suddenly look out the window—because in the flashback, the sky outside the window was grayish-yellow.\n\nAfter school, she would stand at the school gate for a very, very long time—because in the flashback, there were no phoenix trees at the school gate, only a row of dead trees.\n\n\"Weixi,\" after school one day, Qingqing finally couldn't help asking, \"have your flashbacks... been getting more frequent lately?\"\n\nWeixi was silent for a moment, then nodded: \"Mhm.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Qingqing's voice trembled slightly, \"your bracelet...\"\n\n\"It dropped another two digits.\" Weixi said softly.\n\n\"...\" Qingqing's fist clenched.\n\n\"It's okay.\" Weixi smiled, \"As long...\"\n\n\"As long as what?\"\n\n\"As long...\" Weixi lowered her head, \"as everyone is still by my side, I won't... get lost.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" Qingqing's eyes reddened, \"we'll always be here.\"\n\n\"I know.\" Weixi smiled, \"That's why... I dare to keep 'seeing' the future.\"\n\nBut only Qingqing noticed.\n\nWhen Weixi said \"It's just a flashback,\" she lowered her head and glanced at the bracelet.\n\nThe number on the bracelet had jumped from thirteen to twelve.\n\n\"Twelve days...\" Qingqing silently noted this number in her heart.\n\nJust as the children were busy tracking the new pipe, a strange thing happened at school.\n\nThat morning, as the children walked through the school gate, they noticed a nameless strange smell in the air.\n\n\"Hey, do you guys smell that?\" Old Wu sniffed, \"A... burning smell?\"\n\n\"Yeah!\" Wang Zhuankai nodded, \"It seems to be coming from behind the school!\"\n\n\"Behind the school...\" A-Xin looked in the direction behind the school, \"Isn't that... the direction of the drainage ditch?\"\n\n\"No,\" Liu-Liu suddenly popped out of the ventilation duct, its voice grave, \"it's not the drainage ditch. It's...\"\n\n\"What is it?\" The children asked.\n\n\"The smokestacks.\" Liu-Liu said, \"Behind the school, the smokestacks of the Taichung Thermal Power Plant—their discharge today... is abnormally high.\"\n\n\"Smokestacks?\" The children were puzzled, \"Aren't the smokestacks always smoking?\"\n\n\"But today's smoke,\" data dancing in Liu-Liu's electronic eyes, \"is several times the usual amount! And...\" it paused, \"I detected large amounts of discharge from the direction of the factory too...\"\n\n\"The factory?\" A-Xin's eyes lit up, \"Hongyuan Food Processing Factory?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Liu-Liu nodded, \"And, it's not just the smokestacks... this morning, I detected over the factory that they're also emitting large amounts of smoke from the 'backyard' direction!\"\n\n\"They're secretly discharging!\" A-Xin jumped up, \"Boss Wang is up to his tricks again!\"\n\n\"But...\" Qingqing frowned, \"why would they discharge smoke?\"\n\n\"I don't know.\" Liu-Liu shook its head, \"But these fumes are making the school's air worse and worse.\"\n\nJust then, the school's broadcast suddenly sounded:\n\n\"Attention, all teachers and students—\"\n\n\"According to the Environmental Protection Administration's air quality monitoring data, the air quality index (AQI) in the area around our school has reached the 'red alert' level!\"\n\n\"Please reduce outdoor activities! Teachers, please close the doors and windows! Students, please put on your masks!\"\n\n\"Red alert?!\" The children gasped.\n\n\"Everyone, return to your classrooms immediately!\" The teachers' shouts came from the hallway, \"All outdoor activities are cancelled!\"\n\n\"Hurry, hurry! Back to the classroom!\" The children scrambled back into the classroom.\n\n\"Close the windows! Close all the windows!\" The homeroom teacher directed loudly, \"Shut the doors and windows, put on your masks!\"\n\n\"Okay!\" The children hastily closed windows and put on masks.\n\n\"Cough, cough...\" A few children couldn't help coughing.\n\n\"Are you all okay?\" Lin Yunyun asked worriedly.\n\n\"I'm... I'm fine...\" A girl covered her mouth with her mask, \"it's just... my throat feels a little itchy...\"\n\n\"This air...\" Wang Zhuankai looked out the window, saying in a low voice, \"how did it suddenly become like this...\"\n\n\"It must be the smokestacks!\" A-Xin pressed against the window, looking at the smokestacks behind the school, \"Those smokestacks are really puffing hard today!\"\n\n\"Not just the smokestacks,\" Qingqing said in a low voice, \"and... the factory.\"\n\n\"The factory?\" The children were puzzled.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Qingqing lowered her voice, \"Liu-Liu said the factory is also emitting smoke. And... the timing is too convenient.\"\n\n\"Convenient?\"\n\n\"We just found clues about the new pipe,\" Qingqing said, \"and the sky 'just happened' to turn gray. Don't you think...\" she paused, \"it's too much of a coincidence?\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"Whether it's a coincidence or not,\" A-Xin said loudly, \"we're going to find out the truth!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children said in unison.\n\nBut Weixi, sitting by the window, hadn't spoken at all.\n\nShe just quietly watched the graying sky outside the window.\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing walked over and asked softly, \"what are you thinking about?\"\n\n\"I'm thinking...\" Weixi said in a low voice, \"in my era, children's classrooms were like this too—windows closed, wearing masks.\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing fell silent.\n\n\"Back then,\" Weixi said softly, \"the adults told the children: 'It's just bad weather.'\"\n\n\"But...\" Weixi looked up at Qingqing, \"you now know that this isn't just bad weather.\"\n\n\"Right.\" Qingqing nodded, \"We know.\"\n\n\"So,\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"you... are different from the children of that era.\"\n\n\"AQI red alert...\" Qingqing murmured in repetition.\n\n\"Weixi,\" A-Xin looked at Weixi and asked nervously, \"what is... a red alert?\"\n\nWeixi didn't answer.\n\nShe just stood quietly by the window, watching the graying sky outside.\n\n\"This sky...\" she said in a barely audible voice, \"looks just like... my era.\"\n\n\"Weixi?\" Qingqing walked to her side, \"What's wrong?\"\n\n\"Nothing.\" Weixi shook her head, turned around, and forced a smile, \"Let's... continue the investigation.\"\n\n\"But,\" Lin Yunyun said worriedly, \"the air outside is so bad now, do we still have to go out?\"\n\n\"We don't need to go out.\" Weixi said, \"Ke Zhiyuan's simulated route map has already shown us the direction. Next...\" she looked at Liu-Liu, \"leave it to Liu-Liu.\"\n\n\"Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu puffed out its chest, \"Leave it to me!\"\n\nThat afternoon, Liu-Liu flew into the industrial zone along the simulated route.\n\nTwo hours later, Liu-Liu brought back news like a thunderbolt.\n\n\"Found it!\" Liu-Liu panted, \"The source of that new pipe... is in Hongyuan Food Processing Factory's 'underground storage tank'!\"\n\n\"Underground storage tank?\" The children were stunned.\n\n\"Yes!\" Liu-Liu said, \"They first pump the wastewater into an underground storage tank, and then...\" it paused, \"from the tank, through a 'hidden pipe,' they discharge it directly into the drainage ditch!\"\n\n\"A hidden pipe?!\" A-Xin jumped up, \"That's it! The 'hidden pipe' that's always in the news!\"\n\n\"And,\" Liu-Liu continued, \"I took photos! The entrance of the hidden pipe, the location of the storage tank, and also...\" a light flickered in its electronic eyes, \"the discharge times!\"\n\n\"Discharge times?\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"Yes!\" Liu-Liu nodded, \"I secretly hid a 'monitor' beside the storage tank! It recorded the times the hidden pipe discharged—it's discharging almost every day!\"\n\n\"Discharging every day!\" The children were invigorated.\n\n\"We have evidence!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"Photos, times, simulated route map... this time, the evidence is complete!\"\n\n\"But,\" Weixi suddenly spoke, her voice soft yet silencing the equipment room, \"Boss Wang won't sit still.\"\n\n\"What do you mean?\" A-Xin asked.\n\n\"He'll find a way,\" Weixi said, \"to 'dispose of' the evidence again. Just like last time.\"\n\n\"Then we...\" The children grew tense.\n\n\"We,\" a resolute light flickered in Weixi's eyes, \"have to be faster than him!\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin slapped the table, \"Let's hand the evidence to Dean Zhou right now! To the environmental protection bureau!\"\n\n\"But,\" Qingqing hesitated, \"the air outside...\"\n\n\"It's okay,\" Weixi said, \"we'll wear masks.\"\n\n\"Right!\" The children said in unison, \"Wear masks!\"\n\nJust as the children were about to act, steady footsteps suddenly sounded in the hallway.\n\n\"What are you doing in the equipment room?\" A low voice rang out.\n\nIt was Dean Zhou.\n\n\"D-Dean!\" The children jumped in fright.\n\n\"I've noticed you kids sneaking around these past few days.\" Dean Zhou stood with his hands behind his back, walking into the equipment room, his gaze sweeping over the maps and data on the wall, \"Go on, what have you found?\"\n\n\"...\" The children looked at each other.\n\n\"Dean,\" finally, Qingqing took a deep breath and stepped forward, \"we found... the truth about that pipe.\"\n\nShe spread out the photos Liu-Liu had taken, the monitoring data, and Ke Zhiyuan's simulated route map, all before Dean Zhou.\n\n\"...\" Dean Zhou silently examined all the evidence.\n\n\"Dean,\" A-Xin asked nervously, \"is this evidence... enough?\"\n\n\"Enough.\" Dean Zhou's voice was low and powerful, \"I'll handle this evidence.\"\n\n\"The Dean is helping us?!\" The children's eyes lit up.\n\n\"I'm not helping you.\" Dean Zhou put on a stern face, \"I just... can't stand someone dirtying our school's sky.\"\n\n\"Dean...\" The children were too moved to speak.\n\n\"And,\" Dean Zhou looked at the graying sky outside the window, \"during the air pollution alert, don't run around. I'll deliver the evidence.\"\n\n\"But Dean...\" A-Xin hesitated, \"Liu-Liu already...\"\n\n\"Liu-Liu has already delivered the evidence.\" Qingqing finished.\n\n\"...\" Dean Zhou froze for a moment, then the corner of his mouth twitched slightly, \"...Then it certainly ran fast.\"\n\n\"Beep beep!\" A proud response came from the ventilation duct.\n\nHowever, just as the children were about to act, the sky suddenly grew even darker.\n\n\"Beep beep beep! Warning! Warning!\" Liu-Liu suddenly shouted in panic, \"The AQI index... has broken through the 'purple explosion' level!\"\n\n\"Purple explosion?!\" The children's eyes went wide.\n\n\"Above red alert is purple explosion!\" Qingqing's face instantly turned pale, \"That's... the most severe level!\"\n\n\"And...\" Liu-Liu's voice trembled slightly, \"I detected... the smokestacks of the Taichung Thermal Power Plant and the smokestacks of Hongyuan Food Processing Factory... are both surging in discharge at the same time!\"\n\n\"Surging at the same time?!\" A-Xin gasped, \"Why?!\"\n\n\"Because...\" a soft voice came from the corner.\n\nIt was Weixi.\n\nHer face was abnormally pale, as if she knew something.\n\n\"Because...\" Weixi said in a low voice, \"they're using 'smoke cover.'\"\n\n\"Smoke cover?\" The children were stunned.\n\n\"Discharging wastewater can be tested and detected. But...\" Weixi said, \"discharging 'smoke' will just be treated as 'air pollution.' As long as the sky is gray and hazy... everyone will think it's 'bad weather,' not...\" she paused, \"that the factory is secretly discharging.\"\n\n\"You mean...\" Qingqing's face paled too, \"they deliberately dirtied the sky so everyone would 'not see' the truth about the drainage ditch?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"And... once the air pollution alert is issued, the children will be kept inside the classrooms. That way...\" she lowered her head, \"our investigation will also be 'trapped.'\"\n\n\"How cunning!\" A-Xin clenched his fist in anger, \"Boss Wang is even using the weather!\"\n\n\"Then we...\" Lin Yunyun asked fearfully, \"can we... not investigate anymore?\"\n\n\"Of course we will!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"The more trapped we are, the more we have to investigate!\"\n\n\"But,\" Qingqing analyzed calmly, \"Weixi is right. Once the air pollution alert is issued, outdoor activities will be banned. We can't go to the industrial zone... and the evidence can't be delivered either.\"\n\n\"Then we'll...\" A-Xin thought for a moment, and then his eyes suddenly lit up, \"we'll let the evidence 'fly' out by itself!\"\n\n\"Fly by itself?\" The children were puzzled.\n\n\"Liu-Liu!\" A-Xin looked at Liu-Liu, \"How high can you fly?\"\n\n\"Beep beep?\" Liu-Liu blinked, then puffed out its chest, \"I can fly very high! Higher than the smokestacks!\"\n\n\"Great!\" A-Xin slapped the table, \"Then we'll tie the evidence onto Liu-Liu! Let Liu-Liu fly over the smokestacks, over the gray sky, and deliver the evidence straight to the environmental protection bureau!\"\n\n\"Fly over...\" The children's eyes lit up.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"The sky is gray, but... Liu-Liu isn't afraid of gray!\"\n\n\"Beep beep beep!\" Liu-Liu spun around excitedly, \"Leave it to me! I'm the fastest in the school!\"\n\n\"But,\" Weixi spoke softly, \"Liu-Liu, you have to be careful. The sky is hazy... remember, fly high.\"\n\n\"Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu nodded seriously, \"I'll fly high, so the smoke can't reach me!\"\n\n\"Great!\" A-Xin carefully tied the evidence—the photos, monitoring data, and simulated route map—onto Liu-Liu's body, \"Move out!\"\n\n\"Beep beep beep—!\"\n\nLiu-Liu's small figure rushed out of the equipment room, charging into that gray, hazy sky.\n\nThe children crowded at the window, watching Liu-Liu's figure fly higher and higher, higher and higher... until it disappeared into the gray clouds.\n\n\"Go, Liu-Liu...\" A-Xin pressed against the window, murmuring to himself.\n\n\"It will succeed.\" Qingqing said, \"Liu-Liu is...\"\n\n\"The fastest in the school.\" Weixi continued, her voice soft.\n\nMeanwhile, in the gray, hazy sky, Liu-Liu was flying with all its might.\n\n\"Beep beep... so choking...\" Liu-Liu covered its nose with its tail, \"this smoke... is thicker than I imagined...\"\n\nIt looked up and saw, up ahead, several giant smokestacks puffing out thick white smoke.\n\n\"Those smokestacks...\" a resolute light flickered in Liu-Liu's electronic eyes, \"I'm going to fly higher than them!\"\n\nIt gathered all its strength and gave its wings a powerful flap—\"Swish!\"\n\nLiu-Liu's figure shot straight up into the sky!\n\nThrough the first layer of smoke... through the second layer of smoke... past the tops of the smokestacks...\n\n\"Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu looked down at the smokestacks below its feet, \"I flew over them!\"\n\nIt flew on, over the industrial zone, over the main road, over street after street...\n\n\"I see it!\" Liu-Liu's eyes lit up, \"The environmental protection bureau!\"\n\nIt dived down and landed steadily at the bureau's main gate.\n\n\"Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu took the evidence off its body and placed it at the door, \"Delivered!\"\n\n\"What is this?\" The bureau's guard walked out, saw the evidence on the ground, and froze, \"This is...\"\n\n\"Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu nodded hard at the guard, then turned and shot back up into the sky, flying back toward the school.\n\n\"Wait! What is that?!\" The guard picked up the evidence and shouted, \"Hey! Wait!\"\n\nBut Liu-Liu had already flown far away.\n\nAll that remained was a phrase echoing in the wind:\n\n\"Beep beep! Evidence, delivered!\"\n\n\"It will succeed... right?\" Lin Yunyun asked quietly.\n\n\"It will.\" Weixi said softly, \"Because... Liu-Liu is the fastest in the school.\"\n\n\"And,\" A-Xin added, \"no matter how gray the sky is, it can't block our hearts.\"\n\nTwo hours of waiting felt like two years.\n\n\"Why isn't it back yet...\" A-Xin paced back and forth in the equipment room.\n\n\"Easy.\" Qingqing lowered her voice, \"Liu-Liu will come back.\"\n\n\"But...\" A-Xin's palms were covered in cold sweat, \"what if it gets lost in the sky...\"\n\n\"It won't.\" Weixi said, \"Liu-Liu remembers the way home. Because...\" she smiled faintly, \"this is its home.\"\n\n\"But...\" A-Xin was still nervous, \"this is the first time I've sent Liu-Liu flying so far alone...\"\n\n\"A-Xin,\" Qingqing patted his shoulder, \"have you forgotten? Liu-Liu is the intel king who rescued Old Wu from the industrial zone's guards!\"\n\n\"Right... right!\" A-Xin remembered that and relaxed a little, \"It's the Liu-Liu that even the guards can't catch!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed.\n\n\"By the way, Weixi,\" after the laughter, Qingqing suddenly asked, \"you just mentioned... 'purple explosion'...\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"One level above red alert is purple explosion. During purple explosion, everyone should stay indoors.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Qingqing hesitated, \"is purple explosion... very scary?\"\n\nWeixi didn't answer right away.\n\nShe lowered her head and was silent for a long time.\n\n\"In my era,\" she said softly, \"'purple explosion' was... 'everyday life.'\"\n\n\"Everyday life?!\" The children's eyes went wide.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi said, \"In my era, the sky was often purple-gray. The adults said: 'Wearing a mask when you go out is basic courtesy.' Children's essay topics included 'My Family's Air Purifier.' School sports days were often changed to indoors because of air pollution.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"So,\" Weixi looked up, her voice soft yet exceptionally resolute, \"I don't want... this era to become like that either.\"\n\n\"It won't!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"We'll make it different!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children said in unison.\n\nLooking at the children, Weixi's eyes reddened slightly.\n\n\"...Thank you.\" she said in a low voice.\n\nJust then—\n\n\"Beep beep beep beep!!!\"\n\nA silver-white figure burst in through the ventilation duct!\n\n\"Mission complete!\" Liu-Liu panted, the evidence on its body already gone, \"the evidence... was delivered!\"\n\n\"Delivered?!\" The children burst into cheers!\n\n\"The environmental protection bureau people said,\" Liu-Liu spun around excitedly, \"they'll re-inspect immediately! And...\" it paused, \"they said this time, they'll do a 'surprise inspection'!\"\n\n\"A surprise inspection!\" A-Xin jumped up, \"Great!\"\n\n\"But...\" Weixi suddenly spoke, her voice soft yet silencing the children, \"before their inspection, Boss Wang will counterattack again.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"So,\" Weixi looked at the gray, hazy sky outside the window, \"we have to protect ourselves, and also... protect each other.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" Qingqing looked at her, and then, her gaze suddenly landed on Weixi's wrist.\n\n\"Weixi! Your bracelet!\" Qingqing cried out, \"the number...\"\n\nWeixi looked down.\n\nThe number on the bracelet had jumped from twelve to... ten.\n\n\"Ten... ten now...\" Qingqing's voice trembled slightly.\n\n\"It's okay.\" Weixi pulled her sleeve down, covering the bracelet, \"There's still enough.\"\n\n\"Enough for what!\" A-Xin's eyes were red, \"Ten... ten days...\"\n\n\"Ten days,\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"is enough for us to see that day.\"\n\n\"That day?\"\n\n\"To see...\" Weixi looked out the window, \"the day this sky turns blue again.\"\n\nOutside the window, the sky was still gray and hazy.\n\nBut in the children's eyes, there was light.\n\nThat night, Weixi sat alone in the classroom, looking at the night sky outside the window.\n\nThe number on the bracelet flickered quietly in the moonlight.\n\n—Ten.\n\n\"Ten days...\" she said in a low voice, \"just right.\"\n\n\"Just right enough...\" she closed her eyes, \"to watch the ending of this 'Campaign.'\"\n\n\"And...\" she gently touched the bracelet, \"just right enough... to say goodbye to everyone.\"\n\nThe moonlight shone quietly on her.\n\nOutside the window, the sky was still gray and hazy.\n\nBut deep within that gray, hazy sky, a single star was trying its hardest to shine.\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":4,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第二十章：極限蒐證行動\n\n溜溜送出的證據，在環保局，掀起了不小的波瀾。\n\n「確認！這些照片和數據，與我們收到的檢舉內容一致！」環保局的會議室裡，稽查組長拍著桌子，「這個『宏遠食品加工廠』，果然有問題！」\n\n「組長，」一名稽查員皺著眉頭，「可是，上次我們去稽查，他們把管線埋掉了，我們什麼都沒查到。」\n\n「這次不一樣。」組長說，「這次，我們有孩子們提供的『模擬路線圖』！我們知道他們的暗管藏在哪裡！」\n\n「那我們……」\n\n「先別急。」組長搖了搖手指，「要抓現行，必須拿到他們『正在排放』的證據。我們要……」他的眼神，閃過一抹銳利的光芒，「突擊！」\n\n「突擊？」\n\n「對！夜間突擊！」組長說，「孩子們的監測資料顯示，暗管排放的時間，集中在深夜。我們要在他們排放的時候，當場抓住！」\n\n「可是……」稽查員猶豫了一下，「那個孩子說的『地下儲水槽』，我們沒有地圖……」\n\n「有。」組長打開柯志遠的模擬路線圖，「這份地圖，畫得非常詳細。這個孩子……」他看著圖上的註記，「以後可以來我們單位上班。」\n\n然而，環保局的「突擊計劃」，卻被一個人，搶先一步知道了。\n\n「老闆！環保局那邊，有動靜！」深夜，宏遠食品加工廠的辦公室裡，一個黑衣人，湊到王富貴耳邊，「他們好像在籌劃『突擊檢查』！」\n\n「突擊？」王富貴的臉色，一下子沉了下來，「他們怎麼會知道……」\n\n「聽說……」黑衣人壓低聲音，「是那間學校的小鬼們，把證據送到了環保局。」\n\n「那群小鬼？！」王富貴猛地站起來，「又是他們！」\n\n「老闆，怎麼辦？」\n\n「怎麼辦？」王富貴冷笑一聲，「他們要突擊，我們就……」他想了想，「把排放時間，改到白天。」\n\n「白天？！」黑衣人愣住，「白天不是更容易被抓到？」\n\n「越是危險的地方，越安全。」王富貴得意地說，「他們以為我們只會在晚上排，我們偏偏白天排！等他們晚上來突擊……看到的，只會是一條『乾淨』的溝！」\n\n「高！老闆實在是高！」黑衣人諂媚地豎起大拇指。\n\n「還有，」王富貴的眼神，閃過一抹陰狠，「派人，盯著那間學校。那群小鬼，要是敢再搞什麼花樣……」\n\n「老闆的意思是？」\n\n「嚇唬嚇唬他們的家長。」王富貴說，「讓那些小鬼知道，多管閒事，沒有好下場。」\n\n「明白！」\n\n夜，更深了。\n\n而孩子們，還不知道，一場更大的風暴，正在逼近。\n\n「未晞，」隔天早上，晴晴發現未晞的臉色，又白了一點，「你昨晚，又沒睡好？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞輕輕點頭，「昨晚……我又『看見』了一些東西。」\n\n「什麼東西？」\n\n「我看見……」未晞低聲說，「一場大雨。」\n\n「大雨？」晴晴愣住。\n\n「嗯。」未晞說，「一場很大的雨，把那條排水溝，沖得乾乾淨淨。」\n\n「那不是很好嗎？」阿釁湊過來，「下大雨，把排水溝沖乾淨！」\n\n「可是……」未晞搖搖頭，眼神裡帶著不安，「我看到的『雨』……很奇怪。它的顏色……」\n\n「顏色？」\n\n「是灰黑色的。」未晞說，「我從來沒有見過，那種顏色的雨。」\n\n「灰黑色的雨……」孩子們面面相覷。\n\n「灰黑色的雨……」阿釁歪著頭，「有這種雨嗎？」\n\n「我記得，」尪伝恺舉手，「電視新聞有報過！有一次，某個地方下了一場『黑雨』，後來發現，是工廠排的黑煙，混進了雨水裡！」\n\n「工廠的黑煙……」晴晴的臉色，微微一變，「那不就是……」\n\n「就是我們這裡。」未晞低聲說，「台中火力發電廠的煙囪，還有……工廠的煙囪。如果它們的排放量，繼續增加……」\n\n「雨就會變成黑的？」林芸芸害怕地問。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「在我聽過的『未來的故事』裡……就曾經下過黑雨。那場雨之後，很多人的喉嚨，都開始不舒服。」\n\n「那……那我們……」孩子們的臉色，都白了。\n\n「所以，」未晞深吸一口氣，「我們更要把真相，查清楚。讓那些煙囪……停下來。」\n\n「對！」阿釁大聲說，「讓它們停下來！」\n\n「讓它們停下來！」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n「可是，未晞，」晴晴擔心地看著她，「你的身體……」\n\n「沒關係。」未晞微笑，「只要你們在我身邊，我就可以……繼續走下去。」\n\n「未晞……」孩子們的眼眶，紅了。\n\n「所以，」未晞看著大家，輕輕說，「我們一起，讓那場『黑雨』……永遠不要下下來。」\n\n「好——！」孩子們大聲回應。\n\n「未晞，」晴晴擔心地問，「你是不是……又在擔心什麼？」\n\n「我不知道。」未晞低下頭，「我只覺得……好像有什麼事情，快要發生了。」\n\n「不管發生什麼事，」阿釁大聲說，「我們都會一起面對！」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n就在這時，溜溜忽然從通風管裡，急沖沖地竄出來：\n\n「嗶嗶！不好了！大事不好了！」\n\n「怎麼了？」孩子們緊張地問。\n\n「我剛剛潛入工業區偵察，」溜溜喘著氣，「發現……那條暗管，現在！正在排放！」\n\n「現在？！」阿釁瞪大眼睛，「大白天的？！」\n\n「對！」溜溜點頭，「而且，排放的量，比晚上還大！」\n\n「他們怎麼會在白天排？」晴晴皺起眉頭，「這不合常理……」\n\n「除非……」未晞忽然開口，聲音輕輕的，卻讓整個教室安靜下來，「他們知道環保局要突擊檢查了。」\n\n「什麼？！」孩子們倒抽一口涼氣。\n\n「他們把排放時間，改到了白天。」未晞說，「這樣，環保局晚上來突擊……什麼都查不到。」\n\n「太狡猾了！」阿釁氣得跺腳，「王老闆，真是……」\n\n「而且，」溜溜補充，「他們還派人，在學校附近盯梢！」\n\n「盯梢？」孩子們臉色一變。\n\n「對！」溜溜說，「學校門口、側門，都有他們的人！」\n\n「他們在監視我們！」晴晴的臉色，沉了下來。\n\n「那我們……」林芸芸害怕地問，「我們是不是……什麼都不能做了？」\n\n「誰說的！」阿釁大聲說，「他們要盯梢，我們就……」他的眼睛，忽然一亮，「我們就『偷偷地』行動！」\n\n「偷偷地？」\n\n「對！」阿釁壓低聲音，「他們盯的是『學校』。那我們就……『從學校外面』行動！」\n\n「學校外面？」孩子們疑惑。\n\n「我們可以放學後，繞到工業區的另一邊！」阿釁說，「他們盯的是學校，不會想到，我們會從別的地方，繞進工業區！」\n\n「可是……」晴晴猶豫了一下，「工業區的另一邊，是圍牆……」\n\n「圍牆，」老巫站起來，拍了拍自己的肩膀，「有我啊！」\n\n「老巫……」孩子們看著他。\n\n「我可是『人體盾牌』！」老巫大聲說，「你們忘了嗎？『守護地球作戰部隊・全員出動』，我的任務，就是帶著大家，突破困難！」\n\n「對！」阿釁拍案，「『極限蒐證行動』，正式開始！」\n\n「極限蒐證行動？」孩子們的眼睛，亮了。\n\n「我們的任務，」阿釁大聲宣布，「就是在王老闆『白天排放』的這段時間，拍到他們『正在排放』的鐵證！然後——交給環保局！」\n\n「好——！」孩子們齊聲大喊。\n\n「任務分配！」阿釁跳上講台，「溜溜，負責空中掩護和偵察！老巫，負責突圍和殿後！未晞，負責用手環定位暗管！晴晴，負責拍攝！柯志遠，負責記錄時間！」\n\n「那我呢？我呢？」尪伝恺舉手。\n\n「你，」阿釁想了想，「你負責……『放風』！」\n\n「放風？」\n\n「對！」阿釁說，「你笑點最低，講話最大聲！你在工業區外面，負責『裝傻』！看到保全，就大喊：『哎呀！我的錢包掉了！』然後裝作找錢包，把他們引開！」\n\n「噗！」尪伝恺笑了，「這個任務……我好像也很擅長！」\n\n「還有我們！」林芸芸和幾個女生舉手，「我們可以做什麼？」\n\n「你們，」阿釁看著她們，「負責『後勤』！準備口罩、手套、飲用水，還有……最重要的，是你們的勇氣！」\n\n「我們的勇氣？」女生們疑惑。\n\n「對！」阿釁認真地說，「如果我們被抓住了，你們要負責……把證據，帶回學校！」\n\n「我們……」林芸芸深吸一口氣，「我們可以的！」\n\n「好！」阿釁伸出手，「『極限蒐證行動』，出發！」\n\n「好——！」\n\n那天放學後，孩子們沒有走校門。\n\n他們翻過學校後面的圍牆，繞過工業區的正面，沿著一條長滿雜草的小路，悄悄地，往工業區的側面前進。\n\n「前方五百公尺，就是工廠的側牆！」溜溜在空中偵察，「牆的另一邊，就是地下儲水槽的位置！」\n\n「好！」阿釁低聲說，「老巫，就位！」\n\n「就位！」老巫蹲在側牆下，拍了拍肩膀，「來！」\n\n孩子們踩著老巫的肩膀，一個一個，翻過了側牆。\n\n「呼……」阿釁輕手輕腳地落地，「這裡就是……工廠的後院？」\n\n「小心！」溜溜低聲警告，「前面有保全！」\n\n「我來！」尪伝恺深吸一口氣，大步走了出去，對著遠處的保全大喊：「哎呀！我的錢包掉了！我的錢包！有人看到我的錢包嗎？！」\n\n「誰在那裡？！」保全聞聲，往尪伝恺的方向走去。\n\n「就是現在！」阿釁一揮手，「溜溜，上！未晞，定位！」\n\n「嗶嗶！」溜溜無聲無息地，飛向儲水槽上空。\n\n「找到了！」未晞閉著眼睛，手環散發著微弱的藍光，「暗管……就在儲水槽的下方！」\n\n「拍！」晴晴舉起手機，對準儲水槽，「暗管入口……拍到了！」\n\n「記錄時間！」柯志遠按下碼表，「下午四點四十八分！排放中！」\n\n「還有水樣！」阿釁蹲下來，小心翼翼地，在暗管的出水口，裝了一小瓶水，「鐵證，到手！」\n\n「太好了！」孩子們壓低聲音，興奮地互相擊掌。\n\n「嗶嗶嗶！」溜溜飛了回來，「保全被尪伝恺引開了！我們快走！」\n\n「走！」阿釁一聲令下，「原路返回！」\n\n孩子們貓著腰，快步往側牆的方向撤退。\n\n然而——\n\n「砰！」\n\n一道刺眼的探照燈，忽然從側牆的方向，直直地照了過來！\n\n「給我站住！」\n\n一個粗啞的聲音，在黑暗中響起。\n\n「是王老闆！」溜溜驚慌地大叫，「他親自來了！」\n\n「王老闆？！」孩子們的臉色，瞬間慘白。\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」王富貴從黑暗中走了出來，身後跟著兩個黑衣保全，「我當是誰，原來是你們這群小鬼！」\n\n「王……王老闆……」阿釁擋在孩子們前面，「我們……」\n\n「你們什麼？」王富貴冷笑著，一步一步逼近，「大半夜的，跑到我的工廠後院……你們說，這是什麼？」\n\n「我們是……」阿釁深吸一口氣，「我們是『守護地球作戰部隊』！我們來，是為了……」\n\n「為了什麼？」王富貴打斷他，眼神陰沉，「為了偷拍？為了找我的麻煩？」\n\n「我們不是找你麻煩！」晴晴大聲說，「我們是為了，讓這條排水溝，恢復乾淨！」\n\n「恢復乾淨？」王富貴嗤笑一聲，「小妹妹，大人世界的『乾淨』，沒有那麼簡單。你們這些小鬼，還是乖乖回家唸書吧！」\n\n「我們不會回去的！」阿釁大聲說，「我們有證據！」\n\n「證據？」王富貴的眼神，閃過一抹殺意，「你們說的證據，在哪裡？」\n\n「……」阿釁護住懷裡的水樣，沒有說話。\n\n「把證據，交出來。」王富貴伸出手，「我可以當作，什麼都沒發生過。不然……」\n\n「不然怎樣？」阿釁問。\n\n「不然……」王富貴笑了笑，語氣卻冷得像冰，「我就讓你們學校，吃上官司。讓你們的老師、你們的校長，都因為你們這群小鬼，倒大楣！」\n\n「你……」孩子們又驚又怒。\n\n「交出來吧。」王富貴往前一步，「別讓我說第三遍。」\n\n「……」孩子們互相看了一眼。\n\n就在這時——\n\n「嗶嗶嗶嗶——！！！」\n\n溜溜忽然沖天而起，對著天空，發出刺耳的警報聲！\n\n「煙霧！煙霧！」溜溜大聲喊，「工廠的煙囪，失火了！」\n\n「什麼？！」王富貴猛地回頭，看向煙囪的方向，「失火？！」\n\n「就是現在！」阿釁一聲大喊，「跑！」\n\n孩子們趁著王富貴分神的瞬間，拔腿就跑！\n\n「追！給我追！」王富貴氣急敗壞地大吼。\n\n「快跑！」老巫殿後，「我擋住他們！」\n\n「老巫！」孩子們大喊。\n\n「快跑！證據要護好！」老巫張開雙臂，擋在追兵前面，「來啊！你們這些大人！先過我這關！」\n\n「滾開！」一個保全伸手就要推開老巫。\n\n「休想！」老巫一把抓住保全的手，使出吃奶的力氣，「我可是……扛過全校最重的剩食桶的人！」\n\n「這小鬼力氣怎麼這麼大！」保全驚呼。\n\n「老巫！我們衝出來了！」阿釁在牆的另一頭大喊，「快過來！」\n\n「我來啦！」老巫一甩，把保全甩開，連滾帶爬地，翻過側牆。\n\n「砰！」孩子們跌成一團，卻忍不住笑了起來。\n\n「我們……我們成功了？」林芸芸氣喘吁吁地問。\n\n「成功了！」晴晴舉起手機，「暗管排放的畫面、水樣、時間紀錄……全都拿到了！」\n\n「鐵證！」阿釁大聲說，「這次，是鐵證！」\n\n「可是……」未晞忽然開口，聲音輕輕的，「王老闆，不會善罷甘休。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「他剛才說，要讓學校吃上官司……」晴晴低聲說。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「所以，我們要快。在他『動手』之前……把證據，交給環保局。」\n\n「對！」阿釁握緊拳頭，「我們現在就去！」\n\n「可是，」林芸芸擔心地問，「學校外面，有他們的人……」\n\n「沒關係。」未晞看向遠方，微微笑了，「我們已經不在學校了。」\n\n「對！」阿釁大聲說，「他們監視的是學校！我們……已經出來了！」\n\n「那我們……」孩子們的眼睛，亮晶晶的，「直接去環保局？」\n\n「直接去環保局！」孩子們齊聲大喊。\n\n「出發！」阿釁大手一揮。\n\n夕陽下，二十六個孩子的身影，浩浩蕩蕩地，往環保局的方向，大步前進。\n\n而在他們身後，王富貴站在工廠的側牆邊，臉色，鐵青。\n\n「……小鬼。」他咬牙切齒地，從牙縫裡擠出兩個字。\n\n「老闆，」黑衣人湊過來，「要不要……」\n\n「不用。」王富貴陰沉地笑了，「他們不是要證據嗎？那我們就……」他看向工廠的方向，「給他們一個，『更大的驚喜』。」\n\n「更大的驚喜？」阿釁放學後，在回家的路上，一直琢磨著這句話，「王老闆，到底想做什麼？」\n\n「阿釁，你還在想那個啊？」老巫咬著肉包，跟在他旁邊。\n\n「嗯。」阿釁點頭，「我有預感，王老闆不會就這麼算了。」\n\n「那我們能怎麼辦？」老巫問。\n\n「兵來將擋，水來土掩！」阿釁握緊拳頭，「反正，我們有證據！」\n\n「可是……」老巫猶豫了一下，「他說，要讓學校吃上官司……」\n\n「那就讓他告！」阿釁大聲說，「我們有證據！我們不怕！」\n\n「阿釁……」老巫看著他，忽然，憨憨地笑了，「你果然，是我們的『點子王』啊！」\n\n「那當然！」阿釁挺起胸膛，「我可是……」\n\n「『守護地球作戰部隊』的隊長！」老巫接下去。\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」兩個孩子，在夕陽下，笑鬧著，往家的方向跑去。\n\n而在他們看不見的地方，宏遠食品加工廠的辦公室裡，王富貴正打著一通電話：\n\n「喂？是張律師嗎？我是王富貴。」\n\n「對，是我。」\n\n「我想請你……幫我寫一張『存證信函』。」\n\n「對象？」王富貴的嘴角，勾起一抹冷笑，「鹿陽國小。」\n\n「對。就說……他們放任學生，侵入我的工廠，破壞我的設備！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」王富貴大笑，「我倒要看看，那些小鬼，能撐到什麼時候！」\n\n電話掛斷。\n\n深夜的工廠，依然在排放著灰綠色的廢水。\n\n夜深了。\n\n孩子們帶著證據，抵達了環保局。\n\n「又是你們？」環保局警衛，認出了溜溜，「你們怎麼又來了？」\n\n「警衛伯伯！」阿釁大聲說，「我們有鐵證！這次是鐵證！」\n\n「鐵證？」警衛愣住，「什麼鐵證？」\n\n「暗管排放的畫面！水樣！時間紀錄！」晴晴把證據，一樣一樣地攤開，「全部都在這裡！」\n\n「……」警衛看著那些證據，表情，慢慢凝重起來，「你們……等我一下。我去叫組長！」\n\n「組長！」警衛快步跑進辦公區，「外面有一群小學生，帶著證據來了！」\n\n「小學生？」稽查組長走了出來，「又是他們？」\n\n「組長！」阿釁舉起手裡的證據，「我們拍到了！宏遠食品加工廠，正在排放！大白天的！就是現在！」\n\n「什麼？！」組長臉色一變，「白天？」\n\n「對！」晴晴補充，「他們把排放時間，改到了白天！如果你們晚上去突擊……什麼都查不到！」\n\n「……」組長沉默了片刻，然後，他拿起手機，「全體集合！立刻出動！目標——宏遠食品加工廠！」\n\n「現在就去？！」稽查員們愣住了。\n\n「現在就去！」組長大聲說，「讓那幫人看看，什麼叫『突擊檢查』！」\n\n「好——！」\n\n環保局的稽查車，一輛接著一輛，呼嘯而出。\n\n孩子們站在環保局門口，看著稽查車遠去，互相看了一眼，然後——\n\n「耶——！！！」孩子們爆出震天的歡呼！\n\n「我們做到了！」阿釁的眼淚，奪眶而出，「我們真的做到了！」\n\n「嗯！」晴晴用力點頭，眼眶也紅了，「我們做到了！」\n\n「未晞，」林芸芸轉頭，看向未晞，「你看到了嗎？我們……」\n\n「……」未晞沒有回答。\n\n她站在孩子們中間，臉色，異常蒼白。\n\n「未晞？」晴晴發現她的異樣，「你怎麼了？！」\n\n「我……」未晞的身體，忽然搖搖晃晃，「我的手環……」\n\n「手環？！」孩子們低頭一看——\n\n未晞手腕上的手環，那行倒數數字，正以肉眼可見的速度，一格一格地，往下掉！\n\n「十、九、八……」\n\n「未晞！！！」孩子們驚慌地圍上去，「怎麼了？！為什麼會這樣？！」\n\n「我……」未晞虛弱地扶著額頭，「我剛才……用手環定位暗管的時候……消耗了太多能量……」\n\n「那……」阿釁的聲音，在顫抖，「那你的時間……」\n\n未晞低頭，看著手環。\n\n數字，停在了——八。\n\n「八天……」未晞輕輕說，「還夠。」\n\n「夠什麼！」阿釁的眼淚，一下子湧了上來，「八天……八天能幹嘛！」\n\n「八天，」未晞微微笑了，眼神裡，卻帶著前所未有的滿足，「夠我們……看到那條排水溝，恢復清澈了。」\n\n「未晞……」孩子們哭成了一團。\n\n「別哭，」未晞輕輕說，「我們成功了……真的成功了……」\n\n「嗯！」孩子們哭著，卻用力點頭，「我們成功了！」\n\n「所以，」未晞看向遠方，那稽查車遠去的方向，「接下來，就看大人們的了。」\n\n「嗯！」孩子們說，「就交給大人們了！」\n\n夜空下，二十六個孩子，靜靜地，站在環保局門口。\n\n等待著，那個屬於他們的，奇蹟。\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 20: The Extreme Evidence-Gathering Operation\n\nThe evidence Liu-Liu had delivered caused quite a stir at the environmental protection bureau.\n\n\"Confirmed! These photos and data match the tip we received!\" In the bureau's meeting room, the inspection team leader slammed the table, \"This 'Hongyuan Food Processing Factory' definitely has a problem!\"\n\n\"Team leader,\" an inspector frowned, \"but last time we inspected them, they buried the pipe and we found nothing.\"\n\n\"This time is different.\" The team leader said, \"This time, we have the children's 'simulated route map'! We know where their hidden pipe is!\"\n\n\"Then we...\"\n\n\"Not so fast.\" The team leader wagged his finger, \"To catch them in the act, we must obtain evidence that they're 'discharging right now.' We're going to...\" a sharp light flickered in his eyes, \"raid!\"\n\n\"Raid?\"\n\n\"Yes! A night raid!\" The team leader said, \"The children's monitoring data shows that the hidden pipe discharges at night, concentrated in the dead of night. We'll catch them while they're discharging!\"\n\n\"But...\" the inspector hesitated, \"that child mentioned an 'underground storage tank,' but we don't have a map...\"\n\n\"We do.\" The team leader opened Ke Zhiyuan's simulated route map, \"This map is drawn in great detail. This child...\" he looked at the annotations on the map, \"can come work at our unit in the future.\"\n\nHowever, the bureau's \"raid plan\" was learned of by someone first.\n\n\"Boss! The environmental protection bureau is up to something!\" Late at night, in the office of Hongyuan Food Processing Factory, a man in black leaned close to Wang Fugui's ear, \"They seem to be planning a 'surprise inspection'!\"\n\n\"Surprise inspection?\" Wang Fugui's face darkened, \"How did they know...\"\n\n\"I heard...\" the man in black lowered his voice, \"it was the kids from that school who delivered the evidence to the bureau.\"\n\n\"Those brats?!\" Wang Fugui stood up abruptly, \"Them again!\"\n\n\"Boss, what do we do?\"\n\n\"What do we do?\" Wang Fugui sneered, \"They want to raid, so we'll...\" he thought for a moment, \"change the discharge time to daytime.\"\n\n\"Daytime?!\" The man in black was stunned, \"Isn't daytime easier to get caught?\"\n\n\"The most dangerous place is the safest.\" Wang Fugui said smugly, \"They think we only discharge at night, so we'll discharge in the daytime! When they come to raid at night... all they'll see is a 'clean' ditch!\"\n\n\"Brilliant! Truly brilliant, Boss!\" The man in black flattered, giving a thumbs up.\n\n\"And,\" a hint of ruthlessness flashed in Wang Fugui's eyes, \"have someone watch that school. If those brats try any more tricks...\"\n\n\"Your meaning, Boss?\"\n\n\"Scare their parents a little.\" Wang Fugui said, \"Make those brats know that meddling in other people's business has no good outcome.\"\n\n\"Understood!\"\n\nThe night grew deeper.\n\nAnd the children didn't yet know that a bigger storm was approaching.\n\n\"Weixi,\" the next morning, Qingqing noticed that Weixi's face had grown paler again, \"did you not sleep well last night?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded softly, \"Last night... I 'saw' something again.\"\n\n\"What did you see?\"\n\n\"I saw...\" Weixi said in a low voice, \"a heavy rain.\"\n\n\"Heavy rain?\" Qingqing froze.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi said, \"A very heavy rain, washing that drainage ditch completely clean.\"\n\n\"Isn't that good?\" A-Xin leaned in, \"A heavy rain, washing the ditch clean!\"\n\n\"But...\" Weixi shook her head, unease in her eyes, \"the 'rain' I saw... was strange. Its color...\"\n\n\"Its color?\"\n\n\"It was grayish-black.\" Weixi said, \"I've never seen rain that color.\"\n\n\"Grayish-black rain...\" The children looked at each other.\n\n\"Grayish-black rain...\" A-Xin tilted his head, \"Does such rain exist?\"\n\n\"I remember,\" Wang Zhuankai raised his hand, \"the TV news reported it once! One time, somewhere got a 'black rain,' and it turned out to be black smoke from factories mixing into the rain!\"\n\n\"Factory black smoke...\" Qingqing's face changed slightly, \"That would be...\"\n\n\"It's right here.\" Weixi said in a low voice, \"The smokestacks of the Taichung Thermal Power Plant, and... the factory's smokestacks. If their discharge keeps increasing...\"\n\n\"The rain will turn black?\" Lin Yunyun asked fearfully.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"In the 'stories of the future' I've heard... black rain once fell. After that rain, many people's throats began to hurt.\"\n\n\"Then... then we...\" The children's faces all turned pale.\n\n\"So,\" Weixi took a deep breath, \"we have to find out the truth, and make those smokestacks... stop.\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"Make them stop!\"\n\n\"Make them stop!\" The children said in unison.\n\n\"But, Weixi,\" Qingqing looked at her worriedly, \"your body...\"\n\n\"It's okay.\" Weixi smiled, \"As long as you're all by my side, I can... keep going.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" The children's eyes reddened.\n\n\"So,\" Weixi looked at everyone, speaking softly, \"let's make sure that 'black rain'... never falls.\"\n\n\"Okay—!\" The children responded loudly.\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing asked worriedly, \"are you... worried about something again?\"\n\n\"I don't know.\" Weixi lowered her head, \"I just feel... like something is about to happen.\"\n\n\"No matter what happens,\" A-Xin said loudly, \"we'll face it together!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children said in unison.\n\nJust then, Liu-Liu suddenly burst out of the ventilation duct in a hurry:\n\n\"Beep beep! Bad news! Big bad news!\"\n\n\"What's wrong?\" The children asked nervously.\n\n\"I just sneaked into the industrial zone to scout,\" Liu-Liu panted, \"and found... that hidden pipe is discharging right now!\"\n\n\"Right now?!\" A-Xin's eyes went wide, \"In broad daylight?!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" Liu-Liu nodded, \"And the amount being discharged is even larger than at night!\"\n\n\"Why would they discharge in the daytime?\" Qingqing frowned, \"That doesn't make sense...\"\n\n\"Unless...\" Weixi suddenly spoke, her voice soft yet silencing the classroom, \"they know the environmental protection bureau is planning a surprise inspection.\"\n\n\"What?!\" The children gasped.\n\n\"They changed the discharge time to daytime.\" Weixi said, \"That way, when the bureau raids at night... they won't find anything.\"\n\n\"How cunning!\" A-Xin stamped his foot, \"Boss Wang, he's really...\"\n\n\"And,\" Liu-Liu added, \"they've also sent people to watch the school!\"\n\n\"Watch the school?\" The children's faces changed.\n\n\"Yes!\" Liu-Liu said, \"At the school gate, the side gate—there are their people everywhere!\"\n\n\"They're watching us!\" Qingqing's face darkened.\n\n\"Then we...\" Lin Yunyun asked fearfully, \"can we... do nothing anymore?\"\n\n\"Who said that!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"If they want to watch, we'll...\" his eyes suddenly lit up, \"we'll act 'secretly'!\"\n\n\"Secretly?\"\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin lowered his voice, \"They're watching the 'school.' So we'll... 'act from outside the school'!\"\n\n\"Outside the school?\" The children were puzzled.\n\n\"We can, after school, circle around to the other side of the industrial zone!\" A-Xin said, \"They're watching the school; they won't think we'd come from another direction into the industrial zone!\"\n\n\"But...\" Qingqing hesitated, \"the other side of the industrial zone is a wall...\"\n\n\"The wall,\" Old Wu stood up, patting his shoulder, \"is my job!\"\n\n\"Old Wu...\" The children looked at him.\n\n\"I'm the 'human shield'!\" Old Wu said loudly, \"Have you forgotten? 'Protect Earth Operations Unit · Full Deployment,' my mission is to lead everyone through the obstacles!\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin slapped the table, \"'Extreme Evidence-Gathering Operation' officially begins!\"\n\n\"Extreme Evidence-Gathering Operation?\" The children's eyes lit up.\n\n\"Our mission,\" A-Xin announced loudly, \"is to capture proof of them 'discharging right now' during Boss Wang's 'daytime discharge'! Then—hand it to the environmental protection bureau!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\" The children shouted in unison.\n\n\"Mission assignments!\" A-Xin jumped onto the podium, \"Liu-Liu, aerial cover and reconnaissance! Old Wu, breakthrough and rearguard! Weixi, use the bracelet to locate the hidden pipe! Qingqing, filming! Ke Zhiyuan, recording the time!\"\n\n\"What about me? What about me?\" Wang Zhuankai raised his hand.\n\n\"You,\" A-Xin thought for a moment, \"you're in charge of... 'the decoy'!\"\n\n\"The decoy?\"\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin said, \"You have the lowest laughing threshold and the loudest voice! Outside the industrial zone, you pretend to be 'clueless'! When you see a guard, shout: 'Oh no! I dropped my wallet!' Then pretend to look for it and lead them away!\"\n\n\"Pfft!\" Wang Zhuankai laughed, \"This mission... I seem to be born for it!\"\n\n\"And us!\" Lin Yunyun and a few girls raised their hands, \"What can we do?\"\n\n\"You,\" A-Xin looked at them, \"are in charge of 'logistics'! Prepare masks, gloves, drinking water, and most importantly... your courage!\"\n\n\"Our courage?\" The girls were puzzled.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin said seriously, \"If we get caught, you'll be responsible for... bringing the evidence back to school!\"\n\n\"We...\" Lin Yunyun took a deep breath, \"we can do it!\"\n\n\"Great!\" A-Xin extended his hand, \"'Extreme Evidence-Gathering Operation,' move out!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\"\n\nThat day after school, the children didn't walk through the school gate.\n\nThey climbed over the wall behind the school, circled past the front of the industrial zone, and crept quietly along a weed-filled path toward the industrial zone's side.\n\n\"Five hundred meters ahead is the factory's side wall!\" Liu-Liu conducted aerial reconnaissance, \"On the other side of the wall is the underground storage tank!\"\n\n\"Good!\" A-Xin said in a low voice, \"Old Wu, take position!\"\n\n\"In position!\" Old Wu crouched by the side wall and patted his shoulder, \"Come!\"\n\nThe children stepped on Old Wu's shoulder, one by one, climbing over the side wall.\n\n\"Phew...\" A-Xin landed softly, \"Is this... the factory's backyard?\"\n\n\"Careful!\" Liu-Liu warned in a low voice, \"There's a guard up ahead!\"\n\n\"I'll handle it!\" Wang Zhuankai took a deep breath, strode out, and shouted at the distant guard: \"Oh no! I dropped my wallet! My wallet! Has anyone seen my wallet?!\"\n\n\"Who's there?!\" The guard, hearing the noise, walked toward Wang Zhuankai.\n\n\"Now!\" A-Xin waved his hand, \"Liu-Liu, go! Weixi, locate!\"\n\n\"Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu flew silently toward the sky above the storage tank.\n\n\"Found it!\" Weixi closed her eyes, the bracelet emitting a faint blue light, \"The hidden pipe... is below the storage tank!\"\n\n\"Film!\" Qingqing raised her phone, aiming at the storage tank, \"Hidden pipe entrance... captured!\"\n\n\"Record the time!\" Ke Zhiyuan pressed the stopwatch, \"4:48 PM! Discharging!\"\n\n\"And a water sample!\" A-Xin crouched down and carefully filled a small bottle at the hidden pipe's outlet, \"Ironclad evidence, secured!\"\n\n\"Great!\" The children, keeping their voices low, high-fived each other excitedly.\n\n\"Beep beep beep!\" Liu-Liu flew back, \"The guard's been lured away by Wang Zhuankai! Let's go!\"\n\n\"Go!\" A-Xin commanded, \"Back the way we came!\"\n\nThe children, crouching, retreated quickly toward the side wall.\n\nHowever—\n\n\"Thump!\"\n\nA blinding searchlight suddenly shone directly from the direction of the side wall!\n\n\"Stop right there!\"\n\nA hoarse voice rang out in the darkness.\n\n\"It's Boss Wang!\" Liu-Liu shouted in panic, \"He came himself!\"\n\n\"Boss Wang?!\" The children's faces instantly turned deathly pale.\n\n\"Hahaha!\" Wang Fugui emerged from the darkness, followed by two guards in black, \"I was wondering who it was. It's you brats!\"\n\n\"B-Boss Wang...\" A-Xin shielded the children, \"we...\"\n\n\"We what?\" Wang Fugui sneered, closing in step by step, \"In the middle of the night, sneaking into my factory's backyard... what do you call this?\"\n\n\"We are...\" A-Xin took a deep breath, \"we are the 'Protect Earth Operations Unit'! We came to...\"\n\n\"Came to what?\" Wang Fugui interrupted him, his eyes dark, \"To secretly film? To make trouble for me?\"\n\n\"We're not making trouble for you!\" Qingqing said loudly, \"We came to make this drainage ditch clean again!\"\n\n\"Clean again?\" Wang Fugui snorted, \"Little girl, the 'clean' of the adult world isn't that simple. You brats should just go home and study!\"\n\n\"We're not going back!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"We have evidence!\"\n\n\"Evidence?\" A murderous glint flashed in Wang Fugui's eyes, \"Where is this 'evidence' of yours?\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin protected the water sample in his arms and said nothing.\n\n\"Hand over the evidence.\" Wang Fugui extended his hand, \"I'll pretend nothing happened. Otherwise...\"\n\n\"Otherwise what?\" A-Xin asked.\n\n\"Otherwise...\" Wang Fugui smiled, but his tone was cold as ice, \"I'll take your school to court. Your teachers, your principal—all of them will be in big trouble because of you brats!\"\n\n\"You...\" The children were shocked and furious.\n\n\"Hand it over.\" Wang Fugui stepped forward, \"Don't make me say it a third time.\"\n\n\"...\" The children looked at each other.\n\nJust then—\n\n\"Beep beep beep beep—!!!\"\n\nLiu-Liu suddenly shot up into the sky, emitting a piercing alarm!\n\n\"Smoke! Smoke!\" Liu-Liu shouted, \"The factory's smokestacks are on fire!\"\n\n\"What?!\" Wang Fugui whirled around, looking toward the smokestacks, \"On fire?!\"\n\n\"Now!\" A-Xin shouted, \"Run!\"\n\nTaking advantage of Wang Fugui's distraction, the children bolted!\n\n\"Chase them! Chase them!\" Wang Fugui roared furiously.\n\n\"Run!\" Old Wu stayed in the rear, \"I'll hold them off!\"\n\n\"Old Wu!\" The children shouted.\n\n\"Run! Protect the evidence!\" Old Wu spread his arms wide, blocking the pursuers, \"Come on! You adults! Get past me first!\"\n\n\"Get out of the way!\" A guard reached out to shove Old Wu.\n\n\"No way!\" Old Wu grabbed the guard's hand, using all his strength, \"I'm the one... who carried the school's heaviest leftover food barrel!\"\n\n\"How is this kid so strong!\" The guard exclaimed.\n\n\"Old Wu! We got out!\" A-Xin shouted from the other side of the wall, \"Hurry over!\"\n\n\"I'm coming!\" Old Wu flung the guard aside, scrambled and rolled over the side wall.\n\n\"Thump!\" The children collapsed into a heap, but couldn't help laughing.\n\n\"We... we did it?\" Lin Yunyun asked breathlessly.\n\n\"We did it!\" Qingqing raised her phone, \"The hidden pipe discharging, the water sample, the time record... everything secured!\"\n\n\"Ironclad evidence!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"This time, it's ironclad evidence!\"\n\n\"But...\" Weixi suddenly spoke, her voice soft, \"Boss Wang won't let this go.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"He just said he'd take the school to court...\" Qingqing said in a low voice.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"So we have to hurry. Before he 'strikes'... hand the evidence to the environmental protection bureau.\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin clenched his fist, \"Let's go now!\"\n\n\"But,\" Lin Yunyun asked worriedly, \"there are his people watching the school...\"\n\n\"It's okay.\" Weixi looked into the distance and smiled faintly, \"We're no longer at school.\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"They're watching the school! We... are already out!\"\n\n\"Then we...\" The children's eyes sparkled, \"go straight to the environmental protection bureau?\"\n\n\"Straight to the bureau!\" The children shouted in unison.\n\n\"Move out!\" A-Xin waved his hand grandly.\n\nUnder the setting sun, the silhouettes of twenty-six children marched in a grand procession toward the environmental protection bureau.\n\n\"Even bigger surprise?\" A-Xin kept mulling over those words on the way home after school, \"What is Boss Wang planning to do?\"\n\n\"A-Xin, you're still thinking about that?\" Old Wu, chewing a pork bun, walked beside him.\n\n\"Mhm.\" A-Xin nodded, \"I have a feeling Boss Wang won't let this go.\"\n\n\"Then what can we do?\" Old Wu asked.\n\n\"We'll meet the situation as it comes!\" A-Xin clenched his fist, \"Anyway, we have evidence!\"\n\n\"But...\" Old Wu hesitated, \"he said he'd take the school to court...\"\n\n\"Then let him sue!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"We have evidence! We're not afraid!\"\n\n\"A-Xin...\" Old Wu looked at him, then smiled honestly, \"you really are our 'King of Ideas'!\"\n\n\"Of course!\" A-Xin puffed out his chest, \"I'm...\"\n\n\"The captain of the 'Protect Earth Operations Unit'!\" Old Wu finished for him.\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The two children, laughing and playing under the setting sun, ran toward home.\n\nAnd in the place they couldn't see, in the office of Hongyuan Food Processing Factory, Wang Fugui was making a phone call:\n\n\"Hello? Is this Attorney Zhang? This is Wang Fugui.\"\n\n\"Yes, it's me.\"\n\n\"I'd like you to... write me a 'certified letter.'\"\n\n\"The addressee?\" A cold smile curled at the corner of Wang Fugui's mouth, \"Luyang Elementary.\"\n\n\"Yes. Say... they allowed students to break into my factory and damage my equipment!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" Wang Fugui laughed heartily, \"Let's see how long those brats can hold out!\"\n\nThe phone hung up.\n\nIn the deep night, the factory was still discharging grayish-green wastewater.\n\nIn their wake, Wang Fugui stood by the factory's side wall, his face ashen.\n\n\"...Brat.\" He gritted his teeth, squeezing out two words.\n\n\"Boss,\" the man in black leaned in, \"should we...\"\n\n\"No need.\" Wang Fugui smiled darkly, \"They want evidence, right? Then we'll...\" he looked toward the factory, \"give them a 'bigger surprise.'\"\n\nThe night grew deeper.\n\nThe children, carrying the evidence, arrived at the environmental protection bureau.\n\n\"It's you again?\" The bureau's guard recognized Liu-Liu, \"Why are you back again?\"\n\n\"Guard uncle!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"We have ironclad evidence! This time it's ironclad!\"\n\n\"Ironclad?\" The guard froze, \"What ironclad evidence?\"\n\n\"Footage of the hidden pipe discharging! A water sample! Time records!\" Qingqing laid out the evidence one by one, \"It's all here!\"\n\n\"...\" The guard looked at the evidence, his expression slowly turning grave, \"You... wait a moment. I'll call the team leader!\"\n\n\"Team leader!\" The guard hurried into the office area, \"There's a group of elementary school students outside with evidence!\"\n\n\"Elementary school students?\" The inspection team leader came out, \"Them again?\"\n\n\"Team leader!\" A-Xin raised the evidence in his hand, \"We filmed it! Hongyuan Food Processing Factory is discharging! In broad daylight! Right now!\"\n\n\"What?!\" The team leader's face changed, \"Daytime?\"\n\n\"Yes!\" Qingqing added, \"They changed the discharge time to daytime! If you raid at night... you won't find anything!\"\n\n\"...\" The team leader was silent for a moment, then picked up his phone, \"Everyone, assemble! Move out immediately! Target—Hongyuan Food Processing Factory!\"\n\n\"Right now?!\" The inspectors were stunned.\n\n\"Right now!\" The team leader said loudly, \"Let those people see what a 'surprise inspection' really is!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\"\n\nThe bureau's inspection vehicles, one after another, roared out.\n\nThe children stood at the bureau's entrance, watching the vehicles drive away, then looked at each other—\n\n\"Yay—!!!\" The children erupted in thunderous cheers!\n\n\"We did it!\" A-Xin's tears streamed down, \"We really did it!\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" Qingqing nodded hard, her eyes reddened too, \"We did it!\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" Lin Yunyun turned to look at Weixi, \"did you see? We...\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi didn't answer.\n\nShe stood in the middle of the children, her face abnormally pale.\n\n\"Weixi?\" Qingqing noticed her change, \"What's wrong?!\"\n\n\"I...\" Weixi's body suddenly swayed, \"my bracelet...\"\n\n\"The bracelet?!\" The children looked down—\n\nOn the bracelet on Weixi's wrist, the countdown number was dropping, one digit at a time, at a visibly fast rate!\n\n\"Ten, nine, eight...\"\n\n\"Weixi!!!\" The children gathered around her in panic, \"What's happening?! Why is it—\"\n\n\"I...\" Weixi weakly held her forehead, \"when I used the bracelet to locate the hidden pipe just now... I consumed too much energy...\"\n\n\"Then...\" A-Xin's voice was trembling, \"then your time...\"\n\nWeixi lowered her head and looked at the bracelet.\n\nThe number stopped at—eight.\n\n\"Eight days...\" Weixi said softly, \"still enough.\"\n\n\"Enough for what!\" A-Xin's tears surged up, \"Eight days... what can eight days do!\"\n\n\"Eight days,\" Weixi smiled faintly, a satisfaction never seen before in her eyes, \"is enough for us... to see that drainage ditch become clear again.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" The children cried together.\n\n\"Don't cry,\" Weixi said softly, \"we succeeded... we really succeeded...\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" The children cried, but nodded hard, \"We succeeded!\"\n\n\"So,\" Weixi looked into the distance, toward the direction the inspection vehicles had gone, \"the rest is up to the adults.\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" The children said, \"Leave it to the adults!\"\n\nUnder the night sky, twenty-six children stood quietly at the bureau's entrance.\n\nWaiting for the miracle that belonged to them.\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":5,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第二十一章：揭發與拯救\n\n那一夜，環保局的稽查車，在宏遠食品加工廠的門口，停了下來。\n\n「稽查！立刻開門！」稽查組長用力拍著工廠的大門。\n\n「來了來了！」工廠的保全，睡眼惺忪地打開門，一看到稽查人員，臉色瞬間變了，「這……這麼晚了，你們……」\n\n「我們接到檢舉，你們工廠，涉嫌偷排廢水！」組長亮出稽查證，「這是搜索票！請配合！」\n\n「我……我去叫老闆！」保全慌慌張張地往辦公室跑。\n\n「不用叫了。」組長大步走進工廠，目光掃過廠區，「我們自己會找。」\n\n他帶著稽查人員，直撲工廠後院的地下儲水槽。\n\n「找到了！」稽查員的手電筒，照向儲水槽下方，「暗管！還在排放！」\n\n「灰綠色的液體……」組長蹲下來，聞了聞，「跟排水溝裡的水，一模一樣！」\n\n「拍下來！」「取水樣！」「記錄時間！」\n\n稽查人員，有條不紊地，進行著取證。\n\n「你們！」王富貴氣喘吁吁地趕到，「你們這是私闖民宅！」\n\n「王老闆，」組長站起身，拿出水樣，「這是從你們工廠地下儲水槽的暗管裡，採集到的廢水。根據初步檢測，重金屬超標。」\n\n「那……那……」王富貴的額頭，冒出冷汗，「那跟我沒關係！那一定是……」\n\n「一定是什麼？」組長直視著他，「王老闆，你上次說，那是『舊管線的殘留』。這次呢？」\n\n「我……」王富貴的嘴巴，張了張，卻一句話都說不出來。\n\n「王老闆，」組長拿出封條，「根據《水污染防治法》，你工廠涉嫌偷排廢水，重金屬超標。現在，我正式宣布——」\n\n「貴廠，即日起，勒令停工！」\n\n「停工？！」王富貴的臉色，瞬間慘白，「你們不能這樣！我……我有律師！」\n\n「你有律師，」組長冷冷地說，「我們有證據。法庭上，讓律師跟證據，慢慢『聊』吧。」\n\n「你……」王富貴癱軟在地。\n\n「還有，」組長補了一句，「你們這幾天，派人到學校盯梢的事，我們也記錄下來了。涉嫌恐嚇學童，這筆帳，我們會一起算。」\n\n「……」王富貴，一句話都說不出來了。\n\n「帶走。」組長對身後的稽查員揮了揮手。\n\n「你們要做什麼？！」王富貴慌了，「我是……我是模範企業家！」\n\n「模範企業家？」組長冷笑，「模範企業家，會把重金屬廢水，排進學校旁邊的水溝？」\n\n「我……」王富貴啞口無言。\n\n「還有，」組長從口袋裡，掏出一疊照片，「這些，是你們派人到學校盯梢的照片。學務主任周嚴先生，昨天晚上，把這些送到了我們單位。」\n\n「周嚴……」王富貴的臉色，更加慘白。\n\n「對了，」組長補充，「周嚴主任說，他當了二十年學務主任，第一次看到，一群孩子為了保護學校的水，連命都不要。他說……」組長頓了頓，「『如果你們辦不了他，他就帶著孩子們，親自上媒體。』」\n\n「……」王富貴癱坐在地，一句話都說不出來。\n\n「帶走。」組長再次下令。\n\n「是！」稽查員們，架起王富貴，往警車的方向走去。\n\n「我不甘心！」王富貴被拖著，還在大喊，「我不甘心！那些小鬼……那些小鬼憑什麼……」\n\n「憑什麼？」組長看著他的背影，淡淡地說，「憑他們，比你知道，什麼是『對的事』。」\n\n警車，呼嘯而去。\n\n工廠的大門，貼上了封條。\n\n「組長！」稽查員走過來，「儲水槽裡的廢水，要怎麼處理？」\n\n「抽乾！淨化！」組長說，「一滴，都不能讓它流進海裡。」\n\n「是！」\n\n那一夜，宏遠食品加工廠的燈，再也沒有亮起。\n\n煙囪裡的白煙，第一次，永遠地停了下來。\n\n「組長！組長！」隔天一早，阿釁衝進六年一班的教室，興奮地大喊，「環保局的網站！公告了！」\n\n「公告？」孩子們圍過來。\n\n「你們看！」阿釁把手機舉得高高的，「『宏遠食品加工廠，涉嫌偷排廢水，重金屬超標六點三倍，依法勒令停工，移送法辦！』」\n\n「勒令停工！」孩子們爆出震天的歡呼，「移送法辦！」\n\n「我們做到了！」老巫的眼淚，奪眶而出，「我們真的做到了！」\n\n「那個王老闆……」林芸芸喃喃地，「以後，再也不能偷排了吧？」\n\n「不會了。」晴晴點頭，「暗管被查封了，儲水槽被查封了，工廠也停工了。他……」\n\n「他完了！」阿釁大聲接下去，「這就是『自作自受』！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑成一團。\n\n「未晞！」阿釁轉頭，看向未晞，「你看到了嗎？！我們成功了！」\n\n「……」未晞站在窗邊，靜靜地，看著遠方。\n\n她的眼眶，微微泛紅。\n\n「看到了。」她輕輕說，「我看到了。」\n\n「那一根煙囪……」她低聲說，「停了。」\n\n「對！」阿釁大聲說，「停了！」\n\n「謝謝你們。」未晞轉過身，看著全班二十六個人，深深鞠了一躬，「謝謝你們……讓那根煙囪，停了下來。」\n\n「未晞……」孩子們愣住了。\n\n「這是我……」未晞抬起頭，眼眶裡，閃爍著淚光，「見過最美的畫面。」\n\n「最美的畫面？」孩子們問。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「在我的記憶裡……煙囪，從來沒有停過。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「可是今天，」未晞微微笑了，「我看到了。原來……煙囪，是可以停下來的。」\n\n「因為你們，」她看著孩子們，「把『不可能』，變成了『可能』。」\n\n「未晞……」林芸芸的眼眶，一下子紅了，「你別這樣說……我們……」\n\n「我們只是……」阿釁揉了揉鼻子，「我們只是做了，該做的事。」\n\n「對。」晴晴點頭，「該做的事。」\n\n「該做的事……」未晞重複著這四個字，輕輕地，笑了。\n\n就在這時，學校的廣播，忽然響起：\n\n「各位老師、各位同學，請注意——」\n\n「本校周邊地區的空氣品質，已由『紫爆』等級，降為『普通』等級！」\n\n「學校的飲水機，已恢復正常供水！」\n\n「後方排水溝的水質檢測，已恢復正常範圍！」\n\n「空汙降級了！」「飲水機恢復了！」「排水溝正常了！」\n\n「耶——！」\n\n教室裡，孩子們的歡呼聲，久久不歇。\n\n「咳咳，」門口，忽然響起一聲輕咳，「這麼開心？」\n\n「主任！」孩子們嚇了一跳，瞬間安靜下來。\n\n「我今天來，」周嚴主任走進教室，語氣平淡，「不是來抓你們吵鬧的。」\n\n「那主任是……」阿釁小心翼翼地問。\n\n「我是來告訴你們，」周嚴主任頓了頓，「『宏遠食品加工廠』的事，已經上新聞了。」\n\n「上新聞？！」孩子們瞪大眼睛。\n\n「嗯。」周嚴主任點頭，「學校的通報，加上環保局的公告……現在，全台灣的人，都知道了。」\n\n「全台灣……」孩子們互相看了看，眼睛裡，都閃著光。\n\n「還有，」周嚴主任說，「校長讓我轉告你們——『守護地球大作戰』，正式成為本校的『特色課程』，明年，全校推廣。」\n\n「特色課程！全校推廣！」孩子們又興奮起來。\n\n「還有，」周嚴主任的表情，難得地柔和了一點，「下禮拜，教育局要表揚你們。校長說，要讓你們，上台領獎。」\n\n「上台領獎？！」阿釁跳起來，「我們要上台領獎！」\n\n「不過，」周嚴主任板起臉，「領獎之前，作業還是要寫。」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑成一團。\n\n「主任！」阿釁大聲問，「那……您呢？」\n\n「我什麼？」\n\n「您……」阿釁想了想，「您要跟我們一起上台嗎？」\n\n「……」周嚴主任愣了一下，然後，轉過身，往外走，「……再說吧。」\n\n可是，孩子們都看到了。\n\n主任轉身的瞬間，他的嘴角，微微上揚了一下。\n\n「主任笑了！」溜溜從通風管裡探出頭，興奮地宣布，「黑面判官，笑了！」\n\n「閉嘴！」周嚴主任頭也不回地吼了一句，腳步，卻輕快了不少。\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑得更大聲了。\n\n「未晞！」阿釁轉頭，興奮地大喊，「你聽到了嗎？！全、部、都、恢、復、了！」\n\n「嗯！」未晞用力點頭，眼淚，終於忍不住，奪眶而出，「我聽到了……」\n\n「那你……」阿釁忽然低下頭，聲音輕了下去，「是不是……就要回去了？」\n\n教室裡，忽然安靜了下來。\n\n二十六雙眼睛，齊刷刷地，看向未晞。\n\n「……」未晞低下頭，沉默了很久很久。\n\n「嗯。」她最後，輕輕點頭，「快了。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「但是，」未晞抬起頭，露出一個溫柔的笑容，「在回去之前，我想……」\n\n「想看什麼？」阿釁問。\n\n「想看一看……」未晞看向窗外，「那條排水溝，恢復清澈的樣子。」\n\n「排水溝……」孩子們互相看了一眼。\n\n「好！」阿釁大聲說，「那我們，就帶你去看！」\n\n那天放學後，二十六個孩子，加上溜溜，浩浩蕩蕩地，走向學校後方。\n\n他們站在排水溝的入海口，看著那條曾經灰綠色的水。\n\n「你們看！」林芸芸指著水溝，「水……變清了！」\n\n「真的！」尪伝恺瞪大眼睛，「以前的灰綠色……不見了！」\n\n「而且，」溜溜在入海口上空盤旋，興奮地報告，「海水的水質，也恢復正常了！魚……魚也回來了！」\n\n「魚？」孩子們湊到入海口，往海裡看。\n\n「看！」老巫指著淺灘，「那裡！有一群小魚！」\n\n「真的耶！」孩子們驚呼，「魚回來了！」\n\n「海……」未晞站在海堤上，看著那片藍色的海，眼眶，再一次濕了。\n\n「藍色的海……」她低聲說，「我終於……親眼看到了。」\n\n「未晞，」阿釁站在她身邊，問，「你奶奶說的那個海……就是這個樣子嗎？」\n\n「……」未晞看著眼前的海，沉默了許久。\n\n「我不知道。」她輕輕說，「奶奶的相片，已經泛黃了。可是……」她笑了，「我猜，應該就是這個樣子。」\n\n「那……」林芸芸小聲問，「你回去以後，可以跟奶奶說……你看到藍色的海了？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，眼眶裡，閃著光，「我會跟她說。我會告訴她……藍色的海，比相片裡，還要漂亮一萬倍。」\n\n「一萬倍！」老巫大聲說，「那一定要多說一點！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑了。\n\n「還有，」未晞蹲下來，看著淺灘上的小魚，「我會告訴她……我看到的，不只是藍色的海，還有……活著的魚。」\n\n「魚……」孩子們看向那群小魚。\n\n「在我的時代，」未晞輕聲說，「海裡，沒有魚。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「可是這裡，」未晞笑了，「有魚。有藍色的海。有綠色的樹。有……」\n\n「有我們！」阿釁大聲說。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，笑得更開了，「有你們。」\n\n「那……」阿釁深吸一口氣，「你要記得，把這裡的一切，都記在心裡！帶回去！告訴你奶奶！」\n\n「我會的。」未晞用力點頭，「我會把這裡的一切……藍色的海、活著的魚、綠色的樹、鳳凰花、肉包、還有你們……」她看著全班，「全部，都帶回去。」\n\n「帶回去……」孩子們重複著。\n\n「因為，」未晞輕輕說，「這些……是我這輩子，最珍貴的寶物。」\n\n夕陽下，孩子們站在海堤上，看著那片海。\n\n海風，把他們的頭髮，吹得亂亂的。\n\n可是，每個人的眼睛裡，都亮著光。\n\n「藍色的海……」阿釁站在她身邊，看著同樣的海，「以後，會一直這麼藍的！」\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「因為……有你們在。」\n\n夕陽下，二十六個孩子，站在海堤上，看著那片恢復湛藍的海。\n\n海風，輕輕吹過。\n\n「對了，未晞，」阿釁忽然想起什麼，「你手環上的數字……現在剩多少？」\n\n「……」未晞低頭，看了一眼手環。\n\n「六。」她輕輕說。\n\n「六天……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「六天，」未晞微微笑了，「夠我……好好跟大家說再見了。」\n\n「未晞……」孩子們的眼眶，紅了。\n\n「別哭，」未晞輕輕說，「我們說好的，要笑著說再見的。」\n\n「……嗯！」孩子們用力點頭，努力擠出笑容。\n\n「那，」阿釁大聲說，「接下來的六天，我們要——『好好玩』！」\n\n「好好玩？」孩子們愣住。\n\n「對！」阿釁說，「未晞要在這裡待的最後六天，我們要帶她去玩！去所有我們喜歡的地方！吃所有我們喜歡的東西！」\n\n「好——！」孩子們齊聲大喊。\n\n「那……」阿釁看向未晞，伸出手，「未晞，這六天，你想去哪裡？」\n\n未晞想了想。\n\n「我想……」她看著孩子們，輕輕笑了，「跟你們一起……吃一頓飯。」\n\n「吃飯？」孩子們愣住。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「我想跟你們，好好地，吃一頓飯。就像……」她低下頭，「就像我們第一次認識的那天一樣。」\n\n「好！」阿釁大聲說，「那明天中午，我們就在教室裡，開一場『畢業前的午餐會』！」\n\n「午餐會！」\n\n「每個人都要帶一道菜來！」阿釁宣布，「我們把喜歡的、好吃的，全都帶來！」\n\n「好——！」孩子們齊聲回應。\n\n第二天中午，六年一班的教室，變成了一個「美食天堂」。\n\n「我帶了媽媽做的滷味！」「我帶了奶奶包的粽子！」「我帶了學校旁邊的紅豆餅！」\n\n「我……」老巫得意地，捧出一個巨大的便當盒，「我帶了……『老巫特製・拯救地球肉包』！」\n\n「肉包？！」孩子們大笑，「你終於做出來了！」\n\n「對！」老巫鄭重地打開便當盒，「這是我用『醜蔬果』做的肉包！胡蘿蔔、高麗菜、香菇……全部都是『賣不出去』的！」\n\n「哇……」孩子們湊過去，聞了聞，「好香！」\n\n「來！」老巫把肉包遞到未晞面前，「未晞，這顆，給你！」\n\n「給……給我？」未晞愣住了。\n\n「對！」老巫大聲說，「我說過，要分你半顆肉包！現在……分你一整顆！」\n\n「老巫……」未晞接過肉包，眼眶，微微泛紅。\n\n「快吃！」老巫催促著，「趁熱！」\n\n「嗯！」未晞張開嘴，咬了一口……\n\n「好吃嗎？」老巫緊張地問。\n\n「……」未晞的眼淚，毫無預警地掉了下來。\n\n「好吃。」她哽咽著說，「這是我吃過……最好吃的肉包。」\n\n「那就好！」老巫憨憨地笑了，「以後……以後你想吃，我再做給你！」\n\n「可是……」未晞低下頭，「以後……」\n\n「以後……」老巫的聲音，也哽咽了，「以後你回來的時候，我再做給你！你……你一定要回來！」\n\n「嗯！」未晞用力點頭，「我會回來的！」\n\n「說話算話！」阿釁大聲說。\n\n「說話算話！」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n那天中午，二十六個孩子，圍著一張桌子，吃著各式各樣的美食，笑聲，沒有停過。\n\n「對了，」晴晴忽然開口，「未晞……你還有什麼，想做的事情嗎？」\n\n未晞想了想，說：「我……想去看看那棵鳳凰樹。」\n\n「鳳凰樹？」孩子們疑惑。\n\n「嗯。」未晞說，「學校門口那棵鳳凰樹。我第一天來學校的時候……它正好在開花。」\n\n「那棵樹啊！」阿釁笑了，「它在學校門口，開了不知道多少年了！」\n\n「我從來沒有見過，會開花的樹。」未晞低聲說，「在我的時代……樹，是不會開花的。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「所以，」未晞抬起頭，笑了，「我想，在回去之前，好好地，再看一次。」\n\n「好！」阿釁大聲說，「那我們明天，一起去看！」\n\n「嗯！」未晞點頭，笑容裡，帶著前所未有的滿足。\n\n那天晚上，未晞一個人，坐在教室裡，透過窗戶，看著學校門口那棵鳳凰樹。\n\n月光下，鳳凰樹的葉子，輕輕搖曳。\n\n「鳳凰樹，」她低聲說，「你開的花……是我見過，最美的花。」\n\n「未晞，」一個聲音，從教室門口響起。\n\n是晴晴。\n\n「晴晴？」未晞轉過頭，「你怎麼還沒回家？」\n\n「我……」晴晴走過來，坐到她身邊，「我想陪你一下。」\n\n「……」未晞微微笑了，「謝謝你。」\n\n「未晞，」晴晴沉默了一會，問，「你回去以後……會想我們嗎？」\n\n「會。」未晞毫不猶豫地點頭，「每一天，每一刻，都會。」\n\n「那……」晴晴低下頭，「我們……會見到你嗎？」\n\n「……」未晞沉默了。\n\n「我……不知道。」她輕輕說，「時空旅行，是單程的。我回去了……可能，就再也……」\n\n「不會的。」晴晴打斷她，「你一定會再見到我們的！因為……」\n\n「因為什麼？」\n\n「因為……」晴晴抬起頭，眼眶裡，閃爍著淚光，「我會一直，寫信給未來的你。總有一天……你會收到其中一封。」\n\n「晴晴……」未晞的眼眶，濕了。\n\n「然後，」晴晴笑了，「你收到信的那一天，就會想起我們。想起……鹿陽國小、六年一班、鳳凰樹、還有……」\n\n「還有那片海。」未晞接下去，輕輕笑了。\n\n「嗯。」晴晴點頭，「還有那片海。」\n\n「晴晴，」未晞看著她，認真地說，「我跟你保證——如果有一天，我真的收到了你們的信……我一定會，回信的。」\n\n「真的？」晴晴問。\n\n「真的。」未晞點頭，「因為……」她微微笑了，「『寫給未來』的信，是會收到回信的。」\n\n「嗯！」晴晴用力點頭，「那我，會一直寫！」\n\n月光下，兩個女孩，並肩坐在教室裡。\n\n窗外的鳳凰樹，在夜風中，輕輕搖曳。\n\n「謝謝你，」她輕輕說，「謝謝你，讓我看到這個世界，最美的樣子。」\n\n她低頭，看了一眼手環。\n\n手環上的數字，在月光下，靜靜地閃爍。\n\n——六。\n\n「六天……」她低聲說，「剛剛好。」\n\n「剛剛好夠……」她閉上眼睛，「好好地，看完這個世界。」\n\n那天晚上，未晞做了一個夢。\n\n夢裡，她看到了未來。\n\n可是……那個未來，跟她記憶裡的，不一樣了。\n\n天空，是藍色的。\n\n海，是藍色的。\n\n學校的操場上，孩子們在奔跑。\n\n鳳凰樹下，一個小女孩，正在讀一封信。\n\n「這是……」未晞在夢裡，輕輕走近，「阿釁寫的信……」\n\n信上寫著：\n\n「給未來的地球：你好！我是阿釁！我跟你保證，等我長大，我一定會把海邊的垃圾都撿光光！」\n\n「阿釁……」未晞看著那封信，眼淚，奪眶而出，「他真的……做到了。」\n\n夢裡的未來，一片明亮。\n\n「原來……」未晞在夢裡，輕輕地笑了，「未來……是可以被改變的。」\n\n「原來……」她低聲說，「我回來，是對的。」\n\n醒來的時候，未晞的眼角，還掛著淚水。\n\n可是，她的嘴角，卻掛著笑容。\n\n「……謝謝你們。」她對著窗外，輕聲說，「謝謝你們，讓我看到……那個明亮的未來。」\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 21: Exposure & Rescue\n\nThat night, the environmental protection bureau's inspection vehicles stopped at the gate of Hongyuan Food Processing Factory.\n\n\"Inspection! Open the door now!\" The inspection team leader pounded on the factory's main gate.\n\n\"Coming, coming!\" The factory's guard, still groggy from sleep, opened the door. The moment he saw the inspectors, his face changed, \"Th-this... it's so late, you...\"\n\n\"We received a tip that your factory is suspected of illegally discharging wastewater!\" The team leader flashed his inspection certificate, \"This is a search warrant! Please cooperate!\"\n\n\"I... I'll go call the boss!\" The guard hurried toward the office in a panic.\n\n\"No need to call him.\" The team leader strode into the factory, his gaze sweeping across the premises, \"We'll find him ourselves.\"\n\nHe led the inspectors straight to the underground storage tank in the factory's backyard.\n\n\"Found it!\" The inspector's flashlight shone below the storage tank, \"A hidden pipe! It's still discharging!\"\n\n\"Grayish-green liquid...\" The team leader crouched down and sniffed, \"Exactly the same as the water in the drainage ditch!\"\n\n\"Film it!\" \"Collect a water sample!\" \"Record the time!\"\n\nThe inspectors, methodically, carried out the evidence collection.\n\n\"You!\" Wang Fugui arrived, panting, \"This is trespassing!\"\n\n\"Mr. Wang,\" the team leader stood up, holding up the water sample, \"This is wastewater collected from the hidden pipe under your factory's underground storage tank. Preliminary testing shows heavy metals over the limit.\"\n\n\"Th-that...\" cold sweat broke out on Wang Fugui's forehead, \"that has nothing to do with me! That must be...\"\n\n\"Must be what?\" The team leader looked straight at him, \"Mr. Wang, last time you said it was 'residue from an old pipe.' What about this time?\"\n\n\"I...\" Wang Fugui's mouth opened and closed, but not a word came out.\n\n\"Mr. Wang,\" the team leader produced a seal, \"under the Water Pollution Control Act, your factory is suspected of illegally discharging wastewater with heavy metals over the limit. I now officially declare—\"\n\n\"Your factory is ordered to suspend operations, effective immediately!\"\n\n\"Suspension?!\" Wang Fugui's face instantly turned deathly pale, \"You can't do this! I... I have a lawyer!\"\n\n\"You have a lawyer,\" the team leader said coldly, \"and we have evidence. In court, let the lawyer and the evidence 'chat' slowly.\"\n\n\"You...\" Wang Fugui collapsed to the ground.\n\n\"And,\" the team leader added, \"we've also recorded how you sent people to watch the school these past few days. Suspected intimidation of schoolchildren—we'll add that to the charges too.\"\n\n\"...\" Wang Fugui could no longer say a word.\n\n\"Take him away.\" The team leader waved his hand to the inspectors behind him.\n\n\"What are you doing?!\" Wang Fugui panicked, \"I'm... I'm a model entrepreneur!\"\n\n\"A model entrepreneur?\" The team leader sneered, \"Would a model entrepreneur dump heavy-metal wastewater into a ditch next to a school?\"\n\n\"I...\" Wang Fugui was speechless.\n\n\"And,\" the team leader pulled a stack of photos from his pocket, \"these are photos of your people watching the school. Dean of Student Affairs Mr. Zhou sent them to our unit last night.\"\n\n\"Zhou...\" Wang Fugui's face grew even paler.\n\n\"Oh, right,\" the team leader added, \"Dean Zhou said that in his twenty years as dean, this is the first time he's seen a group of children risk everything to protect the school's water. He said...\" the team leader paused, \"'If you can't deal with him, he'll take the children and go to the media himself.'\"\n\n\"...\" Wang Fugui slumped to the ground, unable to say a word.\n\n\"Take him away.\" The team leader ordered again.\n\n\"Yes!\" The inspectors lifted Wang Fugui and carried him toward the police car.\n\n\"I won't accept this!\" Wang Fugui shouted as he was dragged away, \"I won't accept this! Those brats... what right do those brats have...\"\n\n\"What right?\" The team leader watched his back and said flatly, \"They have the right because they know better than you what 'the right thing' is.\"\n\nThe police car roared away.\n\nThe factory's main gate was sealed with a closure order.\n\n\"Team leader!\" An inspector walked over, \"What do we do with the wastewater in the storage tank?\"\n\n\"Pump it dry! Purify it!\" The team leader said, \"Not a single drop is allowed to flow into the sea.\"\n\n\"Yes!\"\n\nThat night, the lights of Hongyuan Food Processing Factory never came on again.\n\nThe white smoke from the smokestacks stopped, for the first time, forever.\n\n\"Team leader! Team leader!\" Early the next morning, A-Xin charged into the classroom of Class 6-1, shouting excitedly, \"The environmental protection bureau's website! It's announced!\"\n\n\"Announced?\" The children gathered around.\n\n\"Look!\" A-Xin held his phone up high, \"'Hongyuan Food Processing Factory, suspected of illegally discharging wastewater, heavy metals at 6.3 times the limit, ordered to suspend operations by law, and referred for prosecution!'\"\n\n\"Ordered to suspend operations!\" The children erupted in thunderous cheers, \"Referred for prosecution!\"\n\n\"We did it!\" Old Wu's tears streamed down, \"We really did it!\"\n\n\"That Boss Wang...\" Lin Yunyun murmured, \"won't be able to secretly discharge anymore, right?\"\n\n\"He won't.\" Qingqing nodded, \"The hidden pipe is sealed, the storage tank is sealed, and the factory is suspended. He...\"\n\n\"He's finished!\" A-Xin continued loudly, \"This is what they call 'reaping what you sow'!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed together.\n\n\"Weixi!\" A-Xin turned to look at Weixi, \"Did you see that?! We succeeded!\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi stood by the window, quietly looking into the distance.\n\nHer eyes reddened slightly.\n\n\"I saw it.\" she said softly, \"I saw it.\"\n\n\"That one smokestack...\" she said in a low voice, \"has stopped.\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"It's stopped!\"\n\n\"Thank you.\" Weixi turned around, bowed deeply to the whole class, \"Thank you... for making that smokestack stop.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" The children froze.\n\n\"This is...\" Weixi looked up, tears glistening in her eyes, \"the most beautiful sight I've ever seen.\"\n\n\"The most beautiful sight?\" The children asked.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"In my memories... the smokestacks never stopped.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"But today,\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"I saw it. So... smokestacks can stop.\"\n\n\"Because of you,\" she looked at the children, \"you turned 'impossible' into 'possible.'\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" Lin Yunyun's eyes suddenly turned red, \"don't say that... we...\"\n\n\"We were just...\" A-Xin rubbed his nose, \"we were just doing what needed to be done.\"\n\n\"Right.\" Qingqing nodded, \"What needed to be done.\"\n\n\"What needed to be done...\" Weixi repeated those four words, and smiled softly.\n\nJust then, the school's broadcast suddenly sounded:\n\n\"Attention, all teachers and students—\"\n\n\"The air quality in the area around our school has dropped from 'purple explosion' level to 'normal' level!\"\n\n\"The school's drinking fountains have resumed normal water supply!\"\n\n\"The water quality of the drainage ditch behind the school has returned to normal range!\"\n\n\"The air pollution has dropped!\" \"The drinking fountains are back!\" \"The drainage ditch is normal!\"\n\n\"Yay—!\"\n\nIn the classroom, the children's cheers lasted for a long, long time.\n\n\"Alright, alright,\" a light cough suddenly sounded at the door, \"so happy?\"\n\n\"Dean!\" The children jumped in fright and instantly fell silent.\n\n\"I came today,\" Dean Zhou walked into the classroom, his tone flat, \"not to catch you making noise.\"\n\n\"Then the Dean is...\" A-Xin asked cautiously.\n\n\"I came to tell you,\" Dean Zhou paused, \"that the matter of 'Hongyuan Food Processing Factory' is already on the news.\"\n\n\"On the news?!\" The children's eyes went wide.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Dean Zhou nodded, \"The school's report, plus the environmental protection bureau's announcement... now, all of Taiwan knows.\"\n\n\"All of Taiwan...\" The children looked at each other, light shining in their eyes.\n\n\"And,\" Dean Zhou said, \"the principal asked me to tell you—'Protect Earth' has officially become the school's 'featured curriculum.' Next year, it will be promoted schoolwide.\"\n\n\"Featured curriculum! Schoolwide promotion!\" The children got excited again.\n\n\"And,\" Dean Zhou's expression softened a little, for once, \"next week, the education bureau is going to commend you. The principal said you'll go up on stage to receive the award.\"\n\n\"Go on stage for an award?!\" A-Xin jumped up, \"We're going on stage for an award!\"\n\n\"But,\" Dean Zhou put on a stern face, \"before the award ceremony, homework still has to be done.\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed together.\n\n\"Dean!\" A-Xin asked loudly, \"Then... what about you?\"\n\n\"What about me?\"\n\n\"You...\" A-Xin thought for a moment, \"are you coming on stage with us?\"\n\n\"...\" Dean Zhou froze for a moment, then turned to walk out, \"...We'll see.\"\n\nBut the children all saw it.\n\nThe moment the Dean turned around, the corner of his mouth lifted slightly.\n\n\"The Dean smiled!\" Liu-Liu poked its head out of the ventilation duct and announced excitedly, \"The Black-Faced Judge smiled!\"\n\n\"Shut up!\" Dean Zhou shouted without turning back, but his steps were noticeably lighter.\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed even louder.\n\n\"Weixi!\" A-Xin turned around and shouted excitedly, \"Did you hear that?! E-very-thing is back to normal!\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" Weixi nodded hard, and her tears finally couldn't be held back, streaming down, \"I heard it...\"\n\n\"Then you...\" A-Xin suddenly lowered his head, his voice growing quiet, \"are you... going back soon?\"\n\nThe classroom suddenly fell silent.\n\nTwenty-six pairs of eyes turned to look at Weixi at once.\n\n\"...\" Weixi lowered her head, silent for a very, very long time.\n\n\"Mhm.\" She finally nodded softly, \"Soon.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"But,\" Weixi looked up, showing a gentle smile, \"before I go back, I want to...\"\n\n\"Want to see what?\" A-Xin asked.\n\n\"Want to see...\" Weixi looked out the window, \"that drainage ditch become clear again.\"\n\n\"The drainage ditch...\" The children looked at each other.\n\n\"Alright!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"Then we'll take you to see it!\"\n\nThat day after school, twenty-six children, plus Liu-Liu, marched in a grand procession toward the back of the school.\n\nThey stood at the mouth of the drainage ditch, looking at that once grayish-green water.\n\n\"Look!\" Lin Yunyun pointed at the ditch, \"The water... has turned clear!\"\n\n\"Really!\" Wang Zhuankai's eyes went wide, \"The grayish-green color from before... is gone!\"\n\n\"And,\" Liu-Liu circled above the river mouth, reporting excitedly, \"the seawater quality has returned to normal too! Fish... the fish are back!\"\n\n\"Fish?\" The children crowded to the river mouth and looked out to sea.\n\n\"Look!\" Old Wu pointed at the shallows, \"Over there! There's a school of little fish!\"\n\n\"They're really there!\" The children exclaimed, \"The fish are back!\"\n\n\"The sea...\" Weixi stood on the seawall, looking at that blue sea, her eyes once again welling up.\n\n\"A blue sea...\" she said in a low voice, \"I've finally... seen it with my own eyes.\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" A-Xin stood beside her and asked, \"is the sea your grandmother talked about... like this?\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi looked at the sea before her and was silent for a long time.\n\n\"I don't know.\" she said softly, \"Grandmother's photograph has yellowed. But...\" she smiled, \"I'd guess it looked just like this.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Lin Yunyun asked quietly, \"when you go back, will you tell your grandmother... that you saw a blue sea?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, light flickering in her eyes, \"I'll tell her. I'll tell her... that the blue sea is ten thousand times more beautiful than the photograph.\"\n\n\"Ten thousand times!\" Old Wu said loudly, \"Then you'll have to say it a lot!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed.\n\n\"And,\" Weixi crouched down, looking at the little fish in the shallows, \"I'll tell her that what I saw wasn't just a blue sea, but also... living fish.\"\n\n\"Fish...\" The children looked at the school of little fish.\n\n\"In my era,\" Weixi said softly, \"there are no fish in the sea.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"But here,\" Weixi smiled, \"there are fish. There's a blue sea. There are green trees. There are...\"\n\n\"There's us!\" A-Xin said loudly.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, smiling even wider, \"There's you.\"\n\n\"Then...\" A-Xin took a deep breath, \"you have to remember everything here! Keep it in your heart! Take it back! Tell your grandmother!\"\n\n\"I will.\" Weixi nodded hard, \"I'll take everything here—the blue sea, the living fish, the green trees, the phoenix blossoms, the pork buns, and you...\" she looked at the whole class, \"all of it, I'll take back with me.\"\n\n\"Take it back...\" The children repeated.\n\n\"Because,\" Weixi said softly, \"these... are the most precious treasures of my life.\"\n\nUnder the setting sun, the children stood on the seawall, looking at the sea.\n\nThe sea wind blew their hair in disarray.\n\nBut in everyone's eyes, there was light.\n\n\"A blue sea...\" A-Xin stood beside her, looking at the same sea, \"It will stay this blue from now on!\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"Because... you're here.\"\n\nUnder the setting sun, the twenty-six children stood on the seawall, looking at that sea which had returned to azure blue.\n\nThe sea breeze blew gently.\n\n\"By the way, Weixi,\" A-Xin suddenly remembered something, \"how much is left on your bracelet now?\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi lowered her head and looked at the bracelet.\n\n\"Six.\" she said softly.\n\n\"Six days...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"Six days,\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"is enough for me... to say goodbye to everyone properly.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" The children's eyes reddened.\n\n\"Don't cry,\" Weixi said softly, \"we agreed to say goodbye with smiles.\"\n\n\"...Mhm!\" The children nodded hard, trying to force smiles.\n\n\"Then,\" A-Xin said loudly, \"for the next six days, we're going to—'have fun'!\"\n\n\"Have fun?\" The children froze.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin said, \"For the last six days Weixi is here, we're going to take her out to play! To all the places we love! To eat all the things we love!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\" The children shouted in unison.\n\n\"Then,\" A-Xin looked at Weixi and extended his hand, \"Weixi, for these six days, where do you want to go?\"\n\nWeixi thought for a moment.\n\n\"I want to...\" she looked at the children, smiling softly, \"have a meal with you.\"\n\n\"A meal?\" The children froze.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"I want to have a proper meal with all of you. Just like...\" she lowered her head, \"just like the day we first met.\"\n\n\"Alright!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"Then tomorrow at noon, right here in the classroom, we'll hold a 'pre-graduation lunch party'!\"\n\n\"A lunch party!\"\n\n\"Everyone has to bring a dish!\" A-Xin announced, \"Bring everything you like, everything that's delicious!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\" The children responded in unison.\n\nThe next day at noon, the classroom of Class 6-1 became a \"gourmet paradise.\"\n\n\"I brought my mom's braised dishes!\" \"I brought my grandma's rice dumplings!\" \"I brought the red bean cakes from beside the school!\"\n\n\"I...\" Old Wu proudly presented a huge lunchbox, \"I brought... 'Old Wu's Special · Earth-Saving Pork Bun'!\"\n\n\"A pork bun?!\" The children laughed, \"You finally made it!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" Old Wu solemnly opened the lunchbox, \"This is my pork bun made with 'ugly produce'! Carrots, cabbage, mushrooms... all of them are 'unsellable'!\"\n\n\"Wow...\" The children leaned in and sniffed, \"So fragrant!\"\n\n\"Here!\" Old Wu held out the pork bun to Weixi, \"Weixi, this one, for you!\"\n\n\"For... for me?\" Weixi froze.\n\n\"Yes!\" Old Wu said loudly, \"I said I'd share half a pork bun with you! Now... I'm sharing a whole one!\"\n\n\"Old Wu...\" Weixi took the pork bun, her eyes reddening slightly.\n\n\"Eat it!\" Old Wu urged, \"While it's hot!\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" Weixi opened her mouth and took a bite...\n\n\"Is it good?\" Old Wu asked nervously.\n\n\"...\" Weixi's tears fell without warning.\n\n\"It's delicious.\" she choked, \"This is the most delicious pork bun... I've ever eaten.\"\n\n\"That's good!\" Old Wu smiled honestly, \"Later... if you want to eat more, I'll make it for you again!\"\n\n\"But...\" Weixi lowered her head, \"later...\"\n\n\"Later...\" Old Wu's voice choked too, \"when you come back, I'll make it for you again! You... you have to come back!\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" Weixi nodded hard, \"I'll come back!\"\n\n\"A promise is a promise!\" A-Xin said loudly.\n\n\"A promise is a promise!\" The children said in unison.\n\nThat noon, twenty-six children gathered around one table, eating all kinds of delicacies, their laughter never stopping.\n\n\"By the way,\" Qingqing suddenly spoke, \"Weixi... is there anything else you want to do?\"\n\nWeixi thought for a moment, then said: \"I... want to go see that phoenix tree.\"\n\n\"The phoenix tree?\" The children were puzzled.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi said, \"The phoenix tree at the school gate. On my first day at school... it was blooming.\"\n\n\"That tree!\" A-Xin laughed, \"It's been at the school gate for who knows how many years!\"\n\n\"I've never seen a tree that blooms.\" Weixi said in a low voice, \"In my era... trees don't bloom.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"So,\" Weixi looked up and smiled, \"I want, before I go back, to look at it properly once more.\"\n\n\"Alright!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"Then tomorrow, we'll go see it together!\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" Weixi nodded, a satisfaction never seen before in her smile.\n\nThat night, Weixi sat alone in the classroom, looking through the window at the phoenix tree at the school gate.\n\nUnder the moonlight, the phoenix tree's leaves swayed gently.\n\n\"Phoenix tree,\" she said in a low voice, \"the flowers you bloom... are the most beautiful flowers I've ever seen.\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" a voice sounded from the classroom door.\n\nIt was Qingqing.\n\n\"Qingqing?\" Weixi turned around, \"Why haven't you gone home yet?\"\n\n\"I...\" Qingqing walked over and sat down beside her, \"I wanted to keep you company for a bit.\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"Thank you.\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing was silent for a moment, then asked, \"after you go back... will you miss us?\"\n\n\"Yes.\" Weixi nodded without hesitation, \"Every day, every moment, I will.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Qingqing lowered her head, \"will we... see you again?\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi fell silent.\n\n\"I... I don't know.\" she said softly, \"Time travel is one-way. Once I go back... I may never...\"\n\n\"You will.\" Qingqing interrupted her, \"You will definitely see us again! Because...\"\n\n\"Because what?\"\n\n\"Because...\" Qingqing looked up, tears glistening in her eyes, \"I'll keep writing letters to the future you. One day... you'll receive one of them.\"\n\n\"Qingqing...\" Weixi's eyes moistened.\n\n\"Then,\" Qingqing smiled, \"the day you receive the letter, you'll remember us. Remember... Luyang Elementary, Class 6-1, the phoenix tree, and...\"\n\n\"And that sea.\" Weixi continued, smiling softly.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Qingqing nodded, \"And that sea.\"\n\n\"Qingqing,\" Weixi looked at her seriously, \"I promise you—if one day, I really receive your letters... I will definitely write back.\"\n\n\"Really?\" Qingqing asked.\n\n\"Really.\" Weixi nodded, \"Because...\" she smiled faintly, \"'letters to the future' do get replies.\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" Qingqing nodded hard, \"Then I'll keep writing!\"\n\nUnder the moonlight, the two girls sat side by side in the classroom.\n\nThe phoenix tree outside the window swayed gently in the night wind.\n\n\"Thank you,\" she said softly, \"thank you for letting me see the most beautiful side of this world.\"\n\nShe lowered her head and looked at the bracelet.\n\nThe number on the bracelet flickered quietly in the moonlight.\n\n—Six.\n\n\"Six days...\" she said in a low voice, \"just right.\"\n\n\"Just right enough...\" she closed her eyes, \"to see this world properly.\"\n\nThat night, Weixi had a dream.\n\nIn the dream, she saw the future.\n\nBut... that future was different from the one in her memories.\n\nThe sky was blue.\n\nThe sea was blue.\n\nOn the school playground, children were running.\n\nUnder the phoenix tree, a little girl was reading a letter.\n\n\"This is...\" Weixi approached softly in the dream, \"A-Xin's letter...\"\n\nThe letter read:\n\n\"To the future Earth: Hello! I'm A-Xin! I promise you, when I grow up, I will pick up every piece of trash on the beach!\"\n\n\"A-Xin...\" Weixi looked at the letter, tears streaming down, \"he really... did it.\"\n\nThe future in the dream was bright and shining.\n\n\"So...\" Weixi smiled softly in the dream, \"the future... can be changed.\"\n\n\"So...\" she said in a low voice, \"my coming back was right.\"\n\nWhen she woke up, tears still hung at the corners of Weixi's eyes.\n\nBut there was a smile on her lips.\n\n\"...Thank you.\" she said softly to the window, \"Thank you for letting me see... that bright future.\"\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":6,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第二十二章：倒數最後的時刻\n\n六天，變成了五天。\n\n五天，變成了四天。\n\n「未晞，」第三天早上，晴晴發現未晞的臉色，已經白得像一張紙，「你的手環……」\n\n「又掉了兩格。」未晞低頭，看了一眼手環，聲音虛弱，「現在……只剩四天了。」\n\n「四天……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「可是昨天還是六天啊！」阿釁紅著眼眶，「為什麼掉得這麼快？！」\n\n「因為……」未晞輕輕說，「工廠停工之後，這個時代的『未來』，已經開始改變了。」\n\n「改變？」孩子們疑惑。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「當未來被改變，時空就會開始『校正』。而我……」她低下頭，「就是不屬於這個時代的『誤差』。所以……時空會把我，『推』回去。」\n\n「推回去……」林芸芸的聲音，帶著哭腔，「那……那你……」\n\n「我會回去的。」未晞微微笑了，「在時空節點關閉之前。」\n\n「什麼時候……關閉？」晴晴問。\n\n未晞沉默了一下，說：「我不知道。可是……手環告訴我，它快了。」\n\n「快了……」孩子們的心，一下子沉了下去。\n\n「所以，」未晞看著全班二十六個人，語氣裡帶著溫柔，「接下來，我們要珍惜每一分鐘。」\n\n那天，未晞的狀況，像退潮一樣，一點一點地「退」著。\n\n「未晞，你口渴嗎？」「未晞，你要不要休息？」「未晞……」\n\n孩子們圍著她，問個不停。\n\n「我沒事的。」未晞總是這樣說，「我只是……有點累。」\n\n可是，大家都看得出來。\n\n未晞說話的速度，變慢了。\n\n未晞走路的速度，變慢了。\n\n未晞的笑容，也變慢了。\n\n「未晞，」第四天的下午，晴晴終於忍不住問，「你……是不是快要……」\n\n「嗯。」未晞沒有隱瞞，輕輕點頭，「手環告訴我……時空節點，可能在明天晚上開啟。」\n\n「明天晚上？！」孩子們倒抽一口涼氣。\n\n「也就是說……」阿釁顫抖著問，「你……明天就要走了？」\n\n「可能。」未晞低下頭，聲音輕輕的，「也許是明天晚上。也許……」她沒有說下去。\n\n「未晞……」孩子們的眼眶，都紅了。\n\n「所以，」未晞抬起頭，努力露出笑容，「明天，會是我在這個時代……最後的一天。」\n\n「最後的一天……」孩子們重複著。\n\n「我想把最後一天，」未晞輕輕說，「跟你們一起，好好地度過。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「你們願意……」未晞問，「陪我嗎？」\n\n「願意！」孩子們齊聲大喊，「我們願意！」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「未晞，」阿釁忽然開口，聲音啞啞的，「你……你有沒有什麼，還沒做完的事？」\n\n未晞想了想。\n\n「有。」她說，「我想……跟大家，好好地拍一張照片。」\n\n「拍照？」孩子們愣住。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「我想把你們每一個人的臉，都好好地記住。這樣……」她低下頭，「就算我回去了，我也能……在夢裡，再見到你們。」\n\n「……」孩子們的眼眶，紅了。\n\n「好！」阿釁大聲說，「那我們就拍照！就在鳳凰樹下！」\n\n那天晚上，未晞失眠了。\n\n她躺在床上，透過窗戶，看著滿天星光，捨不得閉上眼睛。\n\n「明天……」她低聲說，「就是最後一天了。」\n\n「我要……」她輕輕笑了，「把每一秒，都記住。」\n\n第二天早上，未晞比誰都早起。\n\n她站在教室門口，看著空蕩蕩的教室。\n\n「早安，教室。」她輕輕說。\n\n「早安，黑板。」\n\n「早安，課桌椅。」\n\n「早安……六年一班。」\n\n她走到窗邊，摸了摸窗台上那盆種子盆栽。\n\n「你們要乖乖長大，」她低聲說，「替我……看著這個世界。」\n\n「未晞！」教室門口，響起孩子們的聲音，「早！」\n\n「早安！」未晞轉過頭，露出燦爛的笑容，「今天……是我在這裡，最後的一天了！」\n\n「最後的一天……」孩子們沉默了一下，然後，阿釁大聲說：「那我們更要，開開心心地過！」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲說，「開開心心地過！」\n\n那天，孩子們帶著未晞，做完了所有她想做的事。\n\n他們在教室裡，玩了一場遊戲。\n\n他們在操場上，跑了一圈。\n\n他們在鳳凰樹下，唱了一首歌。\n\n「鳳凰花開的路口……」未晞跟著孩子們，輕輕唱著，「有我珍惜的朋友……」\n\n唱著唱著，孩子們的眼眶，都紅了。\n\n「別唱了別唱了！」阿釁大喊，「唱什麼哭歌！我們唱『兩隻老虎』！」\n\n「兩隻老虎，兩隻老虎……」孩子們破涕為笑，唱起了兒歌。\n\n「跑得快，跑得快……」\n\n未晞站在鳳凰樹下，看著這群又哭又笑的孩子，覺得這一刻，是她這輩子，最快樂的時光。\n\n「鳳凰樹下……」未晞愣了一下，然後，輕輕笑了，「好。」\n\n那天上午，孩子們請來了班導師，在學校門口那棵鳳凰樹下，拍了一張合照。\n\n「來！大家都看鏡頭！」班導師舉起手機，「三、二、一——」\n\n「耶——！」\n\n孩子們笑成一團。未晞站在中間，微微笑著。\n\n「再拍一張！」阿釁大喊，「這次……這次未晞要站在最前面！」\n\n「對！未晞站最前面！」\n\n孩子們把未晞推到最前面，然後，二十六個人，在她的身後，圍成了一個半圓。\n\n「來！茄子！」\n\n「茄——子——！」\n\n「咔嚓！」\n\n那一瞬間，被永遠地，定格在了照片裡。\n\n「對了！我還有個主意！」阿釁忽然大聲說，「我們每個人都寫一句話，送給未晞！」\n\n「寫一句話？」孩子們愣住。\n\n「對！」阿釁說，「就像園遊會那天的『寫給未來』一樣！這次，是寫給『未晞』的！」\n\n「好！」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n於是，二十六個孩子，一人一張小卡片，寫下了給未晞的話。\n\n「給未晞：謝謝你教我們分類垃圾！我現在看到寶特瓶，都會想到你！」——林芸芸\n\n「給未晞：你的肉包，是我吃過最好吃的肉包！——不，是我做的最好！」——老巫\n\n「給未晞：我會努力長大，變成一個可以拯救地球的大人！」——柯志遠\n\n「給未晞：謝謝你讓我負責『笑』！我會一直笑下去！」——尪伝恺\n\n「給未晞：……」阿釁想了很久很久，最後，寫下了一句話：\n\n「給未晞：你是我們班的『未來之眼』。等你回到未來，記得抬頭看看——那裡的天空，一定會因為我們，變得更藍。」\n\n「阿釁……」未晞讀著那些卡片，眼淚，一滴一滴地，掉了下來。\n\n「怎麼又哭了！」阿釁慌張地，「我、我不是故意惹你哭的！」\n\n「不是……」未晞哽咽著，「是因為……你們寫得太好了……」\n\n「那……」阿釁想了想，「那我們以後，每年都寫一張給你好不好？」\n\n「每年……」未晞低下頭，「可是……你們寫的信，寄得到未來嗎？」\n\n「一定會！」晴晴大聲說，「因為園遊會那天，我們寫的信……一定都寄到了！」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲說，「一定會寄到的！」\n\n「……」未晞看著孩子們，眼眶裡，閃爍著淚光。\n\n「嗯。」她輕輕說，「我相信。」\n\n照片裡，鳳凰樹開著火紅的花。\n\n照片裡，二十六個孩子，笑得比花還燦爛。\n\n照片裡，站在最前面的那個女孩，眼角，有一滴晶瑩的淚光。\n\n「未晞，」阿釁看著那張照片，問，「照片……洗得出來嗎？」\n\n「洗得出來。」未晞說，「照片，是會留下來的。」\n\n「那就好。」阿釁笑了，「那以後……我們想念你的時候，就可以看照片。」\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「我會……把這張照片，帶回去。」\n\n「帶回去？」孩子們愣住。\n\n「帶回我的時代。」未晞輕輕說，「讓奶奶看看……這個時代的孩子，是什麼樣子。」\n\n「那……」老巫大聲說，「你一定要告訴奶奶——我們是全世界最棒的一班！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑了，「對！全世界最棒的一班！」\n\n那天中午，未晞做了一件，讓孩子們都愣住了的事。\n\n她把每一樣午餐，都吃了一口。\n\n「未晞，你怎麼了？」晴晴擔心地問，「你平常不是……」\n\n「我想把這些味道，都記住。」未晞輕輕說，「在我那裡……沒有這些味道。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「這個滷雞腿，」未晞細細咀嚼著，「好香。這個高麗菜，甜甜的。這個湯……」她笑了，「跟我奶奶煮的，好像。」\n\n「未晞……」林芸芸的眼眶，紅了。\n\n「對不起，」未晞低下頭，「我是不是……讓你們難過了？」\n\n「沒有！」孩子們異口同聲，「我們沒有難過！」\n\n「我們只是……」阿釁揉了揉鼻子，「只是覺得，你今天特別會吃！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們又笑了，笑著笑著，眼眶卻都紅了。\n\n那天下午，孩子們帶著未晞，走遍了學校的每一個角落。\n\n「這裡是操場！」阿釁指著，「你第一次來學校，我們就是在這裡做早操的！」\n\n「這裡是圖書館！」晴晴說，「你常常在這裡看書！」\n\n「這裡是器材室！」老巫說，「我們的『祕密基地』！」\n\n「這裡……」未晞站在器材室門口，輕輕笑了，「是我們『守護地球作戰部隊』，第一次開會的地方。」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n「還有這裡！」林芸芸指著教室後面的樹苗地，「我們種的樹！你看，都長高了！」\n\n「真的……」未晞蹲下來，看著那些長高的樹苗，「它們……都在好好地長大。」\n\n「因為，」晴晴蹲在她身邊，「有人照顧它們啊！」\n\n「對！」阿釁大聲說，「我們『植樹認養突擊隊』，每天都有來澆水！」\n\n「謝謝你們。」未晞輕輕撫摸著樹苗的葉子，「謝謝你們……照顧它們長大。」\n\n「未晞，」阿釁忽然問，「你還有什麼想去的地方嗎？」\n\n未晞想了想。\n\n「我想……」她說，「再去一次海堤。」\n\n「海堤？」孩子們愣住。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「我想再看看那片海。然後……」她低下頭，「好好地，跟它說再見。」\n\n那天傍晚，孩子們又陪著未晞，站在了海堤上。\n\n夕陽，把整片海，染成了金紅色。\n\n「好漂亮……」未晞看著那片海，輕聲說，「比我見過的，任何一幅畫，都要漂亮。」\n\n「那當然！」老巫大聲說，「這是我們的海！」\n\n「我們的海……」未晞重複著，然後，她對著大海，輕輕地說了一句：\n\n「謝謝你，海。」\n\n「謝謝你，讓我看見，你藍色的樣子。」\n\n海風，輕輕吹過。\n\n未晞的頭髮，在風中飛揚。\n\n「未晞，」晴晴站在她身邊，問，「你……會不會害怕？」\n\n「怕什麼？」未晞問。\n\n「怕……回去。」晴晴低聲說，「怕回去以後，看到的那個世界。」\n\n「……」未晞沉默了。\n\n「會。」她輕輕說，「我會怕。」\n\n「那……」晴晴的聲音，哽咽了。\n\n「可是，」未晞轉過頭，看著晴晴，微微笑了，「我現在不怕了。」\n\n「為什麼？」\n\n「因為……」未晞說，「我知道，那個世界，正在被改變。而改變它的人……」她看著海堤上的二十六個孩子，「就在我的面前。」\n\n「未晞……」孩子們的眼眶，都紅了。\n\n「所以，」未晞輕輕說，「就算回去，我也不怕。因為我知道……未來，會變好的。」\n\n「未晞，」夜深了，孩子們都回去了，晴晴卻留下來，坐在未晞身邊，「你還會……想我們嗎？」\n\n「會。」未晞點頭，「每一天，每一秒，都會。」\n\n「那……」晴晴低下頭，「你在未來……會孤單嗎？」\n\n「……」未晞沉默了。\n\n「以前會。」她輕輕說，「在我回來之前，我一直覺得……自己是孤單的。可是現在……」\n\n「現在？」\n\n「現在，」未晞笑了，「我的心裡，裝滿了你們。滿到……就算在未來，也不會覺得孤單了。」\n\n「未晞……」晴晴的眼眶，紅了。\n\n「晴晴，」未晞看著她，認真地說，「謝謝你。謝謝你……在我最需要的時候，成為我的朋友。」\n\n「……」晴晴的眼淚，掉了下來。\n\n「別哭，」未晞伸出手，輕輕擦去她的眼淚，「我們說好的……要笑著說再見的。」\n\n「嗯！」晴晴用力點頭，努力擠出笑容，「我……我會笑著的！」\n\n「那就好。」未晞輕輕笑了，「那就好。」\n\n「會變好的！」孩子們齊聲大喊，「一定會變好的！」\n\n那天晚上，未晞做了一件，讓孩子們哭成一片的事。\n\n她拿出了一疊信紙，寫了二十六封信。\n\n「每一封，」未晞說，「都是寫給你們的。」\n\n「寫給我們的？」孩子們愣住。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「你們每個人，都有一封。」\n\n她把信，一封一封地，發到每個人的手上。\n\n「阿釁，你的信上寫著——」未晞輕輕讀著，「『給最好的點子王：謝謝你，讓我知道，原來『想辦法』，可以拯救世界。』」\n\n「晴晴，你的信上寫著——」『給最可靠的班長：謝謝你，替我守住了這個世界的秘密。』」\n\n「老巫，你的信上寫著——」『給最溫暖的吃貨：謝謝你的肉包，那是世界上最溫暖的味道。』」\n\n「林芸芸，你的信上寫著——」『給最勇敢的女孩：謝謝你，讓我看到，膽小的人也可以很勇敢。』」\n\n「……」孩子們看著手上的信，哭成了一片。\n\n「對了，未晞，」阿釁忽然想到什麼，「你寫給我們的信……我們可以打開看嗎？」\n\n「當然可以！」未晞笑了，「那些信，就是要你們看的！」\n\n「那我要第一個看！」阿釁小心翼翼地，打開自己的信。\n\n「『給最好的點子王：謝謝你，讓我知道，原來『想辦法』，可以拯救世界。』」阿釁讀著，眼眶紅了，「未晞，你……」\n\n「你每一次想辦法，」未晞輕輕說，「都是在拯救世界。不管是分垃圾、省電、還是想辦法追查管線……你都是大家的『點子王』。」\n\n「未晞……」阿釁低下頭，聲音啞啞的。\n\n「我看了！我看了！」老巫打開自己的信，「『給最溫暖的吃貨：謝謝你的肉包，那是世界上最溫暖的味道。』」\n\n「老巫，」未晞說，「你的肉包，不只是肉包。那是……你用『愛』做的肉包。」\n\n「我……我以後，天天做給你吃！」老巫大聲說。\n\n「好。」未晞笑了，「那我會，在未來，天天等你。」\n\n「林芸芸，你的信！」晴晴催促著。\n\n「『給最勇敢的女孩：謝謝你，讓我看到，膽小的人也可以很勇敢。』」林芸芸讀著，眼淚掉了下來，「未晞……我一點都不勇敢……」\n\n「你勇敢。」未晞輕輕說，「你會在大家害怕的時候，第一個站出來。你會在淨灘的時候，撿起別人不敢碰的垃圾。你……是我見過，最勇敢的女孩。」\n\n「……」林芸芸哭著，用力點頭。\n\n「未晞，」尪伝恺打開信，「你這封寫的是……『給最會笑的男孩：謝謝你，讓大家在最辛苦的日子裡，也能笑得出來。』」\n\n「尪伝恺，」未晞笑了，「你的笑聲，是我們班最寶貴的『特效藥』。」\n\n「噗！」尪伝恺忍不住笑了，又哭了，「那我……我會一直笑的！」\n\n「嗯！」未晞點頭，「要一直笑下去！」\n\n「還有最後一封，」未晞把最後一封信，握在手裡，「是寫給……六年一班全體同學的。」\n\n她展開信紙，輕輕讀著：\n\n「給我最喜歡的六年一班：\n\n謝謝你們，讓我知道，未來是可以被改變的。\n\n謝謝你們，讓我知道，藍色的海、綠色的樹、火紅的鳳凰花、溫暖的肉包，都是真實存在的。\n\n謝謝你們，讓我這個『來自未來的人』，在離開之前，找到了『家』的感覺。\n\n我會在未來，等著你們。\n\n等著你們長大，等著你們，把這個世界，變成更美好的樣子。\n\n我們……一定會再見面的。」\n\n「未晞！！」孩子們哭著，湧上前，把未晞團團圍住。\n\n「別哭，」未晞輕輕拍著他們的背，「我們說好的……要笑著說再見的。」\n\n「可是……」阿釁哭著說，「我們笑不出來啊……」\n\n「那就……」未晞微微笑了，「那就讓我，替你們笑吧。」\n\n那一夜，孩子們哭了很久很久。\n\n未晞也哭了。\n\n可是，在淚水的盡頭，每個人的心裡，都亮著一盞燈。\n\n那盞燈的名字，叫做——「希望」。\n\n深夜，孩子們都回家了。\n\n未晞一個人，坐在教室裡，透過窗戶，看著天空。\n\n「明天……」她低聲說，「就是最後一天了。」\n\n她低頭，看著手環。\n\n手環上的數字，在月光下，靜靜地閃爍。\n\n——二。\n\n「兩天……」未晞輕輕笑了，「剛剛好。」\n\n「剛剛好夠……」她閉上眼睛，「好好地，跟大家道別。」\n\n「還有……」她抬起頭，看向天空，「剛剛好夠……看一眼，這個時代的星空。」\n\n窗外的天空，星光滿天。\n\n未晞伸出手，像是在觸摸那些星星。\n\n「未來的人們啊，」她低聲說，「請你們記得……」\n\n「在很久很久以前，有一群孩子，為了讓你們看到這片星空……」\n\n「付出了，他們能做到的一切。」\n\n「所以……」她輕輕笑了，「請你們，一定要幸福啊。」\n\n「未晞，」一個聲音，從教室門口響起。\n\n是溜溜。\n\n「溜溜？」未晞愣了一下，「你怎麼還沒休息？」\n\n「嗶嗶……」溜溜跳上窗台，坐在她身邊，「我睡不著。我怕……醒來之後，你就走了。」\n\n「……」未晞輕輕摸了摸溜溜的頭，「我不會一聲不響地走的。我會……跟你們好好道別的。」\n\n「嗶嗶……」溜溜蹭了蹭她的手，「未晞，你走了以後……誰來幫我們『看』未來啊？」\n\n「你們自己就可以。」未晞笑了，「你們已經學會了，怎麼保護未來。」\n\n「真的嗎？」溜溜問。\n\n「真的。」未晞點頭，「你們比任何『未來的人』，都更懂未來。」\n\n「嗶嗶……」溜溜想了想，「那……我有一件事，想拜託你。」\n\n「什麼事？」\n\n「幫我，」溜溜說，「幫我看看……未來的天空，是不是藍色的。」\n\n「……」未晞愣了一下，然後，輕輕笑了。\n\n「好。」她說，「我一定會看的。」\n\n「還有，」溜溜又說，「幫我告訴未來的動物們——有一隻叫溜溜的機器小寵物，在很久很久以前，為了保護它們的家，很努力很努力過。」\n\n「嗯。」未晞輕輕說，「我一定會告訴它們的。」\n\n月光下，一個女孩，和一隻小寵物，並肩坐在窗邊。\n\n「溜溜，」未晞低聲說，「謝謝你，一直陪著我。」\n\n「嗶嗶……」溜溜蹭著她，「不用謝。因為……你是我最好的朋友。」\n\n「嗯。」未晞輕輕笑了，「我也是。」\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 22: The Final Countdown\n\nSix days became five.\n\nFive days became four.\n\n\"Weixi,\" on the third morning, Qingqing noticed that Weixi's face had turned white as paper, \"your bracelet...\"\n\n\"It dropped another two digits.\" Weixi lowered her head and looked at the bracelet, her voice weak, \"Now... only four days left.\"\n\n\"Four days...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"But it was still six days yesterday!\" A-Xin's eyes were red, \"Why is it dropping so fast?!\"\n\n\"Because...\" Weixi said softly, \"after the factory was shut down, the 'future' of this era has already begun to change.\"\n\n\"Change?\" The children were puzzled.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"When the future changes, the timeline begins to 'correct' itself. And I...\" she lowered her head, \"am the 'error' that doesn't belong to this era. So... the timeline will 'push' me back.\"\n\n\"Push you back...\" Lin Yunyun's voice carried tears, \"Then... then you...\"\n\n\"I'll go back.\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"Before the time node closes.\"\n\n\"When... will it close?\" Qingqing asked.\n\nWeixi was silent for a moment, then said: \"I don't know. But... the bracelet tells me it's coming soon.\"\n\n\"Soon...\" The children's hearts sank.\n\n\"So,\" Weixi looked at all twenty-six people in the class, her tone gentle, \"in the time we have left, we need to cherish every minute.\"\n\nThat day, Weixi's condition receded like the tide, little by little.\n\n\"Weixi, are you thirsty?\" \"Weixi, do you want to rest?\" \"Weixi...\"\n\nThe children gathered around her, asking endlessly.\n\n\"I'm fine.\" Weixi always said that, \"I'm just... a little tired.\"\n\nBut everyone could see it.\n\nWeixi's speech had slowed down.\n\nWeixi's walking had slowed down.\n\nWeixi's smile had slowed down too.\n\n\"Weixi,\" on the afternoon of the fourth day, Qingqing finally couldn't help asking, \"are you... about to...\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi didn't hide it, nodding softly, \"The bracelet tells me... the time node may open tomorrow evening.\"\n\n\"Tomorrow evening?!\" The children gasped.\n\n\"Which means...\" A-Xin asked tremblingly, \"you... are leaving tomorrow?\"\n\n\"Maybe.\" Weixi lowered her head, her voice soft, \"Maybe tomorrow evening. Maybe...\" she didn't finish.\n\n\"Weixi...\" The children's eyes all reddened.\n\n\"So,\" Weixi looked up, trying to smile, \"tomorrow will be... my last day in this era.\"\n\n\"The last day...\" The children repeated.\n\n\"I want to spend the last day,\" Weixi said softly, \"properly, with all of you.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"Will you...\" Weixi asked, \"keep me company?\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children shouted in unison, \"We'll keep you company!\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"Weixi,\" A-Xin suddenly spoke, his voice hoarse, \"is there anything you... haven't finished yet?\"\n\nWeixi thought for a moment.\n\n\"Yes.\" she said, \"I want to... take a proper photo with everyone.\"\n\n\"A photo?\" The children froze.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"I want to remember each of your faces properly. That way...\" she lowered her head, \"even after I go back, I can... see you again in my dreams.\"\n\n\"...\" The children's eyes reddened.\n\n\"Alright!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"Then we'll take photos! Right under the phoenix tree!\"\n\nThat night, Weixi couldn't sleep.\n\nShe lay in bed, looking at the starry sky through the window, unwilling to close her eyes.\n\n\"Tomorrow...\" she said in a low voice, \"will be the last day.\"\n\n\"I want to...\" she smiled softly, \"remember every second.\"\n\nThe next morning, Weixi woke up earlier than everyone.\n\nShe stood at the classroom door, looking at the empty classroom.\n\n\"Good morning, classroom.\" she said softly.\n\n\"Good morning, blackboard.\"\n\n\"Good morning, desks and chairs.\"\n\n\"Good morning... Class 6-1.\"\n\nShe walked to the window and touched the seed pot on the windowsill.\n\n\"Grow up well,\" she said in a low voice, \"and... watch this world for me.\"\n\n\"Weixi!\" Voices sounded at the classroom door, \"Morning!\"\n\n\"Good morning!\" Weixi turned around, showing a brilliant smile, \"Today... is my last day here!\"\n\n\"The last day...\" The children were silent for a moment, then A-Xin said loudly: \"Then we'll spend it, joyfully!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children said in unison, \"Joyfully!\"\n\nThat day, the children took Weixi to do everything she wanted to do.\n\nThey played a game in the classroom.\n\nThey ran a lap on the playground.\n\nThey sang a song under the phoenix tree.\n\n\"At the crossroads where phoenix blossoms bloom...\" Weixi sang softly with the children, \"friends I cherish...\"\n\nAs they sang, the children's eyes all reddened.\n\n\"Stop, stop!\" A-Xin shouted, \"Why are we singing a crying song! Let's sing 'Two Tigers'!\"\n\n\"Two tigers, two tigers...\" The children broke into smiles through their tears and sang the nursery rhyme.\n\n\"Running fast, running fast...\"\n\nStanding under the phoenix tree, watching these children laughing and crying, Weixi felt that this moment was the happiest time of her life.\n\n\"Under the phoenix tree...\" Weixi froze for a moment, then smiled softly, \"Alright.\"\n\nThat morning, the children invited the homeroom teacher and took a group photo under the phoenix tree at the school gate.\n\n\"Everyone, look at the camera!\" The homeroom teacher raised her phone, \"Three, two, one—\"\n\n\"Yay—!\"\n\nThe children laughed together. Weixi stood in the middle, smiling softly.\n\n\"One more!\" A-Xin shouted, \"This time... Weixi stands in front!\"\n\n\"Yes! Weixi in front!\"\n\nThe children pushed Weixi to the front, and then, twenty-six people formed a semicircle behind her.\n\n\"Cheese!\"\n\n\"Chee—se—!\"\n\n\"Click!\"\n\nThat moment was forever frozen in the photograph.\n\nIn the photo, the phoenix tree bloomed with fiery red flowers.\n\nIn the photo, twenty-six children smiled brighter than the flowers.\n\nIn the photo, the girl standing in front had a glistening tear at the corner of her eye.\n\n\"Oh right! I have an idea!\" A-Xin suddenly said loudly, \"Let's each write a message for Weixi!\"\n\n\"Write a message?\" The children froze.\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin said, \"Just like the 'Letter to the Future' at the fair! This time, it's for 'Weixi'!\"\n\n\"Alright!\" The children said in unison.\n\nAnd so, twenty-six children, each with a small card, wrote messages for Weixi.\n\n\"To Weixi: Thank you for teaching us to sort trash! Now when I see a PET bottle, I think of you!\"—Lin Yunyun\n\n\"To Weixi: Your pork bun was the most delicious pork bun I ever ate!—No, the one I made is the best!\"—Old Wu\n\n\"To Weixi: I'll work hard to grow up and become an adult who can save the Earth!\"—Ke Zhiyuan\n\n\"To Weixi: Thank you for making me in charge of 'laughing'! I'll keep laughing forever!\"—Wang Zhuankai\n\n\"To Weixi:...\" A-Xin thought for a very, very long time, and finally wrote down one sentence:\n\n\"To Weixi: You are our class's 'Eyes of the Future.' When you return to the future, remember to look up—the sky there will be bluer, because of us.\"\n\n\"A-Xin...\" Weixi read those cards, and tears fell drop by drop.\n\n\"Why are you crying again!\" A-Xin panicked, \"I-I didn't mean to make you cry!\"\n\n\"No...\" Weixi choked, \"It's because... you wrote so well...\"\n\n\"Then...\" A-Xin thought for a moment, \"then we'll write you a card every year, okay?\"\n\n\"Every year...\" Weixi lowered her head, \"but... can the letters you write reach the future?\"\n\n\"They definitely will!\" Qingqing said loudly, \"Because the letters we wrote at the fair... must have all been delivered!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children said in unison, \"They'll definitely be delivered!\"\n\n\"...\" Looking at the children, Weixi's eyes glistened.\n\n\"Mhm.\" she said softly, \"I believe you.\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" A-Xin looked at the photo and asked, \"can this photo... be developed?\"\n\n\"It can be developed.\" Weixi said, \"Photos are things that stay.\"\n\n\"That's good.\" A-Xin smiled, \"Then in the future, when we miss you, we can look at the photo.\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"I'll... take this photo back with me.\"\n\n\"Take it back?\" The children froze.\n\n\"Back to my era.\" Weixi said softly, \"So Grandmother can see... what the children of this era look like.\"\n\n\"Then,\" Old Wu said loudly, \"you must tell Grandmother—our class is the best class in the whole world!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed, \"Yes! The best class in the whole world!\"\n\nThat noon, Weixi did something that stunned the children.\n\nShe took a bite of every single dish at lunch.\n\n\"Weixi, what's wrong?\" Qingqing asked worriedly, \"You usually don't...\"\n\n\"I want to remember all these flavors.\" Weixi said softly, \"In my era... there are none of these flavors.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"This braised chicken leg,\" Weixi chewed slowly, \"is so fragrant. This cabbage, sweet. This soup...\" she smiled, \"tastes just like my grandmother's cooking.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" Lin Yunyun's eyes reddened.\n\n\"I'm sorry,\" Weixi lowered her head, \"am I... making you sad?\"\n\n\"No!\" The children said in unison, \"We're not sad!\"\n\n\"We're just...\" A-Xin rubbed his nose, \"just thinking that you're especially good at eating today!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed again, laughing and laughing, but their eyes all reddened.\n\nThat afternoon, the children took Weixi to walk through every corner of the school.\n\n\"This is the playground!\" A-Xin pointed, \"On your first day at school, we did morning exercises here!\"\n\n\"This is the library!\" Qingqing said, \"You often read here!\"\n\n\"This is the equipment room!\" Old Wu said, \"Our 'secret base'!\"\n\n\"Here...\" Weixi stood at the equipment room door, smiling softly, \"is where our 'Protect Earth Operations Unit' held its first meeting.\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children said in unison.\n\n\"And here!\" Lin Yunyun pointed at the sapling lot behind the classroom, \"The trees we planted! Look, they've grown tall!\"\n\n\"They really have...\" Weixi crouched down, looking at the grown saplings, \"They're all... growing up properly.\"\n\n\"Because,\" Qingqing crouched beside her, \"someone takes care of them!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"Our 'Tree Adoption Raid Squad' waters them every day!\"\n\n\"Thank you.\" Weixi gently touched the sapling's leaves, \"Thank you... for taking care of them as they grow.\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" A-Xin suddenly asked, \"is there anywhere else you want to go?\"\n\nWeixi thought for a moment.\n\n\"I want to...\" she said, \"go to the seawall one more time.\"\n\n\"The seawall?\" The children froze.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"I want to see that sea once more. And then...\" she lowered her head, \"say goodbye to it properly.\"\n\nThat evening, the children accompanied Weixi to the seawall again.\n\nThe setting sun dyed the entire sea golden-red.\n\n\"So beautiful...\" Weixi looked at the sea, saying softly, \"more beautiful than any painting I've ever seen.\"\n\n\"Of course!\" Old Wu said loudly, \"This is our sea!\"\n\n\"Our sea...\" Weixi repeated, and then, facing the sea, she said softly:\n\n\"Thank you, sea.\"\n\n\"Thank you for letting me see your blue form.\"\n\nThe sea breeze blew gently.\n\nWeixi's hair flew in the wind.\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing stood beside her and asked, \"are you... afraid?\"\n\n\"Afraid of what?\" Weixi asked.\n\n\"Afraid of... going back.\" Qingqing said in a low voice, \"Afraid that after you go back, you'll see that world.\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi fell silent.\n\n\"Yes.\" she said softly, \"I am afraid.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Qingqing's voice choked.\n\n\"But,\" Weixi turned to look at Qingqing, smiling faintly, \"I'm not afraid anymore.\"\n\n\"Why?\"\n\n\"Because...\" Weixi said, \"I know that world is being changed. And the ones changing it...\" she looked at the twenty-six children on the seawall, \"are right here before me.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" The children's eyes all reddened.\n\n\"So,\" Weixi said softly, \"even if I go back, I'm not afraid. Because I know... the future will be better.\"\n\n\"It will be better!\" The children shouted in unison, \"It will definitely be better!\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" late at night, after all the children had gone home, Qingqing stayed behind, sitting beside Weixi, \"will you... still miss us?\"\n\n\"Yes.\" Weixi nodded, \"Every day, every second, I will.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Qingqing lowered her head, \"in the future... will you be lonely?\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi fell silent.\n\n\"Before, I was.\" she said softly, \"Before I came back, I always felt... that I was alone. But now...\"\n\n\"Now?\"\n\n\"Now,\" Weixi smiled, \"my heart is filled with all of you. So full... that even in the future, I won't feel lonely.\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" Qingqing's eyes reddened.\n\n\"Qingqing,\" Weixi looked at her seriously, \"thank you. Thank you... for becoming my friend when I needed it most.\"\n\n\"...\" Qingqing's tears fell.\n\n\"Don't cry,\" Weixi reached out and gently wiped away her tears, \"we agreed... to say goodbye with smiles.\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" Qingqing nodded hard, trying to smile, \"I... I'll smile!\"\n\n\"That's good.\" Weixi smiled softly, \"That's good.\"\n\nThat night, Weixi did something that made the children cry into a mess.\n\nShe took out a stack of letter paper and wrote twenty-six letters.\n\n\"Each one,\" Weixi said, \"is written for one of you.\"\n\n\"For us?\" The children froze.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"Each of you has one.\"\n\nShe handed out the letters, one by one, to each person.\n\n\"A-Xin, your letter says—\" Weixi read softly, \"'To the best King of Ideas: Thank you for showing me that 'thinking of ways' can save the world.'\"\n\n\"Qingqing, your letter says—\" 'To the most reliable Class President: Thank you for guarding this world's secret for me.'\"\n\n\"Old Wu, your letter says—\" 'To the warmest foodie: Thank you for your pork bun, the warmest flavor in the world.'\"\n\n\"Lin Yunyun, your letter says—\" 'To the bravest girl: Thank you for showing me that timid people can be brave too.'\"\n\n\"...\" The children looked at the letters in their hands and cried into a mess.\n\n\"Oh right, Weixi,\" A-Xin suddenly thought of something, \"the letters you wrote to us... can we open them?\"\n\n\"Of course!\" Weixi smiled, \"Those letters are meant for you to read!\"\n\n\"Then I'll read mine first!\" A-Xin carefully opened his letter.\n\n\"'To the best King of Ideas: Thank you for showing me that 'thinking of ways' can save the world.'\" A-Xin read, his eyes reddening, \"Weixi, you...\"\n\n\"Every time you think of a way,\" Weixi said softly, \"you're saving the world. Whether it's sorting trash, saving electricity, or finding a way to track down the pipe... you're everyone's 'King of Ideas.'\"\n\n\"Weixi...\" A-Xin lowered his head, his voice hoarse.\n\n\"I'm reading mine! I'm reading mine!\" Old Wu opened his letter, \"'To the warmest foodie: Thank you for your pork bun, the warmest flavor in the world.'\"\n\n\"Old Wu,\" Weixi said, \"your pork bun isn't just a pork bun. It's... a pork bun made with 'love.'\"\n\n\"I... I'll make it for you every day from now on!\" Old Wu said loudly.\n\n\"Alright.\" Weixi smiled, \"Then I'll wait for you, every day, in the future.\"\n\n\"Lin Yunyun, read yours!\" Qingqing urged.\n\n\"'To the bravest girl: Thank you for showing me that timid people can be brave too.'\" Lin Yunyun read, tears falling, \"Weixi... I'm not brave at all...\"\n\n\"You are brave.\" Weixi said softly, \"You're the first to step forward when everyone is afraid. You pick up trash others won't touch at the beach cleanup. You... are the bravest girl I've ever met.\"\n\n\"...\" Lin Yunyun cried and nodded hard.\n\n\"Weixi,\" Wang Zhuankai opened his letter, \"yours says... 'To the boy who laughs the most: Thank you for making everyone laugh even on the hardest days.'\"\n\n\"Wang Zhuankai,\" Weixi smiled, \"your laughter is our class's most precious 'medicine.'\"\n\n\"Pfft!\" Wang Zhuankai couldn't help laughing, then crying, \"Then... I'll keep laughing!\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" Weixi nodded, \"Keep laughing forever!\"\n\n\"And the last letter,\" Weixi held the final letter in her hand, \"is written for... all of Class 6-1.\"\n\nShe unfolded the paper and read softly:\n\n\"To my favorite Class 6-1:\n\nThank you for showing me that the future can be changed.\n\nThank you for showing me that blue seas, green trees, fiery phoenix blossoms, and warm pork buns really exist.\n\nThank you for making me, a 'person from the future,' feel like I found a 'home' before I left.\n\nI will wait for you in the future.\n\nWaiting for you to grow up, waiting for you to make this world an even more beautiful place.\n\nWe... will definitely meet again.\"\n\n\"Weixi!!\" The children cried and surged forward, surrounding Weixi.\n\n\"Don't cry,\" Weixi gently patted their backs, \"we agreed... to say goodbye with smiles.\"\n\n\"But...\" A-Xin sobbed, \"we can't smile...\"\n\n\"Then...\" Weixi smiled softly, \"let me smile for you.\"\n\nThat night, the children cried for a very, very long time.\n\nWeixi cried too.\n\nBut at the end of the tears, a lamp glowed in everyone's heart.\n\nThe name of that lamp was—\"Hope.\"\n\nLate at night, all the children had gone home.\n\nWeixi sat alone in the classroom, looking at the sky through the window.\n\n\"Tomorrow...\" she said in a low voice, \"will be the last day.\"\n\nShe lowered her head and looked at the bracelet.\n\nThe number on the bracelet flickered quietly in the moonlight.\n\n—Two.\n\n\"Two days...\" Weixi smiled softly, \"just right.\"\n\n\"Just right enough...\" she closed her eyes, \"to say goodbye to everyone properly.\"\n\n\"And...\" she looked up at the sky, \"just right enough... to take one look at the starry sky of this era.\"\n\nThe sky outside the window was full of stars.\n\nWeixi reached out, as if touching those stars.\n\n\"People of the future,\" she said in a low voice, \"please remember...\"\n\n\"Long, long ago, there was a group of children who, so that you could see this starry sky...\"\n\n\"gave everything they could.\"\n\n\"So...\" she smiled softly, \"please, be happy.\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" a voice sounded from the classroom door.\n\nIt was Liu-Liu.\n\n\"Liu-Liu?\" Weixi froze for a moment, \"Why haven't you rested yet?\"\n\n\"Beep beep...\" Liu-Liu jumped onto the windowsill and sat beside her, \"I can't sleep. I'm afraid... that when I wake up, you'll be gone.\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi gently patted Liu-Liu's head, \"I won't leave without a word. I'll... say goodbye to you properly.\"\n\n\"Beep beep...\" Liu-Liu nuzzled her hand, \"Weixi, after you leave... who will 'see' the future for us?\"\n\n\"You can do it yourselves.\" Weixi smiled, \"You've already learned how to protect the future.\"\n\n\"Really?\" Liu-Liu asked.\n\n\"Really.\" Weixi nodded, \"You understand the future better than any 'person from the future.'\"\n\n\"Beep beep...\" Liu-Liu thought for a moment, \"Then... I have a favor to ask you.\"\n\n\"What favor?\"\n\n\"Help me,\" Liu-Liu said, \"help me see... whether the sky of the future is blue.\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi froze for a moment, then smiled softly.\n\n\"Alright.\" she said, \"I will definitely look.\"\n\n\"And,\" Liu-Liu added, \"tell the animals of the future—there was a robot pet named Liu-Liu, who, long, long ago, worked very, very hard to protect their home.\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi said softly, \"I will definitely tell them.\"\n\nUnder the moonlight, a girl and a little pet sat side by side at the window.\n\n\"Liu-Liu,\" Weixi said in a low voice, \"thank you for staying with me all this time.\"\n\n\"Beep beep...\" Liu-Liu nuzzled her, \"Don't mention it. Because... you're my best friend.\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi smiled softly, \"You're mine too.\"\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":7,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第二十三章：奇蹟的告別\n\n最後一天的早晨，孩子們是被一道光驚醒的。\n\n「你們快看窗外！」老巫第一個衝進教室，氣喘吁吁，「天上……天上有一道光！」\n\n「光？」孩子們湧到窗邊，抬頭看去——\n\n天空的盡頭，出現了一道淡淡的、七彩的流光，像是一條溫柔的彩虹，靜靜地垂在雲端。\n\n「這是……」晴晴的臉色，一下子變了，「時空……」\n\n「時空之門要開了。」一個輕輕的聲音，從她身後響起。\n\n是未晞。\n\n她站在教室門口，臉色蒼白，手腕上的手環，正散發著越來越強烈的光芒。\n\n「未晞……」孩子們圍過去，「今天就是……」\n\n「嗯。」未晞微微笑了，「今天，就是我的歸期。」\n\n「孩子們，」教室門口，周嚴主任不知什麼時候來了，手裡捧著一束花，「這個，給你。」\n\n「主任……」未晞愣住了。\n\n「這是我家院子裡種的花。」周嚴主任的語氣，依然平淡，卻帶著微微的顫抖，「我這個人，不會說話。可是……花會說話。」\n\n「主任……」未晞接過那束花，眼眶紅了，「謝謝您。」\n\n「還有，」周嚴主任從口袋裡，掏出那張他珍藏了很久的卡片——園遊會那天，孩子們寫的「寫給未來的一封信」，「這個，本來是要寄給『未來的主任』的。現在……送給你了。」\n\n「主任……」未晞接過卡片。\n\n「跟未來的我，」周嚴主任別過頭，聲音啞啞的，「說一聲……謝謝。」\n\n「嗯！」未晞用力點頭，「我一定會的！」\n\n「還有我！」邱校長端著茶杯，笑瞇瞇地走進教室，「小未晞啊，校長沒什麼好送的……就送你一句話吧。」\n\n「校長請說。」\n\n「不管你在哪裡，」邱校長溫和地說，「鹿陽國小的大門，永遠為你敞開。」\n\n「……」未晞的眼眶，再一次濕了。\n\n「校長……」她深深鞠了一躬，「謝謝您。」\n\n「好啦好啦，」邱校長端著茶杯，揮揮手，「快去做你該做的事吧！別讓天上的門，等太久！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑了，笑著笑著，眼眶又紅了。\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「別這樣，」未晞輕輕說，「我們說好的，要笑著說再見的。」\n\n「……」孩子們努力擠出笑容，卻一個比一個難看。\n\n「未晞，」晴晴走上前，從書包裡，掏出一個厚厚的資料夾，「這些……是我們的『成果』。」\n\n「成果？」未晞接過資料夾，打開——\n\n裡面，是這一年，孩子們所有行動的紀錄。\n\n垃圾分類的統計表。午餐零浪費的紀錄。省電節能的數據。種植樹苗的照片。淨灘的成果。綠色園遊會的帳目。排水溝污染的調查報告。環保局的感謝函……\n\n「這是……」未晞的眼眶，濕了。\n\n「這是我們的『守護地球大作戰』！」阿釁大聲說，「從第一戰到最後一戰，所有的紀錄，都在這裡！」\n\n「我們想讓你知道，」晴晴的聲音，微微顫抖，「你回來做的這一切……沒有白費。」\n\n「我們會繼續的。」林芸芸說，「就算你回去了……我們也會繼續！」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲說，「我們會繼續！」\n\n「……」未晞緊緊抱著那個資料夾，眼淚，一滴一滴地，掉了下來。\n\n「謝謝你們……」她哽咽著，「謝謝你們……讓我知道，我做的一切……都是有價值的。」\n\n「未晞，」阿釁忽然走上前，把手裡的東西，塞進她懷裡，「這個，給你。」\n\n「這是……」未晞低頭一看——\n\n是那本畫著地球的筆記本。阿釁的「未晞觀察紀錄」。\n\n「這本筆記本，」阿釁的聲音啞啞的，「本來是我用來『調查』你的。可是現在……我想把它送給你。」\n\n「送給我？」未晞愣住。\n\n「嗯。」阿釁點頭，「因為……它記錄的，不只是『可疑行為』。它記錄的……」他低下頭，「是我們認識你的，每一天。」\n\n「阿釁……」未晞把筆記本抱在懷裡，眼淚，止不住地流。\n\n「還有我的！」老巫捧著一個保溫盒，「這是我今早做的肉包！熱的！你帶回去吃！」\n\n「帶回去……」未晞接過保溫盒，「可是……肉包會涼……」\n\n「涼了就涼了！」老巫大聲說，「你帶回去，告訴奶奶——這是我老巫做的肉包！」\n\n「嗯！」未晞用力點頭，「我一定會告訴奶奶的！」\n\n「還有我的！」林芸芸遞上一朵鳳凰花，「這是我剛剛，從鳳凰樹上摘的。」\n\n「鳳凰花……」未晞接過那朵火紅的花。\n\n「帶回去，」林芸芸紅著眼眶，「讓未來的世界，也開一朵這樣的花。」\n\n「……」未晞輕輕握著那朵鳳凰花，像是握著整個世界。\n\n「還有我的！」「還有我的！」\n\n孩子們一個接著一個，把禮物塞進未晞懷裡。\n\n「這個給你！」尪伝恺塞來一個笑臉造型的鑰匙圈，「這是我在園遊會抽到的！看到它，就要想到我的笑！」\n\n「還有我！」柯志遠遞來一個 USB 隨身碟，「裡面是我做的『守護地球大作戰』紀錄影片！全部都有！」\n\n「這是……」未晞接過隨身碟。\n\n「你回去以後，」柯志遠說，「就可以看到，我們是怎麼一步步，把排水溝查清楚的！」\n\n「還有！」一個女生遞來一條手織的藍色手環，「這是我用毛線織的！藍色，是海的顏色！」\n\n「還有我！」「還有我！」\n\n孩子們的禮物，堆成了一座小山。\n\n「你們……」未晞看著那些禮物，哭著又笑著，「你們怎麼……怎麼這麼好……」\n\n「因為你對我們好！」阿釁大聲說，「所以我們也要對你好！」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲說，「這是『禮尚往來』！」\n\n「……」未晞低下頭，把那些禮物，一樣一樣地，輕輕放進懷裡。\n\n「我會……」她哽咽著，「一樣一樣地，帶回去。」\n\n「都帶回去！」孩子們說，「一樣都不能少！」\n\n「嗯！」未晞用力點頭，「一樣都不能少！」\n\n一根羽毛。一張卡片。一顆種子。一枚彈珠。一個紅豆餅……\n\n「太多了……太多了……」未晞抱不動了，坐在地上，哭著又笑著，「你們……你們要讓我怎麼帶回去嘛……」\n\n「那就分批帶！」阿釁大聲說，「反正……反正你還要回來的！」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲說，「你還要回來的！」\n\n「……」未晞看著孩子們，眼淚，模糊了視線。\n\n「嗯。」她輕輕說，「我會回來的。」\n\n「我一定會回來的。」\n\n那天下午，孩子們帶著未晞，最後一次，走到了海堤上。\n\n天空的盡頭，那道七彩的流光，越來越亮。\n\n「最後的等待，」未晞坐在海堤上，看著孩子們，「我想……跟大家，說說我這一年，最快樂的事。」\n\n「最快樂的事？」孩子們圍著她坐下。\n\n「嗯。」未晞笑了，「我最快樂的事……是第一次，看見你們笑。」\n\n「第一次？」孩子們愣住。\n\n「我剛轉來的時候，」未晞說，「其實很緊張。我怕……大家會覺得我很奇怪，不願意跟我當朋友。」\n\n「怎麼會！」老巫大聲說，「你一點都不奇怪！」\n\n「對啊！」阿釁說，「你只是……『特別』了一點！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們笑了。\n\n「可是，」未晞輕輕說，「你們不但沒有嫌棄我，還……把我當成了朋友。所以，我最快樂的事……就是認識你們。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「還有，」未晞又說，「第二快樂的事……是看到那根煙囪，停下來。」\n\n「那根煙囪！」孩子們想起那個畫面，都笑了。\n\n「第三快樂的事，」未晞說，「是吃到老巫的肉包。」\n\n「第四快樂的事，是看到鳳凰樹開花。」\n\n「第五快樂的事，是……」\n\n「未晞，」晴晴打斷她，紅著眼眶，「別數了……你越數……我們越……」\n\n「好好好，不數了。」未晞笑了，「那……換你們說？」\n\n「換我們說？」孩子們愣住。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「說說你們最快樂的事。」\n\n「我最快樂的事……」阿釁想了想，「是跟你一起，把王老闆繩之以法！」\n\n「我最快樂的事，」老巫大聲說，「是吃你分我……不對，是你吃我做的肉包！」\n\n「我最快樂的事，」林芸芸小聲說，「是跟你一起種樹。」\n\n「我最快樂的事，」尪伝恺說，「是聽你說『尪伝恺，要一直笑下去』！」\n\n「我最快樂的事……」晴晴看著未晞，「是認識你。」\n\n「……」未晞的眼眶，濕了。\n\n「我也是。」她輕輕說，「認識你們……是我最快樂的事。」\n\n海風，輕輕吹過。\n\n二十六個孩子，和一個來自未來的女孩，坐在海堤上，分享著彼此最快樂的事。\n\n那一刻，連夕陽，都溫柔了。\n\n「時間……快到了。」未晞低頭，看著手環。\n\n手環上的數字，只剩下——一。\n\n「最後一個小時了。」未晞輕輕說。\n\n「一個小時……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「未晞，」晴晴走到她面前，「你……還有什麼話，想對我們說嗎？」\n\n「……」未晞想了想，然後，她笑了。\n\n「我有一句話，想對你們每一個人說。」\n\n她看著晴晴：「晴晴，你是全世界最棒的班長。」\n\n她看著阿釁：「阿釁，你是全世界最棒的點子王。」\n\n她看著老巫：「老巫，你是全世界最溫暖的吃貨。」\n\n她看著林芸芸：「芸芸，你是全世界最勇敢的女孩。」\n\n她看著尪伝恺：「尪伝恺，你是全世界最會笑的男孩。」\n\n她看著柯志遠、看著溜溜、看著……二十六張臉。\n\n「未晞，」趁著大家都在忙著抹眼淚，晴晴悄悄把她拉到一旁，「我有話……想單獨跟你說。」\n\n「晴晴？」未晞看著她。\n\n「我……」晴晴從口袋裡，掏出一個小小的、泛著銀光的東西，「這個，給你。」\n\n「這是……」未晞低頭一看——是一枚小小的、用鋁箔紙折成的齒輪。\n\n「這是我自己做的。」晴晴說，「我媽媽的修理行裡，有很多齒輪。這枚……是我親手折的。」\n\n「齒輪……」未晞接過那枚鋁箔齒輪，指尖微微顫抖。\n\n「你送我們的『齒輪』，」晴晴紅著眼眶，「是『希望』。那我……也送你一枚。」\n\n「這樣，」她深吸一口氣，「你的『希望』，就不會斷了。」\n\n「晴晴……」未晞把鋁箔齒輪握在手心，貼著心口，「謝謝你。」\n\n「還有，」晴晴低下頭，「我以後……每年都會寫一封信給未來的你。你……一定要收到啊。」\n\n「我一定會收到的。」未晞輕輕說，「因為……我會一直在未來，等你們的信。」\n\n「嗯！」晴晴用力點頭，眼淚，終於掉了下來。\n\n「未晞，」阿釁也湊過來，紅著眼眶，「我也有話想說。」\n\n「阿釁……」\n\n「我這個人，」阿釁揉了揉鼻子，「平常最會說話了。可是現在……我好像……說不出來了。」\n\n「那就……不用說。」未晞微微笑了，「我知道你想說什麼。」\n\n「你知道？」阿釁愣住。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「你想說……『未晞，你一定要記得我們』。對嗎？」\n\n「……」阿釁低下頭，聲音啞啞的，「……對。」\n\n「我會記得的。」未晞輕輕說，「永遠，永遠，都會記得。」\n\n「還有……」阿釁又說，「你回去以後……要是有人欺負你……」\n\n「我就說，」未晞笑了，「『我可是被鹿陽國小六年一班保護過的人！』」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」阿釁忍不住笑了，笑了兩聲，又哭了，「對！你可是……我們保護過的人！」\n\n「老巫呢？」未晞看向老巫。\n\n「我……」老巫捧著保溫盒，支支吾吾的，「我……我想說的，都在肉包裡了！」\n\n「肉包裡？」孩子們愣住。\n\n「嗯！」老巫打開保溫盒，「這顆肉包……是我今天早上，一邊哭一邊做的！所以……它是『鹹的』！代表我捨不得你！」\n\n「哈哈哈哈！」孩子們又哭又笑。\n\n「老巫，」未晞輕輕笑了，「這顆肉包……是我這輩子，吃過最『重』的肉包。」\n\n「那你一定要好好吃！」老巫大聲說，「一點都不准剩！」\n\n「嗯！」未晞用力點頭，「一點都不剩！」\n\n「還有，」她最後說，「六年一班的每一個人——你們，都是全世界最棒的小孩。」\n\n「未晞！！」孩子們再也忍不住，哭著湧上前，把未晞團團圍住。\n\n「別哭，」未晞輕輕拍著他們的背，「我們說好的……」\n\n「我們說好的，」孩子們哭著，卻一起說，「要笑著說再見的。」\n\n「對。」未晞笑了，「要笑著說再見。」\n\n黃昏，降臨了。\n\n天空的盡頭，那道七彩的流光，忽然，綻放成一片巨大的、流動的光芒。\n\n光芒的中心，出現了一個溫柔的、圓形的光門。\n\n「時序之門……開啟了。」未晞輕輕說。\n\n「未晞……」孩子們的心，揪成了一團。\n\n「我該走了。」未晞低下頭，聲音輕輕的，「再不走……時空就會錯亂了。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「我會想你們的。」未晞說，「每一天，每一秒，都會。」\n\n「我們也會想你的！」孩子們大聲說。\n\n「那……」未晞深吸一口氣，抬起頭，看著那片光芒，「我走了。」\n\n「等一下！」溜溜忽然從晴晴的書包裡，鑽出來，跳到未晞面前。\n\n「溜溜！」未晞愣住，「你不是……」\n\n「我偷偷跟上來的！」溜溜挺起胸膛，「我必須……親眼送你離開！」\n\n「溜溜……」未晞蹲下來，輕輕摸了摸牠的頭。\n\n「未晞，」溜溜的電子眼裡，閃爍著前所未有的溫柔，「最後一次……聽我說一句話。」\n\n「你說。」\n\n「你是我這輩子……」溜溜頓了頓，「第一個，讓我覺得『不只是一隻機器寵物』的朋友。」\n\n「……」未晞的眼眶，濕了。\n\n「所以，」溜溜伸出小小的爪子，「我們打勾勾！」\n\n「打勾勾？」未晞愣住。\n\n「對！」溜溜說，「約定——未來的天空，一定是藍色的！我們……一定要再見面！」\n\n「……」未晞伸出小指，輕輕勾住溜溜的爪子。\n\n「打勾勾。」她輕輕說，「約定好了。」\n\n「嗶嗶！」溜溜大聲說，「約定好了！」\n\n海堤上，一個女孩，和一群孩子，和一隻小寵物，站在那片流動的光芒前。\n\n「我走了。」未晞深吸一口氣，最後一次，看著那些臉，「謝謝你們……給了我，這麼多美好的回憶。」\n\n「未晞！！」孩子們哭著，齊聲大喊。\n\n「明天見！」未晞大聲喊著，「我們……明天見！」\n\n她轉過身，走進了那片光芒。\n\n光芒，溫柔地，將她包圍。\n\n而在光芒的另一頭——\n\n「奶奶！」一個女孩，推開了門，跑進院子。\n\n「未晞？」奶奶從屋裡走出來，愣住了，「你……你回來了？」\n\n「奶奶！」未晞撲進奶奶懷裡，「我回來了！我回來了！」\n\n「回來就好……回來就好……」奶奶撫摸著她的頭髮，聲音顫抖，「你見到……藍色的海了嗎？」\n\n「見到了！」未晞哭著笑著，「奶奶！我見到藍色的海了！」\n\n「還有綠色的樹、火紅的花、會下雨的冬天、還有一群……全世界最棒的孩子！」\n\n「那……」奶奶的淚水，流了下來，「那個世界……漂亮嗎？」\n\n「漂亮！」未晞大聲說，「比奶奶的相片，還要漂亮一萬倍！」\n\n「……」奶奶笑了，笑得滿臉皺紋。\n\n「那就好。」她輕輕說，「那就好。」\n\n「奶奶，」未晞從懷裡，掏出那張合照，「你看，這就是他們！」\n\n「這是……」奶奶接過照片，看著照片上，二十六張燦爛的笑臉，「好漂亮的孩子們……」\n\n「他們……是全世界最棒的孩子！」未晞說。\n\n「嗯！」奶奶點頭，慈祥地笑了，「奶奶看得出來。」\n\n那天晚上，未晞站在院子裡，抬頭，看著天空。\n\n「明天見，」她低聲說，「六年一班。」\n\n「我會……一直等著你們的信。」\n\n風，輕輕吹過。\n\n未來的天空，在那一天，似乎……比以前藍了一點點。\n\n她轉身，一步一步，往光門走去。\n\n「未晞！」晴晴忽然大喊，「等一下！」\n\n未晞停下腳步。\n\n「我們……」晴晴從口袋裡，掏出那張鳳凰樹下的合照，「這張照片……你帶著！」\n\n「合照……」未晞接過照片，看著照片上，二十六張燦爛的笑臉。\n\n「這樣，」晴晴紅著眼眶，「你回去以後，想看我們的時候……就可以看照片了。」\n\n「……」未晞把照片，小心翼翼地，放進懷裡，貼著心口。\n\n「嗯。」她輕輕說，「我會一直，看著它。」\n\n她繼續，往光門走去。\n\n「未晞！」阿釁又喊，「最後一句話！」\n\n未晞停下腳步，轉過頭。\n\n「我們……」阿釁深吸一口氣，大聲喊，「明天見！」\n\n「明天見！」孩子們跟著大喊，「未晞！明天見！」\n\n「……」未晞站在光門前，看著那二十六張哭著又笑著的臉，眼淚，奪眶而出。\n\n「明天見。」她輕輕說，「六年一班。」\n\n「明天見。」\n\n她轉過身，走進了那片光芒。\n\n光芒，將她的身影，溫柔地包圍。\n\n然後——\n\n「嗡——！」\n\n一道耀眼的白光，瞬間照亮了整片天空！\n\n等孩子們再睜開眼睛的時候——\n\n天空的盡頭，那道七彩的流光，已經消失了。\n\n海堤上，只剩下二十六個孩子，和一個空空的保溫盒。\n\n「未晞……」阿釁喃喃地，「她……走了？」\n\n「走了。」晴晴的聲音，啞啞的，「她回去了。」\n\n「……」孩子們站在海堤上，看著那片恢復平靜的天空。\n\n風，輕輕吹過。\n\n「她說，」林芸芸低聲說，「明天見。」\n\n「對。」晴晴點頭，「明天見。」\n\n「那……」阿釁忽然笑了，笑得眼眶通紅，「那我們就……等著明天見她吧！」\n\n「等著明天見她！」孩子們齊聲大喊。\n\n海風，把二十六個孩子的喊聲，送向了天空。\n\n而在很遠很遠的未來——\n\n一個女孩，輕輕睜開了眼睛。\n\n「我……回來了。」她低聲說。\n\n她低頭，看著懷裡。\n\n那本畫著地球的筆記本。那朵火紅的鳳凰花。那張貼著心口的合照。那個空空的保溫盒。\n\n她微微笑了。\n\n「明天見，」她低聲說，「六年一班。」\n\n「我一定會……再見到你們的。」\n\n（未完待續）","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 23: The Miraculous Farewell\n\nOn the morning of the last day, the children were startled awake by a light.\n\n\"Hurry, look outside the window!\" Old Wu was the first to charge into the classroom, panting, \"In the sky... there's a light in the sky!\"\n\n\"A light?\" The children crowded to the window and looked up—\n\nAt the edge of the sky, a faint, iridescent stream of light had appeared, like a gentle rainbow, hanging quietly among the clouds.\n\n\"This is...\" Qingqing's face changed, \"time...\"\n\n\"The time gate is about to open.\" A soft voice sounded from behind her.\n\nIt was Weixi.\n\nShe stood at the classroom door, her face pale, the bracelet on her wrist radiating increasingly intense light.\n\n\"Weixi...\" The children gathered around, \"today is...\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"Today is my day of return.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"Don't be like this,\" Weixi said softly, \"we agreed... to say goodbye with smiles.\"\n\n\"...\" The children tried to force smiles, but each one looked worse than the last.\n\n\"Children,\" at the classroom door, Dean Zhou had arrived at some point, holding a bouquet of flowers, \"this is for you.\"\n\n\"Dean...\" Weixi froze.\n\n\"These are flowers I grew in my own yard.\" Dean Zhou's tone remained flat, but carried a slight tremor, \"I'm not good with words. But... flowers can speak.\"\n\n\"Dean...\" Weixi took the bouquet, her eyes reddening, \"thank you.\"\n\n\"And,\" Dean Zhou pulled out from his pocket the card he had treasured for so long—the \"Letter to the Future\" the children had written on fair day, \"this was meant to be sent to 'the Dean of the future.' Now... it's for you.\"\n\n\"Dean...\" Weixi took the card.\n\n\"Tell the future me,\" Dean Zhou turned his head away, his voice hoarse, \"thank you.\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" Weixi nodded hard, \"I definitely will!\"\n\n\"And me!\" Principal Qiu walked into the classroom, holding his teacup, smiling, \"Little Weixi, the principal has nothing much to give... so I'll just give you a sentence.\"\n\n\"Please say it, Principal.\"\n\n\"No matter where you are,\" Principal Qiu said warmly, \"the gates of Luyang Elementary will always be open for you.\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi's eyes moistened again.\n\n\"Principal...\" She bowed deeply, \"thank you.\"\n\n\"Alright, alright,\" Principal Qiu held his teacup and waved his hand, \"go do what you need to do! Don't keep the gate in the sky waiting too long!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed, laughing and laughing, their eyes reddening again.\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing stepped forward, pulling a thick folder from her backpack, \"these... are our 'achievements.'\"\n\n\"Achievements?\" Weixi took the folder and opened it—\n\nInside was the record of everything the children had done this year.\n\nThe statistics of trash sorting. The records of zero leftover lunches. The data on saving electricity. The photos of the planted saplings. The results of the beach cleanup. The accounts of the Green Fair. The investigation report on the drainage ditch pollution. The thank-you letter from the environmental protection bureau...\n\n\"This is...\" Weixi's eyes welled up.\n\n\"This is our 'Protect Earth'!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"From the first battle to the last, all the records are here!\"\n\n\"We wanted you to know,\" Qingqing's voice trembled slightly, \"that everything you came back to do... wasn't in vain.\"\n\n\"We'll keep going.\" Lin Yunyun said, \"Even after you go back... we'll keep going!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children said in unison, \"We'll keep going!\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi hugged the folder tightly, and tears fell drop by drop.\n\n\"Thank you...\" she choked, \"thank you... for showing me that everything I did... was worthwhile.\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" A-Xin suddenly stepped forward and pressed what he was holding into her arms, \"this, for you.\"\n\n\"This is...\" Weixi looked down—\n\nIt was the notebook with the Earth drawn on it. A-Xin's \"Weixi Observation Record.\"\n\n\"This notebook,\" A-Xin's voice was hoarse, \"was originally for 'investigating' you. But now... I want to give it to you.\"\n\n\"Give it to me?\" Weixi froze.\n\n\"Mhm.\" A-Xin nodded, \"Because what it records isn't just 'suspicious behavior.' It records...\" he lowered his head, \"every day we knew you.\"\n\n\"A-Xin...\" Weixi hugged the notebook to her chest, tears flowing uncontrollably.\n\n\"And mine!\" Old Wu held out an insulated lunchbox, \"These are pork buns I made this morning! Hot! Take them back to eat!\"\n\n\"Take them back...\" Weixi took the lunchbox, \"but... the pork buns will go cold...\"\n\n\"They can go cold!\" Old Wu said loudly, \"Take them back and tell Grandmother—these are pork buns made by me, Old Wu!\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" Weixi nodded hard, \"I'll definitely tell Grandmother!\"\n\n\"And mine!\" Lin Yunyun held out a phoenix blossom, \"I just picked it from the phoenix tree.\"\n\n\"A phoenix blossom...\" Weixi took that fiery red flower.\n\n\"Take it back,\" Lin Yunyun said with reddened eyes, \"and let the future world bloom a flower like this too.\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi gently held that phoenix blossom, as if holding the entire world.\n\n\"And mine!\" \"And mine!\"\n\nThe children, one after another, pressed gifts into Weixi's arms.\n\n\"This is for you!\" Wang Zhuankai pressed a smiley-face keychain into her hand, \"I won it at the fair! Whenever you see it, think of my smile!\"\n\n\"And me!\" Ke Zhiyuan handed her a USB drive, \"Inside is my 'Protect Earth' documentary video! It's all there!\"\n\n\"This is...\" Weixi took the USB drive.\n\n\"When you go back,\" Ke Zhiyuan said, \"you can see how we tracked down the drainage ditch step by step!\"\n\n\"And!\" A girl handed her a hand-knitted blue bracelet, \"I knitted this with yarn! Blue is the color of the sea!\"\n\n\"And me!\" \"And me!\"\n\nThe children's gifts piled up into a small mountain.\n\n\"You...\" Weixi looked at those gifts, crying and laughing, \"how... how can you be so good...\"\n\n\"Because you're good to us!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"So we have to be good to you!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children said in unison, \"This is 'reciprocity'!\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi lowered her head and gently placed those gifts, one by one, into her arms.\n\n\"I will...\" she choked, \"take them all back, one by one.\"\n\n\"Take them all back!\" The children said, \"Not one can be missing!\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" Weixi nodded hard, \"Not one missing!\"\n\nA feather. A card. A seed. A marble. A red bean cake...\n\n\"Too many... too many...\" Weixi couldn't hold them all, sat down on the ground, crying and laughing, \"you... how am I supposed to take all this back...\"\n\n\"Then take them in batches!\" A-Xin said loudly, \"Anyway... anyway, you're coming back!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children said in unison, \"You're coming back!\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi looked at the children, tears blurring her vision.\n\n\"Mhm.\" she said softly, \"I'll come back.\"\n\n\"I will definitely come back.\"\n\nThat afternoon, the children took Weixi, one last time, to the seawall.\n\nAt the edge of the sky, that iridescent stream of light was growing brighter and brighter.\n\n\"The final wait,\" Weixi sat on the seawall, looking at the children, \"I want to... tell you all, the happiest things about my time here.\"\n\n\"The happiest things?\" The children sat around her.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi smiled, \"The happiest thing... was the first time I saw you all smile.\"\n\n\"The first time?\" The children froze.\n\n\"When I first transferred here,\" Weixi said, \"I was actually very nervous. I was afraid... that everyone would think I was strange and not want to be my friend.\"\n\n\"How could that be!\" Old Wu said loudly, \"You're not strange at all!\"\n\n\"Right!\" A-Xin said, \"You're just... a little 'special'!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed.\n\n\"But,\" Weixi said softly, \"you not only didn't dislike me, you... treated me as a friend. So, the happiest thing for me... was meeting you all.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"And,\" Weixi continued, \"the second happiest thing... was seeing that smokestack stop.\"\n\n\"That smokestack!\" The children remembered that image and all smiled.\n\n\"The third happiest thing,\" Weixi said, \"was eating Old Wu's pork bun.\"\n\n\"The fourth happiest thing was seeing the phoenix tree bloom.\"\n\n\"The fifth happiest thing was...\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing interrupted her, her eyes red, \"stop counting... the more you count... the more we...\"\n\n\"Fine, fine, I'll stop.\" Weixi smiled, \"Then... your turn?\"\n\n\"Our turn?\" The children froze.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"Tell me your happiest things.\"\n\n\"My happiest thing...\" A-Xin thought for a moment, \"was catching Boss Wang with you!\"\n\n\"My happiest thing,\" Old Wu said loudly, \"was sharing... no wait, you eating my pork buns!\"\n\n\"My happiest thing,\" Lin Yunyun said quietly, \"was planting trees with you.\"\n\n\"My happiest thing,\" Wang Zhuankai said, \"was hearing you say 'Wang Zhuankai, keep laughing forever'!\"\n\n\"My happiest thing...\" Qingqing looked at Weixi, \"was meeting you.\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi's eyes moistened.\n\n\"Mine too.\" she said softly, \"Meeting you all... was my happiest thing.\"\n\nThe sea breeze blew gently.\n\nTwenty-six children and a girl from the future sat on the seawall, sharing their happiest things.\n\nAt that moment, even the setting sun seemed gentle.\n\n\"Time... is almost up.\" Weixi lowered her head and looked at the bracelet.\n\nThe number on the bracelet was down to—one.\n\n\"The last hour.\" Weixi said softly.\n\n\"One hour...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"Weixi,\" Qingqing walked in front of her, \"do you... have anything else you want to say to us?\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi thought for a moment, then smiled.\n\n\"I have one sentence for each of you.\"\n\nShe looked at Qingqing: \"Qingqing, you're the best Class President in the world.\"\n\nShe looked at A-Xin: \"A-Xin, you're the best King of Ideas in the world.\"\n\nShe looked at Old Wu: \"Old Wu, you're the warmest foodie in the world.\"\n\nShe looked at Lin Yunyun: \"Yunyun, you're the bravest girl in the world.\"\n\nShe looked at Wang Zhuankai: \"Wang Zhuankai, you're the boy who laughs the most in the world.\"\n\nShe looked at Ke Zhiyuan, at Liu-Liu, at... twenty-six faces.\n\n\"And,\" she said finally, \"every single person in Class 6-1—you are all the most wonderful children in the world.\"\n\n\"Weixi!!\" The children could no longer hold back. Crying, they surged forward and surrounded Weixi.\n\n\"Don't cry,\" Weixi gently patted their backs, \"we agreed...\"\n\n\"We agreed,\" the children said together through their tears, \"to say goodbye with smiles.\"\n\n\"Yes.\" Weixi smiled, \"Say goodbye with smiles.\"\n\n\"Weixi,\" while everyone was busy wiping tears, Qingqing quietly pulled her aside, \"I have something... I want to say to you alone.\"\n\n\"Qingqing?\" Weixi looked at her.\n\n\"I...\" Qingqing pulled a small, silver-glinting object from her pocket, \"this, for you.\"\n\n\"This is...\" Weixi looked down—it was a small gear folded from aluminum foil.\n\n\"I made it myself.\" Qingqing said, \"My mom's repair shop has lots of gears. This one... I folded it with my own hands.\"\n\n\"A gear...\" Weixi took that foil gear, her fingertips trembling slightly.\n\n\"The 'gear' you gave us,\" Qingqing said with reddened eyes, \"is 'hope.' So... I'll give you one too.\"\n\n\"That way,\" she took a deep breath, \"your 'hope' won't break.\"\n\n\"Qingqing...\" Weixi held the foil gear in her palm, pressing it against her heart, \"thank you.\"\n\n\"And,\" Qingqing lowered her head, \"from now on... I'll write a letter to the future you every year. You... you must receive them.\"\n\n\"I will definitely receive them.\" Weixi said softly, \"Because... I'll be waiting for your letters in the future.\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" Qingqing nodded hard, and her tears finally fell.\n\n\"Weixi,\" A-Xin also came over, his eyes red, \"I have something to say too.\"\n\n\"A-Xin...\"\n\n\"I'm usually the best talker,\" A-Xin rubbed his nose, \"but right now... I think... I can't say it.\"\n\n\"Then... don't say it.\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"I know what you want to say.\"\n\n\"You do?\" A-Xin froze.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"You want to say... 'Weixi, you must remember us.' Right?\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin lowered his head, his voice hoarse, \"...Right.\"\n\n\"I'll remember.\" Weixi said softly, \"Forever, forever, I'll remember.\"\n\n\"And...\" A-Xin added, \"after you go back... if anyone bullies you...\"\n\n\"Then I'll say,\" Weixi smiled, \"'I'm someone who was protected by Class 6-1 of Luyang Elementary!'\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" A-Xin couldn't help laughing, laughed twice, then cried again, \"Right! You're... someone we protected!\"\n\n\"What about Old Wu?\" Weixi looked at Old Wu.\n\n\"I...\" Old Wu held the lunchbox, stammering, \"I... everything I want to say is in the pork buns!\"\n\n\"In the pork buns?\" The children froze.\n\n\"Mhm!\" Old Wu opened the lunchbox, \"These pork buns... I made them this morning, crying as I made them! So... they're 'salty'! They represent how much I'll miss you!\"\n\n\"Hahaha!\" The children laughed and cried.\n\n\"Old Wu,\" Weixi smiled softly, \"these pork buns... are the 'heaviest' pork buns I've ever eaten.\"\n\n\"Then you must eat them well!\" Old Wu said loudly, \"Not a single bit left!\"\n\n\"Mhm!\" Weixi nodded hard, \"Not a single bit!\"\n\nDusk descended.\n\nAt the edge of the sky, that iridescent stream of light suddenly bloomed into a vast, flowing radiance.\n\nAt the center of the radiance, a gentle, circular gate of light appeared.\n\n\"The time gate... has opened.\" Weixi said softly.\n\n\"Weixi...\" The children's hearts twisted into a knot.\n\n\"I have to go now.\" Weixi lowered her head, her voice soft, \"If I don't... the timeline will collapse.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"I'll miss you.\" Weixi said, \"Every day, every second, I will.\"\n\n\"We'll miss you too!\" The children said loudly.\n\n\"Then...\" Weixi took a deep breath, looked up at that radiance, \"I'm going now.\"\n\n\"Wait!\" Liu-Liu suddenly popped out of Qingqing's backpack and jumped in front of Weixi.\n\n\"Liu-Liu!\" Weixi froze, \"Aren't you...\"\n\n\"I sneaked along!\" Liu-Liu puffed out its chest, \"I must... watch you leave with my own eyes!\"\n\n\"Liu-Liu...\" Weixi crouched down and gently patted its head.\n\n\"Weixi,\" unprecedented gentleness flickered in Liu-Liu's electronic eyes, \"one last time... let me say something.\"\n\n\"Go ahead.\"\n\n\"You're the first person in my life...\" Liu-Liu paused, \"who made me feel like 'I'm more than just a robot pet.'\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi's eyes moistened.\n\n\"So,\" Liu-Liu extended its tiny paw, \"let's pinky swear!\"\n\n\"Pinky swear?\" Weixi froze.\n\n\"Yes!\" Liu-Liu said, \"A promise—the sky of the future will be blue! And we... will definitely meet again!\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi extended her pinky and gently hooked Liu-Liu's paw.\n\n\"Pinky swear.\" she said softly, \"It's a promise.\"\n\n\"Beep beep!\" Liu-Liu said loudly, \"It's a promise!\"\n\nOn the seawall, a girl, a group of children, and a little pet stood before that flowing radiance.\n\n\"I'm going now.\" Weixi took a deep breath, looking at those faces one last time, \"Thank you... for giving me so many beautiful memories.\"\n\n\"Weixi!!\" The children shouted in unison through their tears.\n\n\"See you tomorrow!\" Weixi shouted loudly, \"We'll... see you tomorrow!\"\n\nShe turned and walked into that radiance.\n\nThe light gently wrapped around her.\n\nAnd on the other side of the light—\n\n\"Grandmother!\" A girl pushed open the door and ran into the yard.\n\n\"Weixi?\" Grandmother came out of the house, frozen, \"You... you're back?\"\n\n\"Grandmother!\" Weixi threw herself into her grandmother's arms, \"I'm back! I'm back!\"\n\n\"It's good you're back... it's good you're back...\" Grandmother stroked her hair, her voice trembling, \"Did you see... the blue sea?\"\n\n\"I saw it!\" Weixi cried and laughed, \"Grandmother! I saw the blue sea!\"\n\n\"And green trees, fiery flowers, winters with rain, and a group of... the most wonderful children in the world!\"\n\n\"Then...\" Grandmother's tears flowed, \"was that world... beautiful?\"\n\n\"Beautiful!\" Weixi said loudly, \"Ten thousand times more beautiful than Grandmother's photograph!\"\n\n\"...\" Grandmother smiled, her face creased with wrinkles.\n\n\"That's good.\" she said softly, \"That's good.\"\n\n\"Grandmother,\" Weixi pulled the group photo from her chest, \"look, this is them!\"\n\n\"This is...\" Grandmother took the photo and looked at the twenty-six radiant faces on it, \"such beautiful children...\"\n\n\"They... are the most wonderful children in the world!\" Weixi said.\n\n\"Mhm!\" Grandmother nodded, smiling kindly, \"Grandmother can tell.\"\n\nThat night, Weixi stood in the yard, looking up at the sky.\n\n\"See you tomorrow,\" she said in a low voice, \"Class 6-1.\"\n\n\"I will... keep waiting for your letters.\"\n\nThe wind blew gently.\n\nThe sky of the future, on that day, seemed... a little bluer than before.\n\nShe turned, step by step, toward the gate of light.\n\n\"Weixi!\" Qingqing suddenly shouted, \"Wait!\"\n\nWeixi stopped.\n\n\"We...\" Qingqing pulled that group photo taken under the phoenix tree from her pocket, \"take this photo with you!\"\n\n\"A group photo...\" Weixi took the photo, looking at the twenty-six radiant smiles in it.\n\n\"That way,\" Qingqing said with reddened eyes, \"after you go back, whenever you want to see us... you can look at the photo.\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi carefully placed the photo into her chest, against her heart.\n\n\"Mhm.\" she said softly, \"I'll keep looking at it.\"\n\nShe continued walking toward the gate of light.\n\n\"Weixi!\" A-Xin shouted again, \"One last sentence!\"\n\nWeixi stopped and turned around.\n\n\"We...\" A-Xin took a deep breath and shouted, \"See you tomorrow!\"\n\n\"See you tomorrow!\" The children shouted along, \"Weixi! See you tomorrow!\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi stood before the gate of light, looking at those twenty-six crying-yet-smiling faces, tears streaming down.\n\n\"See you tomorrow.\" she said softly, \"Class 6-1.\"\n\n\"See you tomorrow.\"\n\nShe turned and walked into that radiance.\n\nThe light gently wrapped around her figure.\n\nThen—\n\n\"Woom—!\"\n\nA dazzling white light instantly illuminated the entire sky!\n\nWhen the children opened their eyes again—\n\nThe iridescent stream at the edge of the sky had vanished.\n\nOn the seawall, only twenty-six children remained, and an empty lunchbox.\n\n\"Weixi...\" A-Xin murmured, \"she... she's gone?\"\n\n\"She's gone.\" Qingqing's voice was hoarse, \"She's gone back.\"\n\n\"...\" The children stood on the seawall, looking at that sky that had returned to calm.\n\nThe wind blew gently.\n\n\"She said,\" Lin Yunyun said in a low voice, \"see you tomorrow.\"\n\n\"Right.\" Qingqing nodded, \"See you tomorrow.\"\n\n\"Then...\" A-Xin suddenly smiled, smiling until his eyes were red, \"then we'll... wait to see her tomorrow!\"\n\n\"Wait to see her tomorrow!\" The children shouted in unison.\n\nThe sea wind carried the cries of twenty-six children toward the sky.\n\nAnd in the far, far future—\n\nA girl gently opened her eyes.\n\n\"I... I'm back.\" she said in a low voice.\n\nShe looked down at her chest.\n\nThe notebook with the Earth drawn on it. The fiery red phoenix blossom. The group photo pressed against her heart. The empty lunchbox.\n\nShe smiled softly.\n\n\"See you tomorrow,\" she said in a low voice, \"Class 6-1.\"\n\n\"I will... definitely see you all again.\"\n\n(To be continued)"},{"id":8,"rawContent":"# 《來自未來的轉學生》\n\n## 第二十四章：明天見，未晞！\n\n未晞回到未來的那一天，未來的地球，正在悄悄改變。\n\n天空，好像……藍了一點。\n\n海，好像……清了一點。\n\n學校裡，孩子們抬頭看天，好奇地問老師：「老師，今天的天空，是不是跟昨天不太一樣？」\n\n老師抬頭，看了看天空，笑了：「好像是呢。」\n\n「為什麼呀？」\n\n「也許……」老師想了想，「也許是有人，在很久很久以前，替我們把天空，擦乾淨了吧。」\n\n而回到未來的未晞，正站在院子裡，看著那片比昨天藍了一點的天空。\n\n「奶奶，」她輕輕說，「你看，天空……好像變藍了。」\n\n「是啊。」奶奶端著一碗水，也抬頭看天，「今天的天空，確實比昨天乾淨。」\n\n「奶奶，」未晞轉過頭，眼眶微微泛紅，「我做到了。」\n\n「做到什麼？」\n\n「讓未來……」未晞笑了，「變好一點點。」\n\n「……」奶奶看著她，輕輕地，摸了摸她的頭。\n\n「那就好。」奶奶說，「那就好。」\n\n日子，一天一天地過去。\n\n未晞回到了她的學校，繼續上學。\n\n她的書包裡，裝著那本畫著地球的筆記本、那朵火紅的鳳凰花（已經做成了書籤）、那張貼著心口的合照、還有那枚鋁箔齒輪。\n\n她每天都把它們帶在身上。\n\n「未晞，你書包裡裝的都是什麼呀？」同桌的同學好奇地問。\n\n「是……」未晞微微笑了，「是『來自過去的寶物』。」\n\n「過去的寶物？」同桌歪著頭，「那是什麼？」\n\n「是……」未晞想了想，「一群孩子，給我的勇氣。」\n\n「勇氣？」同桌聽不懂，但看到未晞笑得很開心，也跟著笑了。\n\n未晞回到未來的學校，和她記憶中的，不太一樣了。\n\n「未晞，早！」「早！」同學們熱情地跟她打招呼。\n\n「今天的天氣真好！」有人說，「天空好藍！」\n\n「嗯。」未晞看著天空，微微笑了，「藍得……剛剛好。」\n\n「未晞，你看！」同桌指著操場邊，「那邊的樹，發芽了！」\n\n「真的？」未晞走過去，蹲下來，看著那棵從乾裂的土壤裡冒出來的小樹苗。\n\n「這是……」她輕輕撫摸著樹苗的葉子，眼眶，忽然濕了。\n\n「未晞？」同桌嚇了一跳，「你怎麼了？」\n\n「沒有。」未晞搖搖頭，笑了，「我只是……想起了我的『樹』。」\n\n「你的樹？」同桌好奇地問，「你有種樹嗎？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「在一個很遠很遠的地方，有一群孩子，替我種了很多樹。」\n\n「很遠的地方？」同桌歪著頭，「比這裡還遠嗎？」\n\n「嗯。」未晞輕輕說，「比這裡，遠……四十年。」\n\n「四十年？！」同桌瞪大眼睛，「那你怎麼回去看它們？」\n\n「……」未晞沉默了一下，然後，輕輕笑了。\n\n「我用『心』看它們。」她說。\n\n「心？」同桌聽不懂。\n\n「嗯。」未晞點頭，「只要我記得它們……它們就會一直，在我的心裡長大。」\n\n「……」同桌似懂非懂地點頭。\n\n「未晞，」他又問，「你說的那個地方……叫什麼名字啊？」\n\n「那裡的學校，叫『鹿陽國小』。」未晞說。\n\n「鹿陽國小……」同桌重複著，「聽起來，是個很溫暖的地方。」\n\n「嗯。」未晞笑了，「那是……全世界最溫暖的地方。」\n\n一個月後，發生了一件，讓未晞整晚睡不著的事。\n\n那天，未晞的奶奶，從老舊的郵筒裡，取出一封信。\n\n「未晞，」奶奶喊她，「有你的信。」\n\n「我的信？」未晞愣住，「誰會寫信給我？」\n\n她接過信，看著信封上的字跡，愣住了。\n\n信封上寫著：\n\n「給未來的未晞：你好！我是阿釁！……」\n\n「這是……」未晞的手，微微顫抖。\n\n她顫抖著，拆開信封。\n\n信紙上，歪歪扭扭地，寫著：\n\n「給未晞：\n你好！我是阿釁！\n你說過，寫給未來的信，會收到回信。\n所以我寫了這封信，寄給未來的你！\n我跟你說喔——我們班現在每天都有好好分類垃圾！\n我的『小藍』樹，長得比我還高了！\n還有，學校後面的海，真的是藍色的！\n對了，我偷偷告訴你——晴晴說，她以後要當環保局的局長！\n老巫說，他要開一家『拯救地球肉包店』！\n我們都很好！\n你……也要好好的喔！\n──阿釁」\n\n「阿釁……」未晞讀著信，眼淚，一滴一滴地，掉了下來。\n\n「他真的……」她哽咽著，「真的寫信給我了……」\n\n一個星期後，未晞又收到了一封信。\n\n「給未晞：你好！我是晴晴！……」\n\n「晴晴……」未晞讀著信，眼眶又紅了。\n\n信上寫著：\n\n「給未晞：\n我是晴晴！\n我跟你說——我們班的『守護地球大作戰』，變成全校的傳統了！\n還有，學校後面的海，真的、真的、真的，是藍色的！\n我每天都去看它。\n還有，我跟我爸爸說好了，以後我要考環保局！我要當局長！\n然後，我要讓全台灣的海，都變成藍色的！\n我會記得，你教我的每一件事。\n──晴晴」\n\n「晴晴……」未晞把信貼在胸口，「你一定會成為，最好的局長。」\n\n又過了一個月，第三封信來了。\n\n「給未晞：你好！我是老巫！……」\n\n「老巫……」未晞讀著，忍不住笑了。\n\n信上寫著：\n\n「給未晞：\n我是老巫！\n我的『拯救地球肉包店』，開張了！\n客人問我：『為什麼你的肉包特別好吃？』\n我跟他們說：『因為這裡面，加了一味獨家配方——叫「對未來的愛」！』\n客人說我講話很奇怪，可是……我不管！反正我的肉包，就是加了！\n對了，我把你的照片，貼在店裡了！客人問我那是誰，我就說——『那是我最棒的朋友！』\n──老巫」\n\n「老巫……」未晞又哭又笑，「你的肉包……一定很好吃。」\n\n再後來，是林芸芸的信。\n\n「給未晞：你好！我是芸芸！我現在，是學校『植樹小組』的組長了！我帶著學弟學妹，種了好多好多樹！我常常想，你回來的時候……一定要帶你去看我們種的樹！──芸芸」\n\n還有尪伝恺的信：「未晞！我現在是『笑話社』的社長！我把你教我的『要一直笑下去』，傳給了每一屆的學弟學妹！──尪伝恺」\n\n還有柯志遠的信：「未晞！我開始寫程式了！我要寫一個『守護地球』的APP，讓全世界的人都下載！──柯志遠」\n\n一封，又一封。\n\n「……」未晞把那些信，一封一封地，收進一個木盒子裡。\n\n「這是……」她輕輕撫摸著木盒子，「我這輩子，最珍貴的寶物。」\n\n「比那些時空裝置……」她低下頭，「還要珍貴一千倍、一萬倍。」\n\n那天晚上，未晞把那封信，貼著心口，睡了一整晚。\n\n第二天，未晞做了一件，讓全家人都嚇一跳的事。\n\n她決定——「回信」。\n\n「未晞，你要回信給誰？」奶奶問。\n\n「給……」未晞說，「給我一個很重要的朋友。」\n\n她在信紙上，一字一句地寫著：\n\n「給最好的點子王——阿釁：\n我收到你的信了！\n謝謝你，告訴我這些好消息。\n我也有好消息要告訴你——這裡的天空，也開始變藍了。\n我每天都會抬頭看天，想著你說的『一定會變得更藍』。\n請你繼續寫信給我，好嗎？\n我會一直，一直，等你們的信。\n──未晞」\n\n「這樣……」未晞寫完，輕輕地把信紙折好，「寄得回去嗎？」\n\n「……」她想了想，笑了，「一定寄得回去的。因為……」\n\n「『寫給未來』的信，是會收到回信的。」\n\n「然後……」她低下頭，「『來自未來的回信』……也一定會，寄到他們手上。」\n\n「可是，未晞，」奶奶擔心地問，「你確定……這封信，寄得回去嗎？」\n\n「……」未晞沉默了一下。\n\n「我不知道。」她輕輕說，「可是……我相信，它一定寄得到。」\n\n「為什麼？」\n\n「因為……」未晞笑了，「『希望』，是會自己找路的。」\n\n那天傍晚，未晞把信，投進了那個老舊的郵筒。\n\n「叮咚。」\n\n信，落進了郵筒裡。\n\n「……」未晞站在郵筒前，輕輕地，摸了摸郵筒。\n\n「拜託了，」她低聲說，「把我的『明天見』……帶給他們。」\n\n而在另一個時代——\n\n「啊！」鹿陽國小，阿釁忽然從椅子上跳起來，「我的桌上……怎麼有一封信？！」\n\n「信？」孩子們圍過來，「誰寫的？」\n\n「信封上寫著……」阿釁瞪大眼睛，「『給最好的點子王——阿釁』？！」\n\n「這是……」晴晴的聲音，微微顫抖，「這筆跡……」\n\n「是未晞！」阿釁大喊，「這是未晞寫的！」\n\n「什麼？！」孩子們驚呼。\n\n阿釁顫抖著，拆開信封。\n\n信紙上，是未晞那娟秀的字跡：\n\n「給最好的點子王——阿釁：\n我收到你的信了！\n謝謝你，告訴我這些好消息。\n我也有好消息要告訴你——這裡的天空，也開始變藍了。\n我每天都會抬頭看天，想著你說的『一定會變得更藍』。\n請你繼續寫信給我，好嗎？\n我會一直，一直，等你們的信。\n──未晞」\n\n「……」阿釁讀完信，眼眶，濕了。\n\n「她收到信了……」阿釁哽咽著，「她收到我們的信了！」\n\n「而且……」晴晴的眼眶，也紅了，「她還回信了！」\n\n「『寫給未來』的信，會收到回信……」林芸芸喃喃地重複著，「原來……是真的！」\n\n「那……」老巫大聲問，「我們以後，可以一直寫信給她了？！」\n\n「可以！」孩子們齊聲大喊，「我們要一直寫！」\n\n「那……」阿釁舉起那封信，大聲宣布，「以後每年的鳳凰花開，我們都要寫一封信，給未來的未晞！」\n\n「好——！」孩子們齊聲回應。\n\n「還有，」晴晴補充，「我們也要約定——把信上寫的事情，一件一件，都做到！」\n\n「對！」孩子們齊聲說，「寫到，就做到！」\n\n「寫到，就做到……」阿釁重複著這五個字，然後，他看著那封信，輕輕笑了。\n\n「未晞，」他低聲說，「你放心。我們寫的每一封信……都會做到的。」\n\n「因為……」他抬起頭，「我們可是……『守護地球作戰部隊』！」\n\n「好——！」\n\n那一年，鳳凰樹又開了花。\n\n那一年，孩子們，寄出了第二封信。\n\n信上寫著：「未晞！我們把『寫到，就做到』，變成我們的約定了！──阿釁」\n\n第三封信：「未晞！我今天，撿了一百顆寶特瓶！──阿釁」\n\n第四封信：「未晞！學校後面的海，今天還是藍色的！──晴晴」\n\n第五封信：「未晞！我的肉包店，開分店了！──老巫」\n\n第六封信……\n\n一封，又一封。\n\n時間，繼續往前。\n\n而「明天見」這三個字，成為了鹿陽國小，一代一代傳下去的，最溫柔的約定。\n\n她不知道的是——\n\n在另一個時代，鹿陽國小的教室裡，阿釁正趴在桌上，盯著桌上的筆記本發呆。\n\n「阿釁，你在想什麼？」晴晴走過來問。\n\n「我在想……」阿釁說，「未晞現在，不知道過得好不好。」\n\n「她一定過得很好。」晴晴說，「因為她說過的，未來，會變好的。」\n\n「嗯。」阿釁點頭，「她說的，一定沒錯。」\n\n「對了，」晴晴忽然問，「你昨天……寫了一封信？」\n\n「嗯。」阿釁點頭，「我寫給未晞了。可是……」他低下頭，「我連她的地址都不知道……」\n\n「沒關係。」晴晴笑了，「『寫給未來』的信，是不用地址的。」\n\n「真的嗎？」阿釁問。\n\n「真的。」晴晴點頭，「因為園遊會那天，我們寫的信……一定都寄到了。」\n\n「……」阿釁看著窗外那片藍色的天空，輕輕笑了。\n\n「未晞，」他低聲說，「你一定要收到啊。」\n\n時間，悄悄地，過去了。\n\n一年。兩年。三年。\n\n六年，說長不長，說短不短。\n\n足夠一棵樹苗，長成小樹。\n\n足夠一片海，恢復清澈。\n\n也足夠一群孩子，長大成人。\n\n阿釁，成了環保社團的社長。他帶著一群學弟學妹，每個月，都去淨灘。\n\n「社長，」學弟問，「你為什麼這麼喜歡淨灘啊？」\n\n「因為……」阿釁笑了，「我答應過一個人，要把海邊的垃圾，都撿光光。」\n\n「一個人？誰啊？」\n\n「一個……」阿釁看著海，「來自未來的姊姊。」\n\n晴晴，考上了環保相關的科系。她每天，都在研究如何讓水變乾淨。\n\n「晴晴，」教授看著她的論文，「你為什麼想研究水質？」\n\n「因為……」晴晴笑了，「我答應過一個人，要讓海，一直保持藍色。」\n\n老巫的「拯救地球肉包店」，越來越有名。他把賺到的錢，一部分拿去種樹。\n\n「老闆，」顧客問，「你為什麼要種樹啊？」\n\n「因為……」老巫一邊揉麵團，一邊說，「我答應過一個人，要讓這個世界，多一點綠色。」\n\n林芸芸，成了小學老師。她帶著一群小朋友，在校園裡種樹。\n\n「老師，」小朋友問，「為什麼要種樹啊？」\n\n「因為……」林芸芸笑了，「有一個很重要的姊姊告訴過我——『樹，是會留下來的。』」\n\n尪伝恺，成了喜劇演員。他每次上台，第一句話都是：「我答應過一個人，要一直笑下去！」\n\n「那個人……」他在台上，對著觀眾說，「是我這輩子，最重要的朋友！」\n\n孩子們，各自長大了。\n\n可是，無論他們走到哪裡，都記得同一個約定——\n\n「明天見。」\n\n鹿陽國小的鳳凰樹，又開了六次花。\n\n「守護地球大作戰」，變成了一年級到六年級，人人都知道的傳統。\n\n「聽說，在很久以前，」一年級的小朋友，聽著學長姊講故事，「我們學校，來過一位『來自未來的姊姊』！」\n\n「來自未來？！」\n\n「對！她教了那時候的學長姊，好多保護地球的方法！」\n\n「真的假的？！」\n\n「真的！你看！」學長姊指著學校後面的樹林，「那些樹，就是那時候種的！現在都長成大樹了！」\n\n「哇……」\n\n「還有，」學長姊神秘兮兮地說，「學校的『守護地球大作戰』，也是那時候開始的！我們現在做的每一件事，都是從那時候傳下來的！」\n\n「那……那位『未來的姊姊』，現在在哪裡？」\n\n「她……」學長姊看著天空，「她回未來去了。可是……她說過，她會回來的！」\n\n「回來？」\n\n「對！她說過——『明天見』！」\n\n「明天見……」\n\n孩子們抬頭，看著天空。\n\n天空，藍藍的。\n\n六年後，鹿陽國小，畢業典禮。\n\n「今天，我們要表揚一群特別的畢業生！」邱校長端著茶杯，站在台上，笑瞇瞇的，「他們在六年級的時候，發起了『守護地球大作戰』！」\n\n「喔——！」台下響起掌聲。\n\n「這群孩子，」邱校長說，「用他們的雙手，讓學校後面的海，恢復了乾淨！用他們的努力，讓『守護地球』，成為了我們學校的傳統！」\n\n「還有，」邱校長繼續說，「他們的故事，已經被寫成了書，讓更多人知道！」\n\n「寫成書？！」台下的孩子們，瞪大了眼睛。\n\n「對！」邱校長拿出厚厚一本書，「這本書，叫做《來自未來的轉學生》！寫的就是他們的故事！」\n\n「哇——！」\n\n「不過，」邱校長神秘兮兮地，「書的最後一頁，是空白的。」\n\n「空白的？」孩子們疑惑。\n\n「因為，」邱校長說，「這個故事，還沒有結束。那位『來自未來的轉學生』，還沒有回來。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「可是，」邱校長笑了，「我們會等她。因為……她說過——」\n\n「『明天見』。」\n\n「明天見……」孩子們重複著這三個字。\n\n畢業典禮結束後，當年六年一班的「孩子們」，站在校門口，看著那棵鳳凰樹。\n\n「時間過得好快，」阿釁感慨著，「一晃，就六年了。」\n\n「是啊。」晴晴點頭，「我們都長大了。」\n\n「我昨天回去看了看那片海，」老巫說，「還是那麼藍！」\n\n「我的『小藍』，已經長得比學校的圍牆還高了！」阿釁得意地說。\n\n「我的『吃飽飽』也是！」尪伝恺跟著說。\n\n「對了，」林芸芸忽然問，「你們……還記得她嗎？」\n\n「記得。」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n「怎麼可能忘記。」晴晴輕輕說。\n\n「那……」林芸芸低下頭，「她……真的會回來嗎？」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「對了，」阿釁忽然想起什麼，「你們還記得嗎？園遊會那天，我們寫的那些『寫給未來的信』……」\n\n「記得。」晴晴點頭，「我們寫了，要讓未來的地球，有乾淨的海。」\n\n「那……」阿釁說，「我們的信……應該寄到了吧？」\n\n「應該寄到了。」晴晴輕輕說，「因為……她說過，『寫給未來』的信，是會收到回信的。」\n\n「……」孩子們沉默了。\n\n「可是……」林芸芸低下頭，「我們從來沒有收到過她的回信……」\n\n「……」風，輕輕吹過。\n\n「沒關係。」阿釁笑了，「沒收到回信，不代表她沒收到信。」\n\n「對。」晴晴點頭，「只要信寄到了……她一定，會讀到的。」\n\n「那……」林芸芸抬起頭，「她讀到信的時候……會想起我們嗎？」\n\n「會。」孩子們齊聲說。\n\n「一定會。」\n\n「因為……」阿釁看著天空，「她說過——」\n\n「『明天見』。」\n\n「明天見……」孩子們低聲重複著。\n\n「所以，」阿釁大聲說，「明天，她一定會回來的！」\n\n「明天見！」孩子們齊聲大喊，「未晞！明天見！」\n\n海風，輕輕吹過。\n\n而在很遠很遠的未來——\n\n一個女孩，正坐在院子裡，讀著一封剛剛收到的信。\n\n「給未晞：你好！我是阿釁！今天，鹿陽國小的鳳凰樹，又開花了！……」\n\n她讀著信，嘴角，微微上揚。\n\n然後，她放下信，抬起頭，看著天空。\n\n「明天見，」她低聲說，「六年一班。」\n\n「……」她微微笑了，「我一定會，再見到你們的。」\n\n「因為……」她輕輕地，把手放在胸口，感受著那張照片的溫度，「你們一直在我的心裡。」\n\n風，輕輕吹過。\n\n未來的天空，藍藍的。\n\n過去與未來，在這一刻，彷彿，連結在了一起。\n\n「明天見。」\n\n全書完","rawContentEn":"# The Transfer Student from the Future\n\n## Chapter 24: See You Tomorrow, Weixi!\n\nOn the day Weixi returned to the future, the Earth of the future was quietly changing.\n\nThe sky seemed... a little bluer.\n\nThe sea seemed... a little cleaner.\n\nAt school, the children looked up at the sky and asked their teacher curiously: \"Teacher, doesn't the sky today look a little different from yesterday?\"\n\nThe teacher looked up at the sky and smiled: \"It does seem that way.\"\n\n\"Why?\"\n\n\"Maybe...\" the teacher thought for a moment, \"maybe someone, long, long ago, wiped the sky clean for us.\"\n\nAnd Weixi, who had returned to the future, was standing in the yard, looking at that sky which was a little bluer than yesterday.\n\n\"Grandmother,\" she said softly, \"look, the sky... seems to have turned blue.\"\n\n\"Yes.\" Grandmother, holding a bowl of water, also looked up at the sky, \"Today's sky is indeed cleaner than yesterday's.\"\n\n\"Grandmother,\" Weixi turned around, her eyes reddening slightly, \"I did it.\"\n\n\"Did what?\"\n\n\"Made the future...\" Weixi smiled, \"a little bit better.\"\n\n\"...\" Grandmother looked at her and gently patted her head.\n\n\"That's good.\" Grandmother said, \"That's good.\"\n\nDays passed, one after another.\n\nWeixi returned to her school and continued her studies.\n\nIn her backpack were that notebook with the Earth drawn on it, that fiery red phoenix blossom (now made into a bookmark), that group photo pressed against her heart, and that aluminum foil gear.\n\nShe carried them with her every day.\n\n\"Weixi, what are all the things in your backpack?\" Her deskmate asked curiously.\n\n\"They are...\" Weixi smiled faintly, \"'treasures from the past.'\"\n\n\"Treasures from the past?\" Her deskmate tilted his head, \"What's that?\"\n\n\"They are...\" Weixi thought for a moment, \"the courage a group of children gave me.\"\n\n\"Courage?\" Her deskmate didn't understand, but seeing Weixi smile so happily, he smiled too.\n\nThe school Weixi returned to was a little different from the one in her memories.\n\n\"Weixi, morning!\" \"Morning!\" The classmates greeted her warmly.\n\n\"The weather is so nice today!\" Someone said, \"The sky is so blue!\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi looked at the sky and smiled faintly, \"Blue... just right.\"\n\n\"Weixi, look!\" Her deskmate pointed at the edge of the playground, \"The tree over there is sprouting!\"\n\n\"Really?\" Weixi walked over, crouched down, and looked at that little sapling sprouting from the cracked, dry soil.\n\n\"This is...\" She gently touched the sapling's leaves, and her eyes suddenly welled up.\n\n\"Weixi?\" Her deskmate was startled, \"What's wrong?\"\n\n\"Nothing.\" Weixi shook her head and smiled, \"I just... remembered my 'trees.'\"\n\n\"Your trees?\" Her deskmate asked curiously, \"You've planted trees?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"In a very, very faraway place, a group of children planted many trees for me.\"\n\n\"A faraway place?\" Her deskmate tilted his head, \"Farther than here?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi said softly, \"Farther than here... forty years.\"\n\n\"Forty years?!\" Her deskmate's eyes went wide, \"Then how do you go back to see them?\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi was silent for a moment, then smiled softly.\n\n\"I see them with my 'heart.'\" she said.\n\n\"Heart?\" Her deskmate didn't understand.\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi nodded, \"As long as I remember them... they'll keep growing in my heart.\"\n\n\"...\" Her deskmate nodded, half understanding.\n\n\"Weixi,\" he asked again, \"what's the name of that place you talked about?\"\n\n\"The school there is called 'Luyang Elementary.'\" Weixi said.\n\n\"Luyang Elementary...\" Her deskmate repeated, \"It sounds like a very warm place.\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" Weixi smiled, \"It's... the warmest place in the whole world.\"\n\nA month later, something happened that made Weixi unable to sleep all night.\n\nThat day, Weixi's grandmother took a letter out of the old mailbox.\n\n\"Weixi,\" Grandmother called her, \"there's a letter for you.\"\n\n\"A letter for me?\" Weixi froze, \"Who would write to me?\"\n\nShe took the letter and froze when she saw the handwriting on the envelope.\n\nOn the envelope was written:\n\n\"To the future Weixi: Hello! I'm A-Xin! ...\"\n\n\"This is...\" Weixi's hand trembled slightly.\n\nTrembling, she tore open the envelope.\n\nOn the letter paper, in crooked handwriting, was written:\n\n\"To Weixi:\nHello! I'm A-Xin!\nYou said that letters to the future would get replies.\nSo I wrote this letter, sent to the future you!\nLet me tell you—our class sorts trash properly every day now!\nMy 'Little Blue' tree is taller than me now!\nAlso, the sea behind the school really is blue!\nOh, and I'll secretly tell you—Qingqing says she's going to be the director of the environmental protection bureau in the future!\nOld Wu says he's going to open a 'Earth-Saving Pork Bun Shop'!\nWe're all doing well!\nYou... take care of yourself too!\n—A-Xin\"\n\n\"A-Xin...\" Weixi read the letter, and tears fell drop by drop.\n\n\"He really...\" she choked, \"really wrote to me...\"\n\nA week later, Weixi received another letter.\n\n\"To Weixi: Hello! I'm Qingqing! ...\"\n\n\"Qingqing...\" Weixi read the letter, her eyes reddening again.\n\nOn the letter paper was written:\n\n\"To Weixi:\nI'm Qingqing!\nLet me tell you—our class's 'Protect Earth' has become a schoolwide tradition!\nAlso, the sea behind the school is really, really, really blue!\nI look at it every day.\nAlso, I've told my dad—in the future I'm going to take the exam for the environmental protection bureau! I'm going to be the director!\nAnd then, I'm going to make the seas of all Taiwan blue!\nI'll remember everything you taught me.\n—Qingqing\"\n\n\"Qingqing...\" Weixi pressed the letter against her chest, \"You'll definitely become the best director.\"\n\nAnother month passed, and the third letter arrived.\n\n\"To Weixi: Hello! I'm Old Wu! ...\"\n\n\"Old Wu...\" Weixi read it and couldn't help smiling.\n\nOn the letter paper was written:\n\n\"To Weixi:\nI'm Old Wu!\nMy 'Earth-Saving Pork Bun Shop' has opened!\nA customer asked me: 'Why are your pork buns especially delicious?'\nI told them: 'Because they contain a secret recipe—called \"love for the future\"!'\nThe customer said I talk strangely, but... I don't care! My pork buns have it anyway!\nOh, and I've put your photo up in the shop! When customers ask who you are, I say—'That's my best friend!'\n—Old Wu\"\n\n\"Old Wu...\" Weixi laughed and cried, \"Your pork buns... must be delicious.\"\n\nAnd then, there was Lin Yunyun's letter.\n\n\"To Weixi: Hello! I'm Yunyun! I'm now the leader of the school's 'Tree Planting Group'! I've planted so many trees with my younger schoolmates! I often think—when you come back... I must take you to see the trees we planted!—Yunyun\"\n\nAnd Wang Zhuankai's letter: \"Weixi! I'm now the president of the 'Joke Club'! I've passed on the 'keep laughing forever' you taught me to every generation of younger students!—Wang Zhuankai\"\n\nAnd Ke Zhiyuan's letter: \"Weixi! I've started programming! I'm going to make a 'Protect Earth' app for people all over the world to download!—Ke Zhiyuan\"\n\nLetter after letter.\n\n\"...\" Weixi put those letters, one by one, into a wooden box.\n\n\"This is...\" she gently stroked the wooden box, \"the most precious treasure of my life.\"\n\n\"Even more precious than those time devices...\" she lowered her head, \"a thousand times, ten thousand times more precious.\"\n\nThat night, Weixi held that letter against her heart and slept the whole night.\n\nThe next day, Weixi did something that startled the whole family.\n\nShe decided to—\"write back.\"\n\n\"Weixi, who are you writing back to?\" Grandmother asked.\n\n\"To...\" Weixi said, \"to a very important friend of mine.\"\n\nOn the letter paper, she wrote, word by word:\n\n\"To the best King of Ideas—A-Xin:\nI received your letter!\nThank you for telling me all that good news.\nI have good news to tell you too—the sky here has started to turn blue as well.\nI look up at the sky every day, thinking about what you said—'It will definitely get bluer.'\nPlease keep writing to me, okay?\nI will wait, and wait, for your letters.\n—Weixi\"\n\n\"Like this...\" Weixi finished writing and gently folded the letter paper, \"will it get delivered?\"\n\n\"...\" She thought for a moment, then smiled, \"It will definitely get delivered. Because...\"\n\n\"'Letters to the future' do get replies.\"\n\n\"And then...\" she lowered her head, \"'replies from the future'... will definitely reach their hands too.\"\n\n\"But, Weixi,\" Grandmother asked worriedly, \"are you sure... this letter can be sent back?\"\n\n\"...\" Weixi was silent for a moment.\n\n\"I don't know.\" she said softly, \"But... I believe it will get delivered.\"\n\n\"Why?\"\n\n\"Because...\" Weixi smiled, \"'hope' finds its own way.\"\n\nThat evening, Weixi dropped the letter into that old mailbox.\n\n\"Ding-dong.\"\n\nThe letter fell into the mailbox.\n\n\"...\" Weixi stood before the mailbox and gently stroked it.\n\n\"Please,\" she said in a low voice, \"carry my 'see you tomorrow'... to them.\"\n\nAnd in another era—\n\n\"Ah!\" At Luyang Elementary, A-Xin suddenly jumped up from his chair, \"There's... a letter on my desk?!\"\n\n\"A letter?\" The children gathered around, \"Who wrote it?\"\n\n\"The envelope says...\" A-Xin's eyes went wide, \"'To the best King of Ideas—A-Xin'?!\"\n\n\"This is...\" Qingqing's voice trembled slightly, \"this handwriting...\"\n\n\"It's Weixi!\" A-Xin shouted, \"This is Weixi's handwriting!\"\n\n\"What?!\" The children gasped.\n\nTrembling, A-Xin tore open the envelope.\n\nOn the letter paper was Weixi's elegant handwriting:\n\n\"To the best King of Ideas—A-Xin:\nI received your letter!\nThank you for telling me all that good news.\nI have good news to tell you too—the sky here has started to turn blue as well.\nI look up at the sky every day, thinking about what you said—'It will definitely get bluer.'\nPlease keep writing to me, okay?\nI will wait, and wait, for your letters.\n—Weixi\"\n\n\"...\" After reading the letter, A-Xin's eyes moistened.\n\n\"She received the letter...\" A-Xin choked, \"she received our letter!\"\n\n\"And...\" Qingqing's eyes reddened too, \"she even wrote back!\"\n\n\"'Letters to the future' do get replies...\" Lin Yunyun murmured in repetition, \"So... it's true!\"\n\n\"Then...\" Old Wu asked loudly, \"can we keep writing letters to her from now on?!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children shouted in unison, \"We'll keep writing!\"\n\n\"Then...\" A-Xin held up that letter and announced loudly, \"from now on, every year when the phoenix blossoms bloom, we'll write a letter to the future Weixi!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\" The children responded in unison.\n\n\"And,\" Qingqing added, \"we should also make a promise—to accomplish, one by one, everything we write in the letters!\"\n\n\"Yes!\" The children said in unison, \"Write it, and do it!\"\n\n\"Write it, and do it...\" A-Xin repeated those five words, then looked at that letter and smiled softly.\n\n\"Weixi,\" he said in a low voice, \"don't worry. Every letter we write... we'll make come true.\"\n\n\"Because...\" he looked up, \"we're the 'Protect Earth Operations Unit'!\"\n\n\"Okay—!\"\n\nThat year, the phoenix tree bloomed again.\n\nThat year, the children sent out their second letter.\n\nThe letter said: \"Weixi! We've turned 'write it, and do it' into our promise!—A-Xin\"\n\nThe third letter: \"Weixi! Today, I picked up a hundred PET bottles!—A-Xin\"\n\nThe fourth letter: \"Weixi! The sea behind the school is still blue today!—Qingqing\"\n\nThe fifth letter: \"Weixi! My pork bun shop has opened a branch!—Old Wu\"\n\nThe sixth letter...\n\nOne letter, then another.\n\nTime continued forward.\n\nAnd those three words, \"see you tomorrow,\" became the gentlest promise passed down, generation after generation, at Luyang Elementary.\n\nWhat she didn't know was—\n\nIn another era, in the classroom of Luyang Elementary, A-Xin was lying on his desk, staring blankly at the notebook on the table.\n\n\"A-Xin, what are you thinking about?\" Qingqing walked over and asked.\n\n\"I'm thinking...\" A-Xin said, \"I wonder if Weixi is doing well right now.\"\n\n\"She's definitely doing well.\" Qingqing said, \"Because she said the future would get better.\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" A-Xin nodded, \"What she said must be right.\"\n\n\"Oh right,\" Qingqing suddenly asked, \"did you... write a letter yesterday?\"\n\n\"Mhm.\" A-Xin nodded, \"I wrote to Weixi. But...\" he lowered his head, \"I don't even know her address...\"\n\n\"It doesn't matter.\" Qingqing smiled, \"'Letters to the future' don't need an address.\"\n\n\"Really?\" A-Xin asked.\n\n\"Really.\" Qingqing nodded, \"Because the letters we wrote on fair day... must have all been delivered.\"\n\n\"...\" A-Xin looked at that blue sky outside the window and smiled softly.\n\n\"Weixi,\" he said in a low voice, \"you must receive it.\"\n\nTime quietly passed.\n\nOne year. Two years. Three years.\n\nSix years—not long, not short.\n\nLong enough for a sapling to grow into a small tree.\n\nLong enough for a sea to recover its clarity.\n\nAnd long enough for a group of children to grow up.\n\nA-Xin became the president of an environmental club. He led a group of younger students to the beach every month to clean it.\n\n\"President,\" a younger student asked, \"why do you love beach cleanups so much?\"\n\n\"Because...\" A-Xin smiled, \"I promised someone I would pick up every piece of trash on the beach.\"\n\n\"Someone? Who?\"\n\n\"Someone...\" A-Xin looked at the sea, \"an older sister from the future.\"\n\nQingqing got into an environmental protection program in university. Every day, she studied how to make water cleaner.\n\n\"Qingqing,\" the professor looked at her thesis, \"why do you want to study water quality?\"\n\n\"Because...\" Qingqing smiled, \"I promised someone I would keep the sea blue.\"\n\nOld Wu's \"Earth-Saving Pork Bun Shop\" became more and more famous. He used part of the money he earned to plant trees.\n\n\"Boss,\" a customer asked, \"why do you plant trees?\"\n\n\"Because...\" Old Wu said as he kneaded the dough, \"I promised someone I would make this world a little greener.\"\n\nLin Yunyun became an elementary school teacher. She led a group of little kids planting trees on campus.\n\n\"Teacher,\" a little kid asked, \"why do we plant trees?\"\n\n\"Because...\" Lin Yunyun smiled, \"a very important older sister told me—'trees are things that stay.'\"\n\nWang Zhuankai became a comedian. Every time he went on stage, his first line was: \"I promised someone I would keep laughing forever!\"\n\n\"That person...\" he said to the audience on stage, \"is my most important friend in this life!\"\n\nThe children each grew up.\n\nBut no matter where they went, they all remembered the same promise—\n\n\"See you tomorrow.\"\n\nThe phoenix tree at Luyang Elementary bloomed six more times.\n\n\"Protect Earth\" became a tradition known by every student from first grade to sixth grade.\n\n\"I heard that long, long ago,\" a first-grader listened to the older students tell stories, \"an 'older sister from the future' came to our school!\"\n\n\"From the future?!\"\n\n\"Yes! She taught the older students back then so many ways to protect the Earth!\"\n\n\"Really?!\"\n\n\"Really! Look!\" The older student pointed at the woods behind the school, \"Those trees were planted back then! Now they've all grown into big trees!\"\n\n\"Wow...\"\n\n\"And,\" the older student said mysteriously, \"the school's 'Protect Earth' also started back then! Everything we do now was passed down from that time!\"\n\n\"Then... where is that 'older sister from the future' now?\"\n\n\"She...\" the older student looked at the sky, \"she went back to the future. But... she said she would come back!\"\n\n\"Come back?\"\n\n\"Yes! She said—'see you tomorrow'!\"\n\n\"See you tomorrow...\"\n\nThe children looked up at the sky.\n\nThe sky was blue, blue.\n\nSix years later, at Luyang Elementary, the graduation ceremony.\n\n\"Today, we're honoring a very special group of graduates!\" Principal Qiu, holding his teacup, stood on the stage, smiling, \"In sixth grade, they launched 'Protect Earth'!\"\n\n\"Whoa—!\" Applause rose from the audience.\n\n\"This group of children,\" Principal Qiu said, \"used their own hands to make the sea behind the school clean again! With their efforts, 'Protect Earth' became our school's tradition!\"\n\n\"And,\" Principal Qiu continued, \"their story has been written into a book, so more people can know about it!\"\n\n\"Written into a book?!\" The children in the audience stared with wide eyes.\n\n\"Yes!\" Principal Qiu brought out a thick book, \"This book is called 'The Transfer Student from the Future'! It tells their story!\"\n\n\"Wow—!\"\n\n\"But,\" Principal Qiu said mysteriously, \"the last page of the book is blank.\"\n\n\"Blank?\" The children were puzzled.\n\n\"Because,\" Principal Qiu said, \"this story isn't over yet. That 'transfer student from the future' hasn't come back yet.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"But,\" Principal Qiu smiled, \"we'll wait for her. Because... she said—\"\n\n\"'See you tomorrow.'\"\n\n\"See you tomorrow...\" The children repeated those three words.\n\nAfter the graduation ceremony, the \"children\" of Class 6-1 from back then stood at the school gate, looking at that phoenix tree.\n\n\"Time flies,\" A-Xin sighed, \"just like that, six years have passed.\"\n\n\"Yeah.\" Qingqing nodded, \"We've all grown up.\"\n\n\"I went to look at that sea yesterday,\" Old Wu said, \"it's still so blue!\"\n\n\"My 'Little Blue' is taller than the school wall now!\" A-Xin said proudly.\n\n\"My 'Eat-Your-Fill' too!\" Wang Zhuankai followed.\n\n\"Oh right,\" Lin Yunyun suddenly asked, \"do you all... still remember her?\"\n\n\"Of course.\" The children said in unison.\n\n\"How could we forget.\" Qingqing said softly.\n\n\"Then...\" Lin Yunyun lowered her head, \"will she... really come back?\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"Oh right,\" A-Xin suddenly remembered something, \"do you remember? On fair day, the 'letters to the future' we wrote...\"\n\n\"I remember.\" Qingqing nodded, \"We wrote that we wanted the Earth of the future to have a clean sea.\"\n\n\"Then...\" A-Xin said, \"our letters... must have been delivered, right?\"\n\n\"They must have been delivered.\" Qingqing said softly, \"Because... she said, 'letters to the future' do get replies.\"\n\n\"...\" The children fell silent.\n\n\"But...\" Lin Yunyun lowered her head, \"we've never received a reply from her...\"\n\n\"...\" The wind blew gently.\n\n\"It doesn't matter.\" A-Xin smiled, \"Not receiving a reply doesn't mean she didn't receive the letters.\"\n\n\"Right.\" Qingqing nodded, \"As long as the letters were delivered... she must have read them.\"\n\n\"Then...\" Lin Yunyun looked up, \"when she reads the letters... will she think of us?\"\n\n\"She will.\" The children said in unison.\n\n\"She definitely will.\"\n\n\"Because...\" A-Xin looked at the sky, \"she said—\"\n\n\"'See you tomorrow.'\"\n\n\"See you tomorrow...\" The children repeated softly.\n\n\"So,\" A-Xin said loudly, \"tomorrow, she will definitely come back!\"\n\n\"See you tomorrow!\" The children shouted in unison, \"Weixi! See you tomorrow!\"\n\nThe sea breeze blew gently.\n\nAnd in the very, very far future—\n\nA girl was sitting in the yard, reading a letter that had just arrived.\n\n\"To Weixi: Hello! I'm A-Xin! Today, the phoenix tree at Luyang Elementary bloomed again! ...\"\n\nShe read the letter, the corners of her mouth lifting slightly.\n\nThen she put down the letter, looked up at the sky.\n\n\"See you tomorrow,\" she said in a low voice, \"Class 6-1.\"\n\n\"...\" she smiled softly, \"I will definitely see you all again.\"\n\n\"Because...\" she gently pressed her hand to her chest, feeling the warmth of that photo, \"you've always been in my heart.\"\n\nThe wind blew gently.\n\nThe sky of the future was blue, blue.\n\nThe past and the future, in that moment, seemed to be connected as one.\n\n\"See you tomorrow.\"\n\nThe End"}];
